  "A node may be 'pinned' to another node, causing its transform to be computed relative to the target node, meaning it will move and rotate with the target node, but potentially with a relative offset. Note that transform pins can be globally toggled on the toolbar.": "节点可以被\"固定\"到另一个节点，使其变换相对于目标节点计算，即它会随目标节点移动和旋转，但可能带有相对偏移。注意，变换固定可以在工具栏中全局切换。",
