  "Should we bake cubemaps?": "是否烘焙立方体贴图？",
  "Load debug_path_trace_scene_info.dat for RT baked lighting visualization instead of using the current map.": "加载 debug_path_trace_scene_info.dat 以进行 RT 烘焙光照可视化，而不使用当前地图。",
  "%s finished in %d hours %d minutes %d seconds.": "%s 已完成，用时 %d 小时 %d 分 %d 秒。",
  "%s - Sample Lighting": "%s - 采样光照",
  "Must save map to disk before baking light probe volumes.": "烘焙光照探针体积前必须先将地图保存到磁盘。",
  "Creating Ray Trace Pipelines...": "正在创建光线追踪管线...",
  "Preview Lighting %d/%d Vertex Block %i/%i...": "预览光照 %d/%d 顶点块 %i/%i...",
