  "Disable In Low Quality Mode": "在低质量模式下禁用",
  "Use Normals From Base Polygons": "使用基础多边形的法线",
  "When enabled, the normals of the final surface will use the normals from the base polygons of the overlay instead of the normals of the surface that the overlay is being projected onto.": "启用后，最终表面的法线将使用覆盖层基础多边形的法线，而不是覆盖层投影到的表面的法线。",
  "Projection Distance": "投影距离",
  "Material Adjustment Params": "材质调整参数",
  "Project On Backfacing": "投射到背面",
  "Maximum projection angle": "最大投影角度",
  "Specifies the maximum angle difference between the overlay and triangles the overlay will project onto. Value can be between 0 and 180, where 0 means the overlay will only project onto surfaces facing the exact same direction as the overlay, and 180 will allow the overlay to project onto surfaces facing completely the opposite direction.": "指定叠加层与将要投影到的三角形之间的最大角度差。取值范围为 0 到 180：0 表示叠加层只会投影到与叠加层朝向完全相同的表面上，180 则允许投影到朝向完全相反的表面上。",
  "Projection Mode": "投影模式",
