  "Fixup Entity Names By Default": "默认修正实体名称",
  "Map Type": "地图类型",
  "%s (from '%s')": "%s（来自 '%s'）",
  "Generic": "通用",
  "Generic Internal": "通用内部",
  "Citadel": "Citadel",
  "The gameinfo.gi file is missing or incomplete.": "gameinfo.gi 文件缺失或不完整",
  "The 'Hammer' settings section of gameinfo.gi was not found. No game entities will be available for creation.": "未找到 gameinfo.gi 中的 'Hammer' 设置部分。将没有可用于创建的游戏实体。",
  "No game entities will be available for creation.": "将无法创建任何游戏实体。",
  "Updating references to file: %s": "正在更新对文件的引用：%s",
  "Took %0.2f seconds to destroy existing data.": "销毁现有数据耗时 %0.2f 秒。",
  "Took %0.2f seconds to load or copy file data.": "加载或复制文件数据耗时 %0.2f 秒。",
  "Took %0.2f seconds to update %i references": "更新 %i 个引用耗时 %0.2f 秒",
  "Copy of map file %s does not have a valid world. World element handle: %i": "地图文件副本 %s 没有有效的世界。世界元素句柄：%i",
  "Do not load vmf files in hammer, import to a vmap first!": "请勿在 Hammer 中加载 vmf 文件，请先导入为 vmap！",
  "Warning: This vmap file was upconverted from an unspecified format. Talk to a programmer.": "警告：此 vmap 文件是从未指定格式升级而来，请联系程序员",
  "Parameter '%s' corresponds to an entity target name, but is sent to input '%s' on '%s' which is not marked as being a target name. (FGD Error?)": "参数 '%s' 对应一个实体目标名称，但被发送到 '%s' 上未标记为目标名称的输入 '%s'。（FGD 错误？）",
  "Instance": "实例",
  "Tint Color": "着色颜色",
  "If set, the contents of the prefab will not be included in visibility calculations.": "如果设置，Prefab 的内容将不包含在可见性计算中。",
  "Instance %i": "实例 %i",
  "Instance (%i objects)": "实例（%i 个对象）",
  "Prefab": "Prefab",
  "Map File": "地图文件",
  "Specifies the map file whose contents will be referenced by this prefab.": "指定此 Prefab 引用其内容的地图文件。",
  "Target Name": "目标名称",
  "Specifies the name by which the prefab can be referenced by entity i/o. The set of inputs the prefab has is defined by the map relays in the target map.": "指定可通过实体 I/O 引用该 Prefab 的名称。Prefab 拥有的输入集合由目标地图中的地图中继器定义。",
  "Fixup entity names": "修正实体名称",
  "If enabled, any entity target names within the prefab will have a prefix applied to ensure they are unique. This prevents any issues with entities in two different prefabs having name collisions.": "启用后，Prefab 内的任何实体目标名称都将应用前缀以确保唯一。这可防止两个不同 Prefab 中的实体出现名称冲突。",
  "Prefix with Target Name": "以目标名称为前缀",
  "If this is enabled and name fixup is enabled, the prefix used for name fixup will be the prefab target name instead of the unique id. If the target name is empty then the prefab the unique id will still be used as the prefix. Note that if two prefabs use the same target name for their prefix it will be possible to have entities inside the prefabs end up with name collisions.": "如果启用此项且启用了名称修正，名称修正使用的前缀将是 Prefab 目标名称而非唯一 ID。如果目标名称为空，则仍会使用唯一 ID 作为前缀。注意，如果两个 Prefab 使用相同的目标名称作为前缀，则其内部实体可能出现命名冲突。",
  "Load if nested": "嵌套时加载",
  "If enabled the prefab will be loaded when it is the child of another prefab, if disabled, this prefab will not be loaded if it is the child of another prefab.": "如果启用，当该 Prefab 是另一个 Prefab 的子级时将被加载；如果禁用，当该 Prefab 是另一个 Prefab 的子级时将不会被加载。",
  "Create Prefab Runtime Entity": "创建 Prefab 运行时实体",
  "If enabled, there will be a point_prefab entity at runtime representing this prefab as an EntityIO target (requires Relays and a Target Name). Map Relay connections will not be baked, but will instead route through this entity.": "启用后，运行时将有一个 point_prefab 实体将此 Prefab 表示为 EntityIO 目标（需要中继器和目标名称）。地图中的中继连接不会被烘焙，而是通过该实体路由。",
  "Load at runtime": "运行时加载",
  "If enabled the prefab will not be baked into the parent map during map compile, but instead will be dynamically loaded in the game. This requires the target map to be compiled separately. Additionally this requires support for dynamic loading of maps by the game, which may not be supported by all games and game systems. Do not use without checking to see if this is fully supported by the game you are working on.": "启用后，Prefab 在地图编译时不会烘焙到父地图中，而是在游戏中动态加载。这要求目标地图单独编译。此外还要求游戏支持动态加载地图，并非所有游戏和游戏系统都支持。在未确认你正在制作的游戏完全支持此功能之前，请不要使用。",
  "Loading prefab: %s": "正在加载 Prefab：%s",
  "Prefab: %s": "Prefab：%s",
  "Prefab: %i": "Prefab：%i",
  "Using worldspawn entity targetname of 'worldspawn' will not have entity name fixup and might produce confusing results!": "使用 'worldspawn' 作为 worldspawn 实体的 targetname 将不会进行实体名称修正，并可能产生令人困惑的结果！",
  "Transform Contents": "变换内容",
  "Prefab (%s)": "Prefab（%s）",
  "This prefab wants procedural relay connections, but it must have a Runtime Entity to enable this feature!": "此 Prefab 需要程序化中继连接，但必须拥有运行时实体才能启用此功能！",
  "The map properties of this prefab's map specify a targetname of '%s', which is a classname! Please change to avoid using a classname.": "此 Prefab 地图的地图属性指定了目标名 '%s'，而这是一个类名！请更改以避免使用类名。",
  "This prefab wants procedural relay connections, but it must have a targetname to enable this feature!": "此 Prefab 需要程序化中继连接，但必须具有 targetname 才能启用此功能！",
  "No physics for this mesh": "此网格没有物理",
  "Dependent on context, single convex if part of an entity, mesh if world geometry": "视上下文而定，作为实体一部分时为单个凸包，作为世界几何时为网格",
  "Single Convex Hull": "单一凸包",
  "Construct a single convex hull around the entire mesh": "在整个网格周围构建单个凸包",
  "Multiple Convex Hulls": "多凸包",
  "Construct a convex hull for each connected group of faces in the mesh": "为网格中每个相连的面组构建凸包",
  "Construct a physics mesh (polysoup)": "构建物理网格（多边形汤）",
  "Mesh Name": "网格名称",
  "Smoothing Angle": "平滑角度",
  "Physics Type": "物理类型",
  "Collision Property Override": "碰撞属性覆盖",
  "If specified, provides the name of an entry in scripts/collision_properties.txt that specifies the collision group and interaction layers to use, rather than those specified in the material.": "如果指定，将提供 scripts/collision_properties.txt 中某个条目的名称，该条目指定要使用的碰撞组和交互层，而不是材质中指定的设置。",
  "Collision Group Override": "碰撞组覆盖",
  "Directly specifies the name of a collision group to assign to the mesh, replaces any group specified by the material or collision property.": "直接指定要分配给网格的碰撞组名称，替换由材质或碰撞属性指定的任何组。",
  "Additional Interacts As": "额外 Interacts As 设置",
  "Specifies additional interaction layers to append to the set of Interacts As layers assigned to the mesh.": "指定要附加到该网格“交互为”(Interacts As) 层集合的额外交互层。",
  "Additional Interacts With": "额外交互对象",
  "Specifies additional interaction layers to append to the set of Interacts With layers assigned to the mesh.": "指定要追加到该网格“与之交互”层集的额外交互层。",
  "Additional Interacts Exclude": "附加互动排除",
  "Included Detail Layers": "包含的细节层",
  "The only detail layers this mesh belongs to": "此网格所属的细节层",
  "Missing Detail Layers": "缺少细节层",
  "This mesh will not belong to these detail layers": "此网格将不属于这些细节层",
  "Physics Simplification Override": "物理简化覆盖",
  "Physics Simplification Error": "物理简化错误",
  "The two sets of selected edges do not contain the same number of edges: %i != %i": "两组选中的边数量不一致：%i != %i",
  "Cannot merge open edges from the same face": "无法合并来自同一面的开放边",
  "Mesh (%d faces)": "网格（%d 个面）",
  "Polygon Mesh Data Pool - level 1": "多边形网格数据池 - 级别 1",
  "Polygon Mesh Data Pool - level 2": "多边形网格数据池 - 级别 2",
  "Polygon Mesh Data Pool - level 4": "多边形网格数据池 - 4 级",
  "+Parameters": "+参数",
  "Smart Prop": "智能 Prop",
  "Smart Prop File": "Smart Prop 文件",
  "Specifies the smart prop which this object will instantiate": "指定此对象将实例化的智能 Prop",
  "Whole object tint color": "整个对象的着色颜色",
  "A tint color to apply to the entire smart prop. The evaluation of the smart prop receives this color and may use it directly or may modify it before assigning a tint to the individual parts of the smart prop.": "应用于整个智能 Prop 的着色。智能 Prop 的求值会接收此颜色，可直接使用它，也可在为智能 Prop 的各个部分指定着色之前对其进行修改。",
  "Lock Evaluation": "锁定求值",
  "Disable updates from the specified smart prop file.": "禁用来自指定智能模型（Smart Prop）文件的更新",
  "Constrain To Prefab": "约束到 Prefab",
  "If enabled and the smart prop is inside a prefab, the evaluation of the smart prop considers only the contents of the parent prefab, not anything outside the prefab. For example, if enabled, any traces performed by the smart prop will only hit other objects within the parent prefab.": "如果启用且智能模型(Smart Prop)位于 Prefab 内，则智能模型的求值仅考虑父 Prefab 的内容，而不考虑 Prefab 之外的任何内容。例如，启用后，智能模型执行的任何追踪只会命中父 Prefab 内的其他对象。",
  "Input Shapes": "输入形状",
  "Alpha of the fade, where 0 = fully transparent and 255 = fully opaque.": "淡出的 Alpha 值，0 = 完全透明，255 = 完全不透明。",
  "Render Properties": "渲染属性",
  "Cull Distance": "剔除距离",
  "Maximum distance at which individual parts of the prop will be visible. If 0 the setting on individual parts of the smart prop will be used.": "Prop 各部分可见的最大距离。若为 0，则使用智能 Prop 各部分自身的设置。",
  "Fade Start Distance": "淡出开始距离",
  "Distance at which each part of the prop starts to fade. Only applies if Cull Distance > 0. Positive values are absolute values, while negative values are relative to the cull distance. For example Cull Distance = 100, Start Fade Distance = -30 means the object will start fading at 70 units away and will disappear when 100 units away.": "模型各部分开始淡出的距离。仅在剔除距离（Cull Distance）大于 0 时生效。正值是绝对值，负值相对于剔除距离。例如剔除距离 = 100、开始淡出距离 = -30 表示对象在 70 单位外开始淡出，在 100 单位外消失。",
  "Select a an entity to specify a location to sample lighting from, instead of using this entity's bounding box center.": "选择一个实体以指定光照采样位置，而不是使用此实体包围盒的中心。",
  "what type of shadows should be cast from this object.": "此对象应投射何种类型的阴影。",
  "Both Baked and Realtime": "烘焙与实时",
  "Baked Lighting Mode": "烘焙光照模式",
  "Should baked lighting be generated for this object. If default is selected, the choice is left to individual parts.": "是否为此对象生成烘焙光照。如果选择默认，则由各个部分自行决定。",
  "Lightprobed": "已应用光照探针",
  "Lightmapped": "使用光照贴图",
  "Lightmap Scale Bias": "光照贴图缩放偏置",
  "Increase or decrease the resolution of the lightmap applied to this object.": "增大或减小应用到此对象的光照贴图分辨率。",
  "Scale down by 8": "缩小至 1/8",
  "Scale down by 4": "缩小为 1/4",
  "Scale down by 2": "缩小 2 倍",
  "Default (no scale)": "默认（无缩放）",
  "Scale up by 2": "放大 2 倍",
  "Scale up by 4": "放大 4 倍",
  "Scale up by 8": "放大 8 倍",
  "Bake Lighting As If Double-Sided": "按双面烘焙光照",
  "Bake lighting as if this were double-sided geometry. Useful on geometry with pre-culled backfaces whose neighbors have lighting errors caused by saw-too-many-backfaces sample invalidation.": "将光照按双面几何体烘焙。适用于背面已被预剔除、且相邻面因背面采样过多导致采样失效而产生光照错误的几何体。",
  "Allow models in the smart prop to emit lighting": "允许智能 Prop 中的模型发出光照",
  "Emissive Boost": "自发光增强",
  "Used to boost emissive lighting from models. Note that boosting emissive on smaller areas can create more lighting artifacts/noise.": "用于增强模型的自发光光照。注意，在较小区域增强自发光可能产生更多光照瑕疵/噪点。",
  "Collisions": "碰撞",
  "Specifies how collision shapes are to generated.": "指定如何生成碰撞形状。",
  "Build Settings": "构建设置",
  "Not Solid": "非固体",
  "Use VPhysics": "使用 VPhysics",
  "Vis Occluder": "可见性遮挡体",
  "If true this geometry is used as an occluder for precomputed visibility": "若为真，此几何体将用作预计算可见性的遮挡体",
  "Render To Cubemaps": "渲染到立方体贴图",
  "If true, this geometry renders into baked cube maps": "若为真，此几何体将渲染到烘焙的立方体贴图中",
  "Disable in low quality mode": "在低画质模式下禁用",
  "Do not render when using the lowest quality video settings. This object is a non-essential detail.": "使用最低画质设置时不渲染。此对象为非必要细节。",
  "Bake To World": "烘焙到世界",
  "If true this geometry will be baked into the world geometry of the map so that the model is not referenced at runtime.": "如果为 true，此几何体将被烘焙到地图的世界几何体中，从而在运行时不再引用该模型。",
  "Disable Merging": "禁用合并",
  "If true this will not be merged with other geometry during map compile (reduces rendering efficiency).": "如果为真，则编译地图时不会与其他几何体合并（会降低渲染效率）。",
  "Render with Dynamic Objects": "与动态对象一起渲染",
  "Render this object with other dynamic objects": "将此对象与其他动态对象一起渲染",
  "Smart Prop (%s)": "智能模型 (%s)",
  "Smart Prop evaluation currently locked. Un-check 'Lock Evaluation' in the object properties to enable updates for this smart prop.": "智能模型(Smart Prop)求值当前已锁定。请在对象属性中取消勾选“锁定求值(Lock Evaluation)”以启用此智能模型的更新。",
  "Smart Prop cannot be updated because the smart prop definition file '%s' could not be found.": "无法更新智能模型，因为找不到智能模型定义文件 '%s'。",
  "Smart Prop update disabled because the definition file '%s' version has changed. Select 'Update To Current Version' in the object properties to re-evaluate using the new version.": "智能模型更新已禁用，因为定义文件\"%s\"的版本已更改。请在对象属性中选择\"更新到当前版本\"，以使用新版本重新求值。",
  "Unnamed Group %i": "未命名组 %i",
  "Deformer": "变形器",
  "Base Size": "基础尺寸",
  "Specifies the size of the volume of space to be deformed.": "指定要变形的体积空间大小。",
  "Deformer %i": "变形器 %i",
  "Deformation Mode": "变形模式",
  "Deform Children": "变形子对象",
  "Group (%d objects)": "群组（%d 个对象）",
