  "Material Shading": "材质着色",
  "Steam Audio Data": "Steam Audio 数据",
  "Probe Type": "探针类型",
  "Type of probes to filter for visualization.": "要过滤以供可视化的探针类型。",
  "Reverb Probe": "混响探针",
  "Pathing Probe": "寻路探针",
  "Occlusion Probe": "遮挡探针",
  "Dimensions Probe": "尺寸探测器",
  "Materials Probe": "材质探针",
  "Render Probe Radius": "渲染探针半径",
  "Flag to choose whether to render influence radius of the probe.": "标志位，用于选择是否渲染探针的影响半径。",
  "Show Clustered Probes Only": "仅显示分簇探针",
  "Flag to choose whether to render the clustered probes.": "选择是否渲染聚簇探针的标志。",
  "Source Probe Index": "源探针索引",
  "Index for source probe when visualizing source dependent data. Editing disabled for listener-centric data like baked reverb.": "可视化依赖声源数据时源探针的索引。对于以听者为中心的数据（如烘焙混响），编辑已被禁用。",
  "Steam Audio: No data set to create reverb probe nodes!": "Steam Audio：没有可用于创建混响探针节点的数据！",
  "Steam Audio: No data set to create pathing probe nodes!": "Steam Audio：没有可用于创建寻路探针节点的数据！",
  "Steam Audio: No data set to create occlusion probe nodes!": "Steam Audio：没有可用于创建遮挡探测器节点的数据！",
  "Steam Audio: No data set to create materials probe nodes!": "Steam Audio：没有可用于创建材质探针节点的数据！",
  "Steam Audio Imported Probe Box": "Steam Audio 导入的探针盒",
  "Band (Low)": "频带（低）",
  "Property for low frequency band.": "低频波段的属性。",
  "Band (Mid)": "频带（中频）",
  "Band (High)": "频段（高）",
  "Property for Ambisonic Order 0.": "Ambisonic 阶数 0 的属性。",
  "Channel 1": "通道 1",
  "Property for Ambisonic Order 1.": "Ambisonic 阶数 1 的属性。",
  "Channel 2": "通道 2",
  "Channel 3": "通道 3",
  "Material 0": "材质 0",
  "Most active material around a probe.": "探针周围最活跃的材质。",
  "Material 0 Weight": "材质 0 权重",
  "Weight for the most active material around a probe.": "探针周围最活跃材质的权重。",
  "Material 1": "材质 1",
  "2nd most active material around a probe.": "探针周围第二活跃的材质。",
  "Material 1 Weight": "材质 1 权重",
  "Weight for the 2nd most active material around a probe.": "探测器周围第二活跃材质的权重。",
  "Material 2": "材质 2",
  "3rd most active material around a probe.": "探针周围第三活跃的材质。",
  "Material 2 Weight": "材质 2 权重",
  "Impulse Response for Ambisonic Channel 0.": "Ambisonic 通道 0 的脉冲响应。",
  "Type of data stored inside the probe.": "探针内存储的数据类型。",
  "Probe Index": "探针索引",
  "Index of the probe.": "探针的索引",
  "Cluster Index": "簇索引",
  "Index of the cluster which the probe belongs to and looks up reverb from.": "探针所属并从中查找混响的簇的索引。",
  "Movable Reverb Index": "可移动混响索引",
  "Index of the movable volume within which the probe exists.": "探针所在的移动体积的索引。",
  "Probe Radius": "探针半径",
  "Influence radius of the probe.": "探针的影响半径。",
  "Reverb Times": "混响时间",
  "RT60 for low, mid, and high frequency bands for the probe.": "探针的低、中、高频段 RT60。",
  "Reverb IR": "混响脉冲响应",
  "Reverb impulse response for the probe.": "此探针的混响脉冲响应",
  "Live Audition": "实时试听",
  "Updates the paramter of the active probe on the mix graph.": "更新混合图表上活动探针的参数。",
  "Reverb Scales": "混响缩放",
  "Reverb scale for low, mid, and high frequency bands for the probe.": "探针的低、中、高频段混响缩放。",
  "Pathing Ceofficients": "寻路系数",
  "Pathing coefficients for 1st order Ambisonics.": "一阶 Ambisonics 的寻路系数。",
  "Pathing EQ": "寻路均衡器",
  "Pathing EQ for low, mid, and high frequency bands.": "低、中、高频段的寻路 EQ。",
  "Pathing Distance Ratio": "寻路距离比",
  "Ratio between shortest distance and pathing distance between the probes.": "探针之间最短距离与寻路距离的比值",
  "Pathing Direction": "寻路方向",
  "Direction of the path reaching the probe.": "到达探针的路径方向。",
  "Occlusion Value": "遮挡值",
  "Occlusion value between the source and selected probe.": "声源与所选探针之间的遮挡值。",
  "Occlusion Deviation": "遮挡偏差",
  "Occlusion path deviation between the source and selected probe.": "声源与所选探针之间的遮挡路径偏差。",
  "Occlusion Path Ratio": "遮挡路径比率",
  "Occlusion path ratio of direct path over shortest path between the source and selected probe.": "声源与所选探针之间直达路径与最短路径的遮挡比率。",
  "Occlusion Reflection Energy": "遮挡反射能量",
  "Total indirect reflection energy between the source and selected probe.": "声源与所选探针之间的总间接反射能量",
  "Dimensions InOut Fraction": "内外尺寸比例",
  "Higher the fraction, more open the space around the probe.": "该比例越高，探针周围的空间越开阔。",
  "Dimensions Size": "尺寸大小",
  "Estimated size of the space around the probe.": "探针周围空间的估计大小。",
  "Outside Direction Field": "外部方向场",
  "Ambisonics field of how to reach to nearby outside probes.": "表示如何到达附近外部探针的 Ambisonics 场。",
  "Inside Small Direction Field": "内部小方向场",
  "Ambisonics field of how to reach to nearby inside probes in small spaces.": "描述在狭小空间中如何到达附近内部探针的 Ambisonics 场。",
  "Material Values": "材质值",
  "Set As Source": "设为声源",
  "Set the probe as source.": "将探针设为声源。",
  "Show Compressed IR": "显示压缩脉冲响应(IR)",
  "If checked, decompress and show compressed reverb IRs.": "勾选后，解压并显示已压缩的混响 IR。",
  "Outside Distance: %0.2f": "外部距离：%0.2f",
  "Inside Distance: %0.2f": "内部距离：%0.2f",
  "Steam Audio Imported Probe": "Steam Audio 导入探针",
  "<unassigned>": "<未分配>",
  "# OBJ file exported from Hammer": "# 由 Hammer 导出的 OBJ 文件",
  "Interpolation": "插值",
  "B-Spline": "B 样条",
  "Lattice Control Point": "晶格控制点",
  "Lattice Deformer": "晶格变形器",
  "Divisions (X)": "细分 (X)",
  "Divisions (Y)": "分段数（Y）",
  "Divisions (Z)": "分段数 (Z)",
  "Y-Axis": "Y 轴",
  "Z-Axis": "Z 轴",
  "Simple Deformer": "简单变形器",
  "Deformation Axis": "变形轴",
  "Specifies the local space axis which the deformer will bend around.": "指定变形器绕其弯曲的局部空间轴。",
  "Bend Angle": "弯曲角度",
  "Specifies the angle of bend to apply in degrees. Range is [ -360, 360 ]. Negative values cause the bend to occur in the opposite direction.": "指定要应用的弯曲角度（度）。范围为 [ -360, 360 ]。负值会使弯曲朝相反方向发生。",
  "Bend Point": "弯曲点",
  "0 to 1 value specifying the location on the local x-axis of the deformer around which the bend will occur. A value of 0 means the bend will occur around the minimum end of the deformer, a value of 1 means the bend will occur around the maximum end of the deformer, a value of 0.5 means the bend will occur at the center of the deformer volume.": "0 到 1 之间的值，指定弯曲围绕变形器本地 x 轴上的位置。0 表示弯曲围绕变形器最小端进行，1 表示围绕最大端，0.5 表示在变形器体积中心进行。",
  "Bend Radius": "弯曲半径",
  "Specifies the radius of the bend. When the value is 0, the radius is automatically calculated to preserve the length of the deformer volume for the specified angle. If an explict radius is specified then the inside edge of the bend will match this radius for all angle values, however this will result the the deformer changing the length of its contents.": "指定弯曲的半径。当值为 0 时，将自动计算半径以保持指定角度下变形器体积的长度。如果显式指定半径，则弯曲的内边缘在所有角度值下都将匹配此半径，但这会导致变形器改变其内容物的长度。",
  "Specifies the target path which defines the deformation that is applied.": "指定定义所应用变形的目标路径。",
  "Specifies the [ 0, 1 ] parameter along the path where the deformer will start.": "指定变形器沿路径开始处的 [ 0, 1 ] 参数。",
  "Start": "开始",
  "Specifies the [ 0, 1 ] parameter along the path where the deformer will end.": "指定变形器沿路径结束的 [ 0, 1 ] 参数位置。",
  "End": "结束",
  "Specifies allowed amount of error used when determining how many segments to use int he deformer. Represents a percentage of the length of the target path.": "指定确定形变器使用多少分段时所允许的误差量。表示目标路径长度的百分比。",
  "Curve Fit Error Tolerance": "曲线拟合误差容差",
  "Path Deformer": "路径变形器",
  "Unable to assign light (%s) <%i> [%s @ %.1f %.1f %.1f] a baked shadow index: has %i overlaps (%i without slots), no available shadow slots": "无法为光源 (%s) <%i> [%s @ %.1f %.1f %.1f] 分配烘焙阴影索引：有 %i 个重叠（%i 个没有空位），没有可用的阴影槽位",
  "Assigned %d Light Shadow Slots, %i failed (max slot %i).": "已分配 %d 个光照阴影槽，%i 个失败（最大槽位 %i）。",
  "Single Hull": "单凸包",
  "Hull Per Mesh": "每网格凸包",
  "Hull Per Element": "每个元素的凸包",
  "help text for String": "字符串的帮助文本",
  "Integer": "整数",
  "Choice A": "选项 A",
  "Choice B": "选项 B",
  "Choice C": "选项 C",
  "help text for Float": "浮点数的帮助文本",
  "Range": "范围",
  "help text for material name": "材质名称的帮助文本",
  "Test Enum": "测试枚举",
  "help text for Test Enum!": "测试枚举的帮助文本！",
  "Array of Int": "整数数组",
