  "There is no player start in the map. To add one, select the Entity tool, drag the crosshairs to the position you want the player to start at, and press ENTER.": "地图中没有玩家起点。要添加一个，请选择实体工具，将十字线拖动到你希望玩家起始的位置，然后按 ENTER。",
  "No player start.": "没有玩家起点。",
