  "Offset Angles": "偏移角度",
  "Should the pin apply to the angles of this node. If disabled this node will only translate with the target node, its rotation will be unaffected by the rotation of node it is pinned to.": "钉扎(Pin)是否应用于此节点的角度。如果禁用，此节点只会随目标节点平移，其旋转不受所钉扎节点旋转的影响。",
  "Pin Angles": "图钉角度",
  "If enabled, transforming this node will transform the target node such that the relative offset is maintained, essentially locking the transform of the two objects together regardless of which one is edited. Normally when this is disabled, moving this object will not affect the target node and will instead update the pin offset values.": "启用后，变换此节点将同时变换目标节点以保持相对偏移不变，实质上是将两个对象的变换锁定在一起，无论编辑哪一个。通常在禁用时，移动此对象不会影响目标节点，而是更新固定偏移值。",
