  "Selected edge set must form a line or loop, the selection cannot contain branching edges": "选中的边集必须构成一条线或一个环，选择不能包含分支边",
  "Closed edges must belong to the same face and their vertices must be connected by other edges": "闭合边必须属于同一个面，且它们的顶点必须由其他边连接",
  "Face was successfully added": "面添加成功",
  "Face did not have enough at least 3 vertices.": "面的顶点数不足 3 个。",
  "Face specified an edge which already had two faces attached.": "面指定的边已连接两个面。",
  "Face specified a vertex which had edges attached, but none that were open.": "面指定的顶点已连接边，但没有一条是开放边",
  "Face specified two edges that are connected by a vertex but have or more existing edges separating them.": "面指定的两条边由一个顶点连接，但它们之间已有两条或更多现有边分隔。",
  "Allocation of the face failed (not a topology failure).": "面分配失败（非拓扑错误）。",
  "Failed to allocate mesh edges for mesh, maximum edge count %i has been reached.": "无法为网格分配网格边，已达到最大边数 %i。",
  "Requested Blend Weight Limit of %d is too large, setting to system max of %d": "请求的混合权重上限 %d 过大，将设置为系统最大值 %d",
  "Mesh contains %d blend weights per vertex;  truncating to %d": "网格每个顶点含 %d 个混合权重；将截断为 %d",
  "Using 16-bit blend indices": "使用 16 位混合索引",
  "CMesh Cannot create packed input layout, because the bone indices are out of range (0x%X)": "CMesh 无法创建打包输入布局，因为骨骼索引超出范围 (0x%X)",
  "Failed to setup Embree scene!": "设置 Embree 场景失败！",
  "Failed to load document kv3 data: %s": "加载文档 kv3 数据失败：%s",
  "No root node - malformed document?": "无根节点 - 文档格式有误？",
  "Failed to serialize document state to kv3 data.": "无法将文档状态序列化为 kv3 数据。",
  "Cannot add node before root: %s": "无法在根节点前添加节点：%s",
  "Node '%s' not allowed in this document type (%s)": "节点“%s”不允许出现在此文档类型中（%s）",
  "Cannot add multiple instances of singleton node type: %s": "无法添加单例节点类型的多个实例：%s",
  "Node cannot be added with invalid name: %s": "无法添加名称无效的节点：%s",
  "Cannot add node with duplicate name: %s (Namespace '%s')": "无法添加名称重复的节点：%s（命名空间 '%s'）",
  "Node": "节点",
  "Failed to copy node '%s'": "无法复制节点 '%s'",
  "Import Scale": "导入缩放",
  "No meshes selected": "未选择网格",
  "%s (mesh %i/%i): %d joint weights per vertex, max %d": "%s（网格 %i/%i）：每顶点 %d 个关节权重，最大 %d",
  "Pick the source mesh file": "选择源网格文件",
  "Reference to a content file that will resolve to one or more render meshes. (Plus additional document nodes such as skeleton bones etc.)": "指向内容文件的引用，将解析为一个或多个渲染网格（以及骨架骨骼等附加文档节点）",
  "Reference to a content file that will append its contents to a parent render mesh file node.": "对内容文件的引用，其内容将附加到父渲染网格文件节点。",
  "Reference to an existing render mesh file node that will append its contents to a parent render mesh file node.": "对现有渲染网格文件节点的引用，会将其内容附加到父渲染网格文件节点。",
  "RenderMeshFile Node": "RenderMeshFile 节点",
  "INVALID SUBTYPE!": "无效子类型！",
  "Add %1": "添加 %1",
  "Add %1...": "添加 %1...",
  "Anim": "动画",
  "Bone": "骨骼",
  "Attachment": "挂点",
  "Feet": "脚部",
  "Configs": "配置",
  "Node Name": "节点名称",
  "Folders must be the child of another node": "文件夹必须是其他节点的子节点",
  "Parent node type is not a valid node type for this node": "父节点类型不是此节点的有效节点类型",
  "Child cannot be an ancestor of its parent": "子节点不能是其父节点的祖先",
  "Selection [%d nodes]": "选择 [%d 个节点]",
  "Archetype": "原型",
  "Primary Associated Entity": "主关联实体",
  "Anim Graph Name": "动画图名称",
  "Skeleton component.": "骨骼组件。",
  "Do Not Discard": "不丢弃",
  "New bone name:": "新骨骼名称：",
  "Viewing All Source Meshes": "正在查看所有源网格",
  "Default to old body ordering for now": "暂时默认使用旧的身体排序",
  "Shape List": "形状列表",
  "Bodies are ordered the way their shapes appear in the shape list": "刚体按其形状在形状列表中出现的顺序排列",
  "Bone Depth": "骨骼深度",
  "Bodies are ordered by bone depth (root bone body is first)": "刚体按骨骼深度排序（根骨骼刚体排第一）",
  "Global Prefab List": "全局 Prefab 列表",
  "Aggressive": "激进",
  "Leaf Only": "仅叶节点",
  "Default Root Bone Name": "默认根骨骼名称",
  "Leave Body Collision Unmodified": "保持身体碰撞不变",
  "Body Order": "身体排序",
  "How should the bodies, created by these shapes, be ordered in the final model": "由这些形状创建的刚体在最终模型中应如何排序",
  "Softbody": "软体",
  "Stiffness on Ragdoll": "布娃娃刚度",
  "Game Motion Smoothing": "游戏运动平滑",
  "Cloth Sleep Enabled": "启用布料休眠",
  "Immovable Hint": "不可移动提示",
  "Cloth Per-Bone Constraint Scale": "布料每骨骼约束缩放",
  "Enable Empty Model": "启用空模型",
  "Optimize for Keychains": "针对 Keychain 优化",
  "Bone Cull Type": "骨骼剔除类型",
  "Primary Root Bone": "主根骨骼",
  "If the model has multiple root level bones, the primary root bone can be specified here, which will ensure the specified bone is the first bone in the skeleton.": "如果模型有多个根级骨骼，可在此指定主根骨骼，以确保指定骨骼是骨架中的第一个骨骼。",
  "Bone '%s' is specified as the primary root bone, but is not a root level bone.": "骨骼“%s”被指定为主根骨骼，但不是根级骨骼。",
  "Cannot string prefix from bone '%s' - no name remaining!": "无法从骨骼 '%s' 取字符串前缀 - 没有剩余名称！",
  "Cannot strip prefix from bone '%s', bone '%s' already exists in the bind pose": "无法从骨骼“%s”移除前缀，绑定姿态中已存在骨骼“%s”",
  "Cannot strip prefix from bone '%s', bone '%s' already exists in the mesh": "无法从骨骼 '%s' 中剥离前缀，骨骼 '%s' 已存在于网格中",
  "WARNING: No 'models_ModelDocGameData' FGD was specified in the 'ModelDoc' section of gameinfo.gi.": "警告：gameinfo.gi 的 'ModelDoc' 部分未指定 'models_ModelDocGameData' FGD",
  "%s is not a valid breakable piece name.": "%s 不是有效的破碎部件名称。",
  "%s on any hitboxes or physics bodies. This part won't be destructible by damage.": "在任何判定箱或物理刚体上的 %s。此部件不会因伤害而破坏。",
  "%s on physics bodies (exists on hitboxes though). Destroying this part will still leave collision active.": "%s 位于物理刚体上（命中盒上存在）。销毁此部件后碰撞仍会保持。",
  "Duplicate hit group (%s) specified in destructible parts system data.  Please fix.": "可破坏部件系统数据中指定了重复的受击组（%s）。请修复。",
  "Duplicate model key: %s": "重复的模型键：%s",
  "Mesh Filter Affects Duplicate Input Mesh Names, %s -> %s": "网格过滤器影响重复的输入网格名称，%s -> %s",
  "Child Mesh Mesh cannot be empty": "子网格的网格不能为空",
  "Duplicate child mesh name": "子网格名称重复",
  "Unexpected skinning defined on mesh %s": "网格 %s 上定义了意外的蒙皮",
  "Skinned": "蒙皮",
  "Unskinned": "未蒙皮",
  "Mixing skinned and unskinned meshes in model: %s meshes: %s": "模型中混合了蒙皮与未蒙皮网格：%s 网格：%s",
  "%s: %d parts": "%s：%d 个部件",
  "%s: Excluding %d parts": "%s：排除 %d 个部件",
  "Discards all skeleton information (bones and vertex skinning data) from the parent node": "丢弃父节点中的所有骨架信息（骨骼和顶点蒙皮数据）",
  "Bones": "骨骼",
  "List of bones": "骨骼列表",
  "Removes the named bone and any children from the parent node, any skinning weights are reassigned to the parent bone": "从父节点移除指定骨骼及其所有子骨骼，蒙皮权重将被重新分配给父骨骼",
  "Internal Error (mismatched mesh and bindpose)": "内部错误（网格与绑定姿势不匹配）",
  "Removes the named bone but keeps all children and descendent bones. When the specified bone has skin weights, the weights will be transferred to the bone's parent.  In the case of skin weights and no parent bone, the skin weights will be distributed amongst the bone's children. If there are skin weights and no parent or child bones, then the mesh will have no bones and no skinning.": "移除指定骨骼但保留其所有子骨骼和后代骨骼。当指定骨骼具有蒙皮权重时，权重将转移到其父骨骼。若有蒙皮权重但没有父骨骼，权重将分配给其子骨骼。若既有蒙皮权重又无父骨骼或子骨骼，则网格将没有骨骼且无蒙皮。",
  "Remove bones that are not present in this allow-list.": "移除此允许列表中不存在的骨骼。",
  "Removes all bones from the parent node that do not have any verticies skinned to them": "从父节点移除所有没有顶点蒙皮到其上的骨骼",
  "Renames all bone names to lowercase versions of themselves": "将所有骨骼名称重命名为其小写版本",
  "Bone '%s' already existed in the bind pose": "骨骼 '%s' 已存在于绑定姿势中",
  "Bone '%s' already existed in the mesh": "骨骼 '%s' 已存在于网格中",
  "Force the worldspace position of unweighted bones.": "强制未加权骨骼的世界空间位置",
  "Angle": "角度",
  "Target Bone": "目标骨骼",
  "New Parent Bone": "新父骨骼",
  "Cannot find bone named '%s' in file: %s": "在文件中找不到名为 '%s' 的骨骼：%s",
  "Cannot find bone named '%s' in parent node's data": "在父节点数据中找不到名为“%s”的骨骼",
  "Cannot find parent bone named '%s' in file: %s": "在文件 %s 中找不到名为 '%s' 的父骨骼",
  "Cannot find parent bone named '%s' in parent node's data.": "在父节点的数据中找不到名为 '%s' 的父骨骼。",
  "Realign the target bone in the bindpose and counteract the transformation later in the animation compiler": "在绑定姿势中重新对齐目标骨骼，并在动画编译器中稍后抵消该变换",
  "Counteract Animation": "抵消动画",
  "Rename bones by replacing a given prefix.": "通过替换指定前缀来重命名骨骼。",
  "Prefix to Match": "匹配前缀",
  "Replacement": "替换",
  "Allow Non-Matching Bones": "允许不匹配的骨骼",
  "Bone '%s' doesn't match required prefix '%s'": "骨骼“%s”不符合必需的前缀“%s”",
  "Bone '%s' cannot remove prefix '%s' - no name remaining!": "骨骼 '%s' 无法移除前缀 '%s'——没有剩余名称！",
  "Skin all the geometry in this mesh to a single bone.": "将此网格中的所有几何体蒙皮到单个骨骼。",
  "Bone name": "骨骼名称",
  "Sets all elements in a vector (or float) stream to a single value": "将向量（或浮点）流中的所有元素设为单一值",
  "Stream Name": "流名称",
  "Cannot override stream '%s' - unsupported type '%s'": "无法覆盖流 '%s' - 不支持的类型 '%s'",
  "Remove a data stream (position, uv, etc.) from a mesh by name": "按名称从网格中移除数据流（位置、UV 等）",
  "Rename a data stream (position, uv, etc.) on a mesh - fails if the name is already present": "重命名网格上的数据流（position、uv 等）——若名称已存在则失败",
  "From Name": "源名称",
  "To Name": "目标名称",
  "Copy bone positions into vertex stream for use in foliage animation shader": "将骨骼位置复制到顶点流中以供植被动画着色器使用",
  "Computes wrinkle map values for morphs": "为变形计算褶皱贴图值",
  "Compress Scale": "压缩缩放",
  "Stretch Scale": "拉伸缩放",
  "No Morph Data on mesh, cannot compute or modify wrinkle map data": "网格上没有变形(Morph)数据，无法计算或修改褶皱贴图数据",
  "Overwriting existing wrinkle map data on mesh": "正在覆盖网格上已有的褶皱贴图数据",
  "Scales existing wrinkle map values on morphs": "缩放变形上现有的褶皱贴图值",
  "No Morph Data on mesh, cannot modify wrinkle map data": "网格上没有变形数据，无法修改褶皱贴图数据",
  "Computes Bent Normals": "计算弯曲法线",
  "Two Sided (Foliage)": "双面（植被）",
  "Compute AO": "计算 AO",
  "Simplification node.": "简化节点。",
  "Simplify Params": "简化参数",
  "Target Triangle Percent": "目标三角形百分比",
  "Maximum Error Percent": "最大误差百分比",
  "Attribute-Aware Simplification": "属性感知简化",
  "Normal Attribute Simplification Weight": "法线属性简化权重",
  "UV Attribute Simplification Weight": "UV 属性简化权重",
  "Joint Weight Attribute Simplification Weight": "关节权重属性简化权重",
  "Color Attribute Simplification Weight": "颜色属性简化权重",
  "Regularize Faces": "规整化面",
  "Recompute Vertices": "重新计算顶点",
  "Prune pieces < error threshold": "修剪部件 < 误差阈值",
  "Remove Small Components": "移除小组件",
  "Small Component Size Percent": "小组件尺寸百分比",
  "Weld Vertices before simplifying": "简化前焊接顶点",
  "Weld Position Tolerance": "焊接位置容差",
  "[DEBUG] Visualize Simplification Edges": "[调试] 可视化简化边",
  "[ADVANCED] Simplify Across Seams": "[高级] 跨接缝简化",
  "[ADVANCED] Lock Border": "[高级] 锁定边界",
  "Unknown vertex attribute to weight: %s": "未知的加权顶点属性：%s",
  "Mesh has %i > %i floats of attributes, unable to apply all weightings.": "网格具有 %i > %i 个浮点属性，无法应用全部权重。",
  "Generates anchor bones based on the specified vertex attribute.  Each vertex with a non-zero value in the vertex attribute will be skinned to a generated anchor bone.  The generated anchor bones will all be parented to the specified root bone which will be created if it does not exist.": "根据指定的顶点属性生成锚点骨骼。顶点属性中值非零的每个顶点都将蒙皮到生成的锚点骨骼。生成的锚点骨骼都将父子化到指定的根骨骼，如果该骨骼不存在则会创建它。",
  "Root Bone Name": "根骨骼名称",
  "The name of the bone which all generated anchor bones will be parented to.  If it doesn't exist it will be created with no parent.": "所有生成的锚定骨骼将父级到此骨骼名称。如果该骨骼不存在，将创建一个无父级的骨骼。",
  "Vertex Attribute": "顶点属性",
  "The vertex attribute on the mesh which will indicate which vertices get a generated anchor bone.  It's expected to be a float value per-vertex.  A value of 0 leaves the vertex unaffected.  A non-zero value means an anchor bone will be generated for that vertex and the vertex will be skinned to that anchor bone.": "网格上用于指示哪些顶点生成锚定骨骼的顶点属性。预期为每顶点浮点值。值为 0 表示顶点不受影响。非零值表示将为该顶点生成锚定骨骼，且该顶点将蒙皮到该锚定骨骼。",
  "No root bone name specified": "未指定根骨骼名称",
  "Cannot Find \"%s\" Stream On Mesh": "在网格上找不到 \\\"%s\\\" 流",
  "Cannot Find \"%s\" Vertex Map On Mesh": "在网格上找不到 \\\"%s\\\" 顶点贴图",
  "Anchor Bone \"%s\" Already Exists In Mesh": "锚点骨骼\\\"%s\\\"已存在于网格中",
  "Unexpected Index Adding \"%s\", Expected %d, Got %d": "添加“%s”时索引异常，预期 %d，实际 %d",
  "No Non-Zero Vertices In Vertex Map \"%s\"": "顶点贴图 \\\"%s\\\" 中无非零顶点",
  "Couldn't Find Or Add \"%s\" Bone": "找不到或无法添加 \\\"%s\\\" 骨骼",
  "Different Indices On Mesh vs Bind Pose For \"%s\" Bone": "网格与绑定姿势中 \\\"%s\\\" 骨骼的索引不一致",
  "Different Indices On Mesh vs Bind Pose For \"%s\" Added Anchor Bone": "\"%s\" 在网格与绑定姿势上的索引不同，已添加锚定骨骼",
  "Only Shadows": "仅阴影",
  "Render mesh markup data": "渲染网格标记数据",
  "Material Search Path": "材质搜索路径",
  "Use Expensive Tangents": "使用高开销切线",
  "Use High Precision/Expensive Texcoords": "使用高精度/高开销纹理坐标",
  "Use High Precision Blend Weights": "使用高精度混合权重",
  "Use for faces": "用于面",
  "Calculate Per-Vertex Curvature": "计算逐顶点曲率",
  "Favor higher density in mesh UV density calculation": "在网格 UV 密度计算中优先考虑更高密度",
  "Skin Parented Transforms": "蒙皮父级变换",
  "Any meshes in the rendermesh file which have no skinning will skinned to their transform and that transform will be made into a bone.  Has no effect unless the model has animation": "渲染网格文件中未参与蒙皮的网格将绑定到其变换，并将该变换创建为骨骼。模型没有动画时无效",
  "Use UV2 for Lightmap Charting": "使用 UV2 进行光照贴图分图",
  "Will use the second uv channel in the model to generate lightmap uvs.  This can help improve the quality of lightmap uvs by providing a better unwrap that has fewer shards and generates fewer charts.": "将使用模型中的第二个 UV 通道生成光照贴图 UV。这有助于提升光照贴图 UV 的质量，其展开效果更好、碎片更少且生成的图表更少。",
  "Render Mode": "渲染模式",
  "Blend Weights Per Vertex": "每顶点混合权重",
  "Specifies the maximum number of blend weights per vertex on this mesh": "指定此网格每个顶点的最大混合权重数",
  "Suppress Joint Weight Count Warnings": "抑制关节数量警告",
  "Suppress warnings regarding the joint weight count per vertex exceeding allowable maximums. Those meshes already get the renormalized largest weights up to the maximum count.": "忽略每顶点关节权重数超过允许上限的警告。这些网格已经过重新归一化，保留最大的权重直至最大数量。",
  "Close Outline at Hard Edges": "在硬边缘处闭合轮廓",
  "If using NPR Outlines, add additional triangles at hard edges so the mesh doesn't separate when pushed outwards along the normal": "如果使用 NPR 描边，将在硬边上添加额外三角形，以免网格沿法线向外推出时分离",
  "Unknown bone '%s'": "未知骨骼 '%s'",
  "Parent Bone": "父骨骼",
  "For a ragdoll or other articulated physics: the bone this shape is rigidly linked with. (All shapes referencing the same bone are merged into a single body.)": "对于布娃娃或其他铰接物理：此形状刚性连接到的骨骼。（引用同一骨骼的所有形状将合并为单个刚体。）",
  "Surface Property": "表面属性",
  "What material this object is made of. Used for mass calculations, impact effects, surface decals, sounds, etc.": "此对象由何种材质构成。用于质量计算、冲击效果、表面贴花、声音等。",
  "Collision Property": "碰撞属性",
  "(Advanced Feature) Used to specify special interaction rules or exclusions. References a name in scripts/collision_properties.txt.": "（高级功能）用于指定特殊交互规则或排除项。引用 scripts/collision_properties.txt 中的名称。",
  "Tool Material": "工具材质",
  "(Debug Feature) Used to draw collision with the same material in Physics Debugger as in Hammer.": "（调试功能）用于在物理调试器中与 Hammer 使用相同材质绘制碰撞。",
  "Hit Group": "命中组",
  "Pick the target bone:": "选择目标骨骼：",
  "Recenter On Parent Bone": "相对父骨骼重新居中",
  "<font color='darkred'><strong>Off:</strong></font> Maintain the relative translation and rotation between the source file origin and the parent bone's bind pose.<br><font color='darkgreen'><strong>On:</strong></font> Realign the translation and rotation of the source file to match the parent bone exactly.<br><br><em>(NOTE: The 'Offset Origin' and 'Offset Angle' are applied in either case.)</em>": "<font color='darkred'><strong>关闭：</strong></font> 保持源文件原点与父骨骼绑定姿势之间的相对平移和旋转。<br><font color='darkgreen'><strong>开启：</strong></font> 重新调整源文件的平移和旋转以完全匹配父骨骼。<br><br><em>（注意：两种情况下都会应用 'Offset Origin' 和 'Offset Angle'。）</em>",
  "Offset Angle": "偏移角度",
  "Input morph control for a specific delta": "特定增量的输入变形控制",
  "Stereo": "立体声",
  "Stereo controls are compiled into right_<name> and left_<name> pairs.": "立体声控件会编译为 right_<name> 和 left_<name> 成对出现",
  "Min Value": "最小值",
  "The minimum value the controller can have, typically 0": "控制器可具有的最小值，通常为 0",
  "Max Value": "最大值",
  "The maximum value the controller can have, typically 1": "控制器可取的最大值，通常为 1",
  "Implicit": "隐式",
  "This value is set when the morph control is created via mesh loading and not explictly created by the user": "此值在通过网格加载创建变形控制器时设置，而非由用户显式创建",
  "New morph control name:": "新变形控制名称：",
  "Morph rule": "变形规则",
  "The named Morph Shape will receive the result of the expression": "命名的变形形状（Morph Shape）将接收表达式的结果",
  "Expression": "表达式",
  "A mathematical expression which reads from named morph controls and the result is stored in the name Target Morph Shape": "一个从命名的变形控件读取数据的数学表达式，结果存储在名为目标变形形状(Target Morph Shape)的变量中",
  "If the Parent Bone is unset for an attachment or a hitbox, the model's origin is used.": "如果挂点或命中盒未设置父骨骼，则使用模型原点。",
  "Relative Origin": "相对原点",
  "Relative Angles": "相对角度",
  "Attachment point that the game can use for gameplay, particles, etc.": "游戏可用于玩法、粒子等的附着点。",
  "Ignore Rotation": "忽略旋转",
  "New attachment name:": "新附加点名称：",
  "Pick the parent bone for the attachment:": "为附加点选择父骨骼：",
  "Additional influence for the attachment.": "附加点的额外影响权重。",
  "Attachment Camera Preview": "附着点相机预览",
  "Preview helper for using an attachment as a camera position.": "将挂点用作相机位置的预览辅助工具。",
  "Screen Width for Aspect": "用于宽高比的屏幕宽度",
  "Screen Height for Aspect": "用于宽高比的屏幕高度",
  "Preview Scale": "预览缩放",
  "Background Color": "背景颜色",
  "Attachment Preview Model": "附加点预览模型",
  "Helper for previewing how a model may attach to the given attachment. Does NOT affect the compiled model.": "用于预览模型如何附加到给定附加点的辅助工具。不会影响编译后的模型。",
  "Local Attachment Offset": "本地附加点偏移",
  "A named group of hitboxes that the game considers logically equivalent. (ie. a character torso may consist of multiple hitboxes.)": "游戏中逻辑上等同的命中盒命名分组。（例如角色躯干可能由多个命中盒组成。）",
  "New Hitbox Set Name:": "新命中框集名称：",
  "A hitbox set that is auto-populated from the model skeleton during compile.)": "编译时从模型骨架自动填充的命中盒集。)",
  "Translation Only": "仅位移",
  "Group ID": "组 ID",
  "Hitbox: %s set": "命中盒：%s 已设置",
  "Hitbox: Bone - %s": "命中盒：骨骼 - %s",
  "Pick the parent bone for the hitbox:": "为命中框选择父骨骼：",
  "Pick the parent hitbox set:": "选择父级命中框集：",
  "Hitbox": "命中盒",
  "Individual box within a hitbox set.": "命中框集中的单个框。",
  "Hitbox Mins": "命中盒最小值",
  "Hitbox Maxs": "碰撞盒最大值",
  "A sphere shaped hit box within a hitbox set.": "命中盒集合内的球形命中盒。",
  "A caspule shaped hitbox within a hitbox set.": "命中盒集中的胶囊形命中盒。",
  "Point 0": "点 0",
  "Point 1": "点 1",
  "No but transfer UVs": "否，但转移 UV",
  "A group of grooms that share a lighting and sim volume texture and will sort correctly against each other": "共享光照和模拟体积纹理且能相互正确排序的一组毛发",
  "Root Bone": "根骨骼",
  "Reference to an alembic file with curves data, turns into a runtime groom mesh": "对包含曲线数据的 Alembic 文件的引用，将转换为运行时修饰网格",
  "Target Hair Count": "目标头发数量",
  "Target Guide Hair Count": "目标引导毛发数量",
  "Max Curve Segments": "最大曲线段数",
  "High Quality Interpolation": "高质量插值",
  "Render Material": "渲染材质",
  "Attach to Morphing Base Mesh": "附加到变形基础网格",
  "Base Mesh": "基础网格",
  "Base Mesh Material": "基础网格材质",
  "Enable Physics Sim": "启用物理模拟",
  "Simulation Params Material": "模拟参数材质",
  "Could not create HairMetaData( %s ) node": "无法创建 HairMetaData( %s ) 节点",
  "Groom root bone \"%s\" doesn't exist": "毛发梳理根骨骼 \\\"%s\\\" 不存在",
  "Pick the source hair file": "选择源头发文件",
  "Can't find this node in the list of all groom group nodes.": "在所有 groom 组节点列表中找不到此节点。",
  "Material \"%s\" is not using a proper hair shader.": "材质 \"%s\" 未使用正确的头发着色器",
  "Unsupported mix of opaque and translucent materials in thie groom group. Render materials in child groom meshfile nodes must either be all opaque or all translucent.": "此梳理(Groom)组中不透明与半透明材质的混合不受支持。子级 groom meshfile 节点的渲染材质必须全为不透明或全为半透明。",
  "Stores metadata for groom meshes.": "存储毛发网格的元数据。",
  "Physics Prop": "物理 Prop",
  "Ragdoll": "布娃娃",
  "Body Collection": "刚体集合",
  "Physics Particle": "物理粒子",
  "Debris": "碎片",
  "Interactive": "交互式",
  "Place On Bone": "放置在骨骼上",
  "Place On Attachment": "放置在附件上",
  "Default (No Name)": "默认（无名称）",
  "Inherit Owner Name": "继承所有者名称",
  "Combine Owner + Part Name": "合并所有者与部件名称",
  "Default (No RGB Tint)": "默认（无 RGB 着色）",
  "Inherit RGB Tint": "继承 RGB 色调",
  "Default Material Group": "默认材质组",
  "Inherit Material Index": "继承材质索引",
  "Inherit Material Name": "继承材质名称",
  "Random": "随机",
  "Do not change any physics joints.": "不更改任何物理关节。",
  "Inherit All Joints": "继承所有关节",
  "The new break piece copies all the physics joints from the non-broken piece.": "新破碎部件会复制未破碎部件的所有物理关节。",
  "Replace Specific Body's Joints": "替换特定刚体的关节",
  "The new break piece only copies joints attached to a specific physics body": "新破碎件仅复制附加到特定物理刚体的关节",
  "+Positioning": "+定位",
  "Placement Mode": "放置模式",
  "Placement Bone": "放置骨骼",
  "Placement Attachment": "放置挂点",
  "+On Break": "+破碎时",
  "Sound Event On Spawn": "生成时的声音事件",
  "Spawn Entity": "生成实体",
  "The type of entity to spawn for the break piece.": "破碎部件生成的实体类型。",
  "Enable Collision With Parent": "启用与父级的碰撞",
  "When this breakpiece breaks, should it be able to intersect with the parent that spawned it?": "此碎裂件破碎时，是否允许与生成它的父级相交？",
  "Ragdoll Applies Bind Pose Root": "布娃娃应用绑定姿态根",
  "If this break piece spawns a ragdoll, should we apply the root transform from the bind pose on top of the initial entity transform?": "如果此破碎碎片生成布娃娃，是否应在初始实体变换之上应用绑定姿态的根变换？",
  "Collision Group": "碰撞组",
  "Offset Rotation": "偏移旋转",
  "+On Break/Fade": "+破碎/淡出时",
  "Fade Time": "淡出时间",
  "Seconds before the piece fades out and is removed from the game.<br>-1 means 'default fade time' which is currently 20 seconds.<br>0 means infinite <font color='red'>(which can cause performance problems if over-used)</font>": "部件淡出并从游戏中移除前的秒数。<br>-1 表示“默认淡出时间”，当前为 20 秒。<br>0 表示无限 <font color='red'>（过度使用可能导致性能问题）</font>",
  "Fade Min Dist": "淡出最小距离",
  "Fade Max Dist": "淡出最大距离",
  "Name Mode": "名称模式",
  "Random Spawn Chance": "随机生成几率",
  "Suppress Creation On Death": "死亡时抑制创建",
  "If true, this break piece can only be spawned manually by explicit game code such as code using animating_breakable_stage model GameData.": "如果为真，此破碎部件只能通过显式游戏代码手动生成，例如使用 animating_breakable_stage 模型 GameData 的代码。",
  "Essential Piece": "关键部件",
  "<font color='red'>(WARNING: Performance risk!)</font><br>Indicates this breakpiece is essential for gameplay or other reasons.<br>Forces the piece to always spawn, potentially suppressing other breakpieces to stay in-budget.": "<font color='red'>（警告：性能风险！）</font><br>表示此碎块对游戏玩法或其他方面至关重要。<br>强制始终生成该碎块，可能会抑制其他碎块以保持在预算内。",
  "Can Player Pickup Piece": "玩家可否拾取部件",
  "Set true if this is a break piece the player should be able to pickup.": "如果这是玩家可以拾取的破碎部件，则设为 true。",
  "+Visuals": "+视觉",
  "Render Color Mode": "渲染颜色模式",
  "Material Group Mode": "材质组模式",
  "+On Break/+Physics": "+破坏时/+物理",
  "Physics Joint Modification Mode": "物理关节修改模式",
  "Specific Physics Body to Replace": "要替换的特定物理刚体",
  "Mass Override": "质量覆盖",
  "Override the mass this embedded piece will spawn with regardless of the VMDL propdata.": "覆盖此内嵌碎块生成时的质量，而不考虑 VMDL propdata。",
  "Reference to a separate model to spawn when a physics prop is broken.": "对物理道具破碎时生成的另一个模型的引用。",
  "Force Motion Disabled": "强制禁用运动",
  "Force this external piece to spawn motion-disabled regardless of the VMDL propdata. (For embedded pieces, just add propdata child node.)": "强制此外部部件在禁用运动的状态下生成，而不考虑 VMDL propdata。（对于内嵌部件，只需添加 propdata 子节点。）",
  "Health Override": "生命值覆盖",
  "Override the health this external piece will spawn with regardless of the VMDL propdata. (For embedded pieces, just add propdata child node.)": "覆盖此外部部件生成时的生命值，无视 VMDL propdata。（对于内嵌部件，只需添加 propdata 子节点。）",
  "Break Piece External": "外部破碎部件",
  "Special operation to execute when this model breaks.": "此模型破碎时执行的特殊操作。",
  "Blend Anim Events": "混合动画事件",
  "By default, only the animation events on the first child animation are considered, if true all animation events which have a non-zero blend weight are used to detect animation events": "默认情况下只考虑第一个子动画上的动画事件；如果为真，则所有混合权重非零的动画事件都会用于检测动画事件",
  "Fixed Blend": "固定混合",
  "Fixed Blend Val": "固定混合值",
  "New animation name:": "新动画名称：",
  "Match Frame Counts": "匹配帧数",
  "Add a hold to shorter animations in the blend to match frame counts on all blends": "为混合中较短的动画添加定格，以匹配所有混合动画的帧数",
  "Animation references itself as blend target": "动画将自身引用为混合目标",
  "ModelDoc \"%s\" node incompatible with AnimGraph, use \"Blend 1D\" node in AnimGraph instead": "ModelDoc“%s”节点与 AnimGraph 不兼容，请在 AnimGraph 中改用“Blend 1D”节点",
  "1D Blend Has No Referenced Animations": "1D 混合没有引用的动画",
  "Fixed Blend is true, pose parameter \"%s\" is ignored.": "固定混合为 true 时，姿态参数“%s”将被忽略。",
  "Non-Matching Frame Count/Rate On Referenced Anim: %s, Expecting %d/%gfps got %d/%gfps": "引用动画的帧数/帧率不匹配：%s，应为 %d/%gfps，实际为 %d/%gfps",
  "Non-AnimFile Referenced: %s": "未引用动画文件：%s",
  "2DBlend": "2D 混合",
  "Row Fixed Blend Val": "行固定混合值",
  "Col Fixed Blend Val": "列固定混合值",
  "ModelDoc \"%s\" node incompatible with AnimGraph, use \"Blend 2D\" node in AnimGraph instead": "ModelDoc \\\"%s\\\" 节点与 AnimGraph 不兼容，请在 AnimGraph 中改用\\\"Blend 2D\\\"节点",
  "2D Blend Has No Referenced Animations": "2D 混合没有引用的动画",
  "Fixed Blend is true, col pose parameter \"%s\" is ignored.": "固定混合已启用，列姿势参数\\\"%s\\\"将被忽略。",
  "Node that takes an animation and resolves into a 2d blend": "接收动画并解析为 2D 混合的节点",
  "WeightList Name": "权重列表名称",
  "Horizontal Pose Param": "水平姿势参数",
  "Vertical Pose Param": "垂直姿势参数",
  "Has Up Frame": "有向上帧",
  "Right To Left": "从右到左",
  "Auto Layer": "自动层",
  "Pick the source animation file": "选择源动画文件",
  "Pick the horizontal pose parameter:": "选择水平姿势参数：",
  "Pick the vertical pose parameter:": "选择垂直姿势参数：",
  "Lowest": "最低",
  "Low": "低",
  "Medium": "中",
  "High": "高",
  "Highest": "最高",
  "Parameters which control the ACL compression for animation.": "控制动画 ACL 压缩的参数。",
  "Compression Level": "压缩级别",
  "Applies to skeletal animation only.<br><br>Specify how aggressively to attempt to reduce the memory footprint. Higher levels will try more permutations and bit rates. The higher the level, the slower the compression but the smaller the memory footprint. <br><b>NOTE</b>: Currently lowest, low and medium are all equivalent.": "仅适用于骨骼动画。<br><br>指定尝试降低内存占用的激进程度。更高级别将尝试更多排列组合和比特率。级别越高，压缩越慢，但内存占用越小。<br><b>注意</b>：目前最低、低和中级效果相同。",
  "Virtual Vertex Distance": "虚拟顶点距离",
  "Translation Constant Threshold": "平移常量阈值",
  "Threshold value to use when detecting if translation tracks are constant or default. In game units, i.e. inches": "用于检测平移轨道是否为常量或默认值的阈值。单位为游戏单位（即英寸）",
  "Error Threshold": "误差阈值",
  "Tracks Precision": "轨道精度",
  "Applies to morph animation only.<br><br>This is the per component precision threshold to try and attain when optimizing the bit rate. If the error is below the precision threshold, we will remove bits until we reach it without exceeding it. If the error is above the precision threshold, we will add more bits until we lower it underneath.": "仅适用于变形动画。<br><br>这是优化比特率时每个分量要达到的精度阈值。若误差低于精度阈值，将移除比特位直至恰好达到阈值；若误差高于精度阈值，将增加比特位直至误差降到阈值以下。",
  "Tracks Constant Threshold": "轨道恒定阈值",
  "An extra string and weight to apply to the primary activity assigned to an animation": "应用于动画所分配主要活动的额外字符串和权重",
  "Activity Name": "活动名称",
  "Activity Weight": "动作权重",
  "Keyframe animation data": "关键帧动画数据",
  "Viewing Animation Data": "查看动画数据",
  "Bone Rename failed, results in duplicate bones in this animation": "骨骼重命名失败，导致此动画中出现重复骨骼",
  "Bone Rename failed, results in duplicate bone '%s' in this animation": "骨骼重命名失败，将导致此动画中出现重复骨骼 '%s'",
  "Number": "数字",
  "First Frame": "首帧",
  "Last Frame": "最后一帧",
  "Align TX": "对齐 TX",
  "Align TY": "对齐 TY",
  "Align TZ": "对齐 TZ",
  "Align RX": "对齐 RX",
  "Align RY": "对齐 RY",
  "Align RZ": "对齐 RZ",
  "Align Frame Type": "对齐帧类型",
  "Frame": "帧",
  "Align To Anim Name": "对齐到动画名称",
  "Align To Frame Type": "对齐到帧类型",
  "Align To Frame": "对齐到帧",
  "Bone Name": "骨骼名称",
  "Pick the animation to align to:": "选择要对齐的动画：",
  "Pick the bone to align:": "选择要对齐的骨骼：",
  "Controls the value of a material attribute over a frame range.": "控制材质属性在一个帧范围内的值。",
  "Material Attribute Name": "材质属性名称",
  "Specifies the name of the attribute in the material whose value is to be set. This is the name which appears in the 'Attributes Used' section when editing an expression in the material editor.": "指定材质中要设置值的属性名称。此名称显示在材质编辑器中编辑表达式时的 'Attributes Used'（所用属性）部分",
  "Assigns a floating point value to a material attribute over a frame range.": "在帧范围内为材质属性指定浮点数值。",
  "Target Value": "目标值",
  "The value to assign to the specified attribute when at full intensity. During fade in and fade out the value will blend from 0 to this value.": "全强度时赋予指定属性的值。淡入和淡出期间，该值将从 0 混合到此值。",
  "Material Attribute Value: %s : %0.2f": "材质属性值：%s : %0.2f",
  "Assigns a color value to a material attribute over a frame range.": "在帧范围内为材质属性分配颜色值。",
  "Target Color": "目标颜色",
  "The color to assign to the specified attribute when at full intensity. During fade in and fade out the value will blend from black to this value. Note that when the color value is provided to a material expression it will be in linear color space.": "在满强度时分配给指定属性的颜色。淡入和淡出期间，值将从黑色渐变到此值。注意，颜色值提供给材质表达式时将处于线性颜色空间。",
  "Material Attribute Color: %s": "材质属性颜色：%s",
  "Object Rotation": "对象旋转",
  "Object": "对象",
  "Parent Rotation": "父级旋转",
  "animation constraint aim": "动画约束瞄准",
  "Aim Offset": "瞄准偏移",
  "Up Type": "向上类型",
  "Up Vector": "上向量",
  "animation constraint attachment input": "动画约束附着点输入",
  "Parent Attachment": "父附加点",
  "Constraint missing parent bone": "约束缺少父骨骼",
  "Slave Channel": "从属通道",
  "Min": "最小",
  "Max": "最大",
  "The <b>Parent</b> animation constraint is a little different in that it expects the bone to be constrained along with any offset to be specified directly on the node itself rather than via an output child node.  Also to note is that the rotation offset on the node is specified as an Euler rotation in degrees in XYZ order rather than the QAngle everywhere else.  If the <b>Constrained Bone</b> field is empty and there is an output child node, the first output node will be used.  If the <b>Constrained Bone</b> field is not empty, all output child nodes will be ignored.": "<b>父级</b>动画约束略有不同：它要求骨骼约束及任何偏移直接在节点本身上指定，而不是通过输出子节点指定。另外需要注意的是，节点上的旋转偏移以 XYZ 顺序的欧拉角（度）指定，而不是其他地方使用的 QAngle。如果<b>受约束骨骼</b>字段为空且存在输出子节点，将使用第一个输出节点。如果<b>受约束骨骼</b>字段不为空，所有输出子节点都将被忽略。",
  "Constrained Bone": "受约束骨骼",
  "Translation Offset": "平移偏移",
  "Euler Offset XYZ": "欧拉偏移 XYZ",
  "This is an Euler Rotation in degrees in XYZ order.": "这是以 XYZ 欧拉角顺序表示的旋转（度）。",
  "pose space constraint bone": "姿态空间约束骨骼",
  "Radial Basis Function Type": "径向基函数类型",
  "Falloff": "衰减",
  "Attachment Name": "附件名称",
  "Clamp": "钳制",
  "Drive a morph channel based on a remapped range of the angle between a bone's up-vector and the direction to a target bone.": "基于骨骼上向量与目标骨骼方向之间夹角的重映射范围来驱动变形通道。",
  "Target Bone Name": "目标骨骼名称",
  "Remap From Min": "重映射自最小值",
  "Remap From Max": "重映射自最大值",
  "Remap To Min": "重映射到最小值",
  "Remap To Max": "重映射到最大",
  "Morph Channel Name": "变形通道名称",
  "The position of this transform": "此变换的位置",
  "The orientation of this transform": "此变换的朝向",
  "Name of the bone this pose refers to": "此姿势所指的骨骼名称",
  "Poses": "姿势",
  "The saved pose data for this bone": "此骨骼已保存的姿势数据",
  "RBF Based Anim Constraint": "基于 RBF 的动画约束",
  "Translation Ignore Threshold": "平移忽略阈值",
  "Solver Settings": "求解器设置",
  "Depends on scale of translation, increase for stability at the cost of accuracy": "取决于位移的缩放，增大可提高稳定性但会降低精度",
  "Rotation Ignore Threshold": "旋转忽略阈值",
  "acosf() heavily exaggerates floating point precision errors. Threshold is high (1e-2f) for this reason. This can probably stay fixed. Increase for Stability at the cost of Accuracy.": "acosf() 会严重放大浮点精度误差，因此阈值较高（1e-2f）。这个问题或许可以修复。提高该值可增强稳定性，但会牺牲精度。",
  "Inverse Threshold": "反向阈值",
  "Trainer Settings": "训练器设置",
  "Linear system is solved by compute a Pseudo-Inverse via SVD. Set the threshold to zero small singular values instead of inverting them.  Increase for Stability at the cost of Accuracy.": "线性系统通过 SVD 计算伪逆来求解。将阈值设为零以用小奇异值代替求逆。增大可提高稳定性，但会降低精度。",
  "L2 Regularization": "L2 正则化",
  "Apply the l2 Regularization (Ridge Regression). Increase for Stability & Smoothness at the cost of Accuracy.": "应用 L2 正则化（岭回归）。提高该值可获得更好的稳定性与平滑度，但会牺牲精度。",
  "Input (Driver)": "输入（驱动）",
  "The input bones and pose samples for the Rbf.  The input are the driver bones.": "Rbf 的输入骨骼和姿势样本。输入为驱动骨骼。",
  "Output (Driven)": "输出（被驱动）",
  "The output bones and pose samples for the Rbf.  The output are the driven bones.": "Rbf 的输出骨骼和姿势样本。输出即为被驱动的骨骼。",
  "No input pose data": "无输入姿态数据",
  "No output pose data": "无输出姿态数据",
  "Non-Matching Input %d & Output %d Pose Counts": "输入 %d 与输出 %d 的姿势数不匹配",
  "X - Forward": "X - 前方",
  "Y - Left": "Y - 左",
  "Z - Up": "Z 轴向上",
  "animation constraint tilt twist": "动画约束倾斜扭转",
  "Input Axis": "输入轴",
  "Slave Axis": "从动轴",
  "Inverse": "反向",
  "Parent Bind Rotation": "父级绑定旋转",
  "Child Bind Rotation": "子级绑定旋转",
  "Generates a new animation which is a smooth blend from A to B": "生成一个从 A 平滑混合到 B 的新动画",
  "Anim A": "动画 A",
  "Frames From End Of A": "距 A 结尾的帧数",
  "Anim B": "动画 B",
  "Frames From Start Of B": "距 B 开始的帧数",
  "Final animation consists of A, Crossfade, B": "最终动画由 A、交叉淡化、B 组成",
  "Couldn't create filtered anim": "无法创建过滤后的动画",
  "Couldn't find referenced animations": "找不到引用的动画",
  "Specifies that the specified motion should be removed from the specified bones.  If no bones are specified, motion is discarded from all root bones, i.e. bones without a parent.  Motion is discarded for the specified channels by copying the first frame over all frames of the specified motion.": "指定应从指定骨骼中移除的动作。若未指定骨骼，则丢弃所有根骨骼（即无父级的骨骼）的动作。通过将第一帧复制到指定动作的所有帧来丢弃指定通道的动作。",
  "Discard X Translation": "丢弃 X 平移",
  "Discard Y Translation": "舍弃 Y 轴平移",
  "Discard Z Translation": "舍弃 Z 平移",
  "Discard X Rotation": "丢弃 X 旋转",
  "Discard Y Rotation": "丢弃 Y 旋转",
  "Discard Z Rotation": "丢弃 Z 轴旋转",
  "Bone Names": "骨骼名称列表",
  "Bones to discard the specified motion from.  If no bones are specified, motion is discarded from all root bones, i.e. bones without a parent.": "要从中去除指定运动的骨骼。若未指定骨骼，则从所有根骨骼（即没有父级的骨骼）中去除运动。",
  "Base class for animations which are nodes that map to a compiled animation": "映射到已编译动画的节点类动画的基类",
  "Is Default Idle Anim": "是否默认待机动画",
  "On models with an animgraph, setting this to true sets the Activity Name to ACT_IDLE, false will clear the activity.  The intended usage is on models intended to also be used without an animgraph, i.e. as map entities like prop_dynamic with use animgraph disabled in Hammer.  NOTE: If Activity Name is anything other than empty or ACT_IDLE, this field is not writable.": "对于带动画图（AnimGraph）的模型，设为 true 会将活动名称设为 ACT_IDLE，false 会清除活动。预期用法是针对那些也打算不带动画图使用的模型，例如在 Hammer 中禁用动画图后用作 prop_dynamic 等地图实体。注意：如果活动名称不是空或 ACT_IDLE，此字段不可写",
  "Primary activity for this animation.  To add an activity modifier, add an ActivityModifier child node.<p><span style=\"color:#ffff00\"><b>NOTE</b></span>: Animgraph animations should not use activities or activity weights.": "此动画的主要活动。要添加活动修改器，请添加 ActivityModifier 子节点。<p><span style=\\\"color:#ffff00\\\"><b>注意</b></span>：动画图动画不应使用活动或活动权重。",
  "Weight list to apply to this animation.<p><span style=\"color:#ffff00\"><b>NOTE</b></span>: Animgraph animations should not use activities or activity weights.": "应用于此动画的权重列表。<p><span style=\\\"color:#ffff00\\\"><b>注意</b></span>：Animgraph 动画不应使用活动(activity)或活动权重。",
  "Weight list to apply to this animation at runtime.<p><span style=\"color:#ffff00\"><b>NOTE</b></span>: Animgraph animations should not apply a weightlist here.  When using animgraph, a weightlist should be applied via a <span style=\"color:#7b364f\"><b>Bone Mask</b></span> node in the graph.": "运行时应用于此动画的权重列表。<p><span style=\\\"color:#ffff00\\\"><b>注意</b></span>：AnimGraph 动画不应在此应用权重列表。使用 AnimGraph 时，应通过图中的<span style=\\\"color:#7b364f\\\"><b>骨骼遮罩</b></span>节点应用权重列表。",
  "Fade In Time": "淡入时间",
  "Time in seconds from the start of the animation over which it will fade int when it starts playing.": "从动画开始算起、播放开始时淡入所持续的秒数。",
  "Fade Out Time": "淡出时间",
  "Time in seconds from the end of the animation over which it will fade out when it stops playing.": "动画结束后淡出所需的时间（秒），在停止播放时生效。",
  "Looping": "循环",
  "Specify whether the animation loops.": "指定动画是否循环。",
  "Delta": "增量",
  "Specifies the animation's inherent blend mode.<p>If <b>TRUE</b> the animation will <b>ADD</b> itself onto the current animation stack.<p>If <b>FALSE</b> the animation will <b>BLEND</b> itself onto the current animation stack.<p><span style=\"color:#ffff00\"><b>NOTE</b></span>: Animgraph animations should normally leave this at the default value of <b>FALSE</b>. The blend mode is set on the Animgraph node explicitly.": "指定动画固有的混合模式。<p>若为 <b>TRUE</b>，动画将以<b>叠加(ADD)</b>方式作用于当前动画堆栈。<p>若为 <b>FALSE</b>，动画将以<b>混合(BLEND)</b>方式作用于当前动画堆栈。<p><span style=\\\"color:#ffff00\\\"><b>注意</b></span>：动画图动画通常应保持默认值 <b>FALSE</b>。混合模式应在动画图节点上显式设置。",
  "Specifies the animation's inherent blend mode to worldspace, mutally exclusive with delta.<p>If <b>TRUE</b> the animation will <b>WORLDSPACE</b> blend itself onto the current animation stack.<p>If <b>FALSE</b> the animation will <b>BLEND</b> itself onto the current animation stack.<p><span style=\"color:#ffff00\"><b>NOTE</b></span>: Animgraph animations should normally leave this at the default value of <b>FALSE</b>. The blend mode is set on the Animgraph node explicitly.": "指定动画固有的世界空间混合模式，与增量(delta)互斥。<p>如果为 <b>TRUE</b>，动画将以 <b>WORLDSPACE</b>（世界空间）方式混合到当前动画堆栈上。<p>如果为 <b>FALSE</b>，动画将以 <b>BLEND</b>（混合）方式叠加到当前动画堆栈上。<p><span style=\\\"color:#ffff00\\\"><b>注意</b></span>：Animgraph 动画通常应保持默认值 <b>FALSE</b>。混合模式在 Animgraph 节点上显式设置。",
  "Hidden": "隐藏",
  "Specify whether the animation should be hidden from the compiled view outliner on the right and pulldowns.": "指定是否在右侧的编译视图大纲和下拉列表中隐藏该动画。",
  "Anim Markup Ordered": "动画标记已排序",
  "Specify that the animation markup child nodes for this animation should be processed in the order they appear.": "指定此动画的动画标记子节点应按出现顺序处理。",
  "Disable Compression": "禁用压缩",
  "Turn off animation compression for this animation.<p><span style=\"color:#aa0000\"><b>NOTE</b></span>: This significantly increases the size of the animation data.<p>Normally it should be false but if there are obvious compression artifacts, typically in tiny rotations, disabling compression may fix those.": "关闭此动画的动画压缩。<p><span style=\\\"color:#aa0000\\\"><b>注意</b></span>：这会显著增大动画数据的大小。<p>通常应设为 false，但如果出现明显的压缩伪影（通常出现在极小的旋转中），禁用压缩可能修复这些问题。",
  "AnimGraph Additive": "AnimGraph 叠加",
  "If animation has been subtracted in ModelDoc to create an additive animation to be used with AnimGraph, set this to true": "如果动画已在 ModelDoc 中被减法处理以生成与 AnimGraph 配合使用的叠加动画，则设为 true",
  "Delete From Compiled Model": "从编译后的模型中删除",
  "Delete this animation at the last stage of model compilation. This is useful if this animation is an intermediary source (e.g.: a base animation before subtraction), and while it's necessary to produce other animations, you don't want it to appear on the compiled model.": "在模型编译的最后阶段删除此动画。如果此动画是中间源（例如：减法前的基动画），虽然生成其他动画需要它，但你不希望它出现在编译后的模型上，这会很有用。",
  "Delta & WorldSpace are mutually exclusive, only check one of them": "Delta 与 WorldSpace 互斥，只能勾选其中一个",
  "\"%s\" attribute should not be used when using AnimGraph, reset value to default if possible.": "使用动画图时不应使用\\\"%s\\\"属性，如可能请将值重置为默认。",
  "Creates an animation from the model's bind pose": "从模型的绑定姿态创建动画",
  "Pose To Cycle": "姿态转为循环",
  "Auto Cycle": "自动循环",
  "An animation to composite over top of this animation.  The cycle of the composited animation will be the same as this animation.": "合成到此动画之上的动画。被合成动画的循环与此动画相同。",
  "Anim Name": "动画名称",
  "Pick the animaton to overlay:": "选择要叠加的动画：",
  "Crossfade": "交叉淡化",
  "No Blend": "无混合",
  "Local Space": "局部空间",
  "Start Frame": "起始帧",
  "Peak Frame": "峰值帧",
  "Tail Frame": "尾帧",
  "End Frame": "结束帧",
  "Pick the influence frame range:": "选择影响帧范围：",
  "Pose Param": "姿势参数",
  "Start Cycle": "起始循环",
  "Peak Cycle": "峰值循环",
  "Tail Cycle": "尾部循环",
  "End Cycle": "结束循环",
  "Pick the pose parameter that will drive the cycle:": "选择用于驱动循环的姿势参数：",
  "Cycle Type": "循环类型",
  "Pick the pose param that will drive the animation cycle:": "选择将驱动动画循环的姿势参数：",
  "A game event occurring at a particular frame in an animation (Footstep, sound, particle effect, etc.)": "在动画特定帧发生的游戏事件（脚步声、声音、粒子效果等）。",
  "Event Class": "事件类",
  "No destructible hit group set up for hitgroup '%s'; this anim event should be removed/disabled!": "未为受击组 '%s' 设置可破坏受击组；应移除/禁用此动画事件！",
  "Override sound is invalid.": "覆盖声音无效。",
  "Frame Offset": "帧偏移",
  "Shifts the frames of the additional animation file relative to the base animation file.  Negative values drop # frames from the start, positive values add # copies of the first frame to the start": "使附加动画文件的帧相对基础动画文件偏移。负值会从开头丢弃 # 帧，正值会在开头添加 # 个首帧副本",
  "Filename": "文件名",
  "Filename of the additional animation file to be merged into the resulting animation": "要合并到结果动画中的附加动画文件的文件名",
  "Reference to a content file that will resolve to one or more animations. (Plus additional document nodes such as skeleton bones etc.)": "对内容文件的引用，将解析为一个或多个动画。（以及骨架骨骼等其他文档节点。）",
  "The filename of the input animation file.": "输入动画文件的文件名。",
  "Import Bone Scales": "导入骨骼缩放",
  "Whether or not to import bone scales.  False by default (i.e. override bone scales to 1.0) for legacy compatibility.  Only applicable to fbx files.": "是否导入骨骼缩放。默认为 false（即将骨骼缩放覆盖为 1.0）以兼容旧版。仅适用于 fbx 文件。",
  "The frame at which to start using animation data.  By default it's 0, the first frame of the animation.": "开始使用动画数据的帧。默认为 0，即动画的第一帧。",
  "The frame at which to end using animation data.  By default it's the last frame of the animation.": "停止使用动画数据的帧。默认为动画的最后一帧",
  "Frame Rate": "帧率",
  "Specify the framerate at which to play back the animation.  It is filled in from the data in the animation file so normally it doesn't need to be modified.": "指定动画回放的帧率。它会从动画文件中的数据自动填充，因此通常无需修改。",
  "Reverse": "反向",
  "Reverse the direction of the animation.  This happens after the frame range is truncated.": "反转动画方向。此操作在帧范围截断之后进行。",
  "Additional Anim Files": "额外动画文件",
  "Additional animation files which will be merged into the loaded animation.  Animation channels will be overwritten by later files.  The last source file to define an animation channel (bone/morph) wins.  Earlier occurrences of that animation channel in subsequent animation files will overwritten.  The resulting animation frame count will be the maximum of all specified animation files.  Animation files which are shorter will have additional copies of their final frames added to the end for padding.": "将合并到已加载动画中的附加动画文件。动画通道会被后面的文件覆盖。最后定义某个动画通道（骨骼/变形）的源文件生效。后续动画文件中较早出现的该动画通道会被覆盖。生成的动画帧数为所有指定动画文件中的最大值。较短的动画文件会在末尾追加其最后一帧的副本作为填充。",
  "Import Bone Scales only applies to FBX and DMX input files, will be ignored for %s files": "导入骨骼缩放仅适用于 FBX 和 DMX 输入文件，对 %s 文件将被忽略",
  "Invalid anim file": "无效的动画文件",
  "No animation data found in source file": "源文件中未找到动画数据",
  "Multi-take source animations not supported": "不支持多 take 源动画",
  "Cannot Merge: Frame Rate %d of additional animation \"%s\" doesn't match Frame Rate %d of main animation \"%s\"": "无法合并：附加动画 \\\"%s\\\" 的帧率 %d 与主动画 \\\"%s\\\" 的帧率 %d 不匹配",
  "Failed to merge additional anim file: %s": "合并附加动画文件失败：%s",
  "Couldn't create an animation with the name \"%s\", likely already exists": "无法创建名为“%s”的动画，可能已存在",
  "Cannot rename non-compliant animated bone name from \"%s\" to \"%s\", animation data will be lost": "无法将不合规的动画骨骼名称从\\\"%s\\\"重命名为\\\"%s\\\"，动画数据将丢失",
  "Sanitize Bone Names failed, results in duplicate bones in this animation": "清理骨骼名称失败，导致此动画中出现重复骨骼",
  "Sanitize Bone Names failed, results in duplicate bone '%s' in this animation": "骨骼名称规范化失败，导致此动画中出现重复骨骼 '%s'",
  "Hold Frame %d Remapped To Last Frame Of Source Anim, Valid Range: [ %d, %d ]": "保持帧 %d 已重映射到源动画的最后一帧，有效范围：[ %d, %d ]",
  "<p>Loads a content file containing animation keyframe data and resolves into animation data which plays in reverse, i.e. backwards.</p><p>Works the same as AnimFile except the direction of the animation data.</p><p>When specifying a sub frame range, the frame range is pulled from the animation file before reversal.</p><p>For a typical walk style animation with extracted motion, likely an AnimAlign to first frame of the original forward animation will be required.</p>": "<p>加载包含动画关键帧数据的内容文件，并解析为反向播放（即倒放）的动画数据。</p><p>工作方式与 AnimFile 相同，只是动画数据方向相反。</p><p>指定子帧范围时，帧范围在反转前从动画文件中提取。</p><p>对于带提取运动的典型行走动画，可能需要 AnimAlign 对齐到原前进动画的第一帧。</p>",
  "Force a single world-space bone transform": "强制单一世界空间骨骼变换",
  "Translation": "平移",
  "Rotation": "旋转",
  "Force a single world-space bone transform over a specified frame range": "在指定帧范围内强制使用单一的世界空间骨骼变换",
  "Start Frame Number": "起始帧号",
  "Peak Frame Number": "峰值帧号",
  "Tail Frame Number": "尾部帧号",
  "End Frame Number": "结束帧号",
  "Spin a bone around an axis of rotation. For quick procedural fans, propellers, etc": "使骨骼绕旋转轴旋转。用于快速制作程序化的风扇、螺旋桨等",
  "Spin Degrees": "旋转角度(度)",
  "Offset Axis of Rotation": "旋转偏移轴",
  "Apply a morph parameter value over the specified range.": "在指定范围内应用变形参数值。",
  "Value Zero": "值为零",
  "Value One": "值一",
  "Fix a specified bone to a given transform while maintaining all relative animation.": "在保持所有相对动画的同时，将指定骨骼固定到给定变换。",
  "Override bone scale information on an animation": "覆盖动画上的骨骼缩放信息",
  "Frame Number": "帧号",
  "The name of the bone which will have the scale valve overwritten.": "将被覆盖缩放值的骨骼名称。",
  "Applies a bone scale set to the animation over the specified frame range specified by the 2D animation curve.<br>The Input Range is the X Axis range (horizontal) and corresponds to the frame range.<br>The Output Range is the Y Axis range (vertical) and is the scale set weight value over the frame range.<br>Any frames which fall outside of the frame range are left alone.<br><center><br><img src='game:tools/images/modeldoc_editor/docs_anim_markup_curve.png'/><br></center>AnimForceBoneScaleSet nodes are processed in the order they appear under the AnimFile node and will overwrite previously written data if the frame ranges overlap.<b>NOTE</b>: Although the Input/Frame Range are floats, integers should be used. Curve data is not evaluated at run time. The curve is sampled once per frame of the animation and the values are linearly interpolated between frames.<br>": "在指定的帧范围内，将骨骼缩放集应用于动画，帧范围由 2D 动画曲线指定。<br>输入范围是 X 轴范围（水平），对应帧范围。<br>输出范围是 Y 轴范围（垂直），是帧范围内的缩放集权重值。<br>超出帧范围的帧保持不变。<br><center><br><img src='game:tools/images/modeldoc_editor/docs_anim_markup_curve.png'/><br></center>AnimForceBoneScaleSet 节点按其在 AnimFile 节点下出现的顺序处理，如果帧范围重叠，将覆盖之前写入的数据。<b>注意</b>：虽然输入/帧范围是浮点数，但应使用整数。曲线数据不在运行时求值。曲线在动画的每一帧采样一次，值在帧之间线性插值。<br>",
  "Scale Set": "缩放设置",
  "The name of the scale set which will be applied to the animation at compile time.": "编译时将应用到动画的缩放集的名称。",
  "No scale set specified": "未指定缩放集",
  "A single frame from a referenced animation": "引用动画中的单个帧",
  "Source Animation Name": "源动画名称",
  "The animation from which to get a frame.": "从中获取帧的动画",
  "Frame Type": "帧类型",
  "The type of frame to get, first frame, last frame or a specific frame number.": "要获取的帧类型：第一帧、最后一帧或特定帧号。",
  "If the type of frame to get is a specific frame number, this is the frame that is used.": "如果要获取的帧类型为特定帧号，则使用此帧。",
  "Animation references itself as the source animation": "动画将自身引用为源动画",
  "Couldn't create new animation": "无法创建新动画",
  "Head": "头部",
  "Node that resolves into an auto-generated collection of gesture animations and composed final sequence for use in faceposer etc.": "解析为自动生成的手势动画集合及组合后最终序列的节点，供 faceposer 等使用。",
  "In Frame": "入帧",
  "Loop Start Frame": "循环起始帧",
  "Loop End Frame": "循环结束帧",
  "Out Frame": "出帧",
  "Accent Frame": "重点帧",
  "Gesture Type": "手势类型",
  "Ignore Outro": "忽略结尾",
  "Loop FPS": "循环帧率",
  "Create Left": "创建左侧",
  "Create Right": "创建右侧",
  "Translation Weight": "位移权重",
  "Rotation Weight": "旋转权重",
  "Pick the IK Chain to lock:": "选择要锁定的 IK 链：",
  "Animations from the specified model will be loaded and merged into this model at runtime.  Akin to QC's $includemodel": "指定模型的动画将在运行时加载并合并到该模型中。类似于 QC 的 $includemodel",
  "The resource name of the model to include.": "要包含的模型的资源名称。",
  "Initial Value": "初始值",
  "Parent Node Name": "父节点名称",
  "Subtracts a linear blend of the first and last frames of the animation from itself.": "从动画中减去其首帧与末帧的线性混合。",
  "Subtracts a frame of the specified animation from all frames of this animation.": "从此动画的所有帧中减去指定动画的一帧。",
  "Subtracts a frame of the specified animation from all frames of this animation in model space.": "在模型空间中从此动画的所有帧中减去指定动画的一帧。",
  "Copies animation streams from the specified anim onto the parent anim over the given interval.": "在给定区间内将指定动画的动画流复制到父动画上。",
  "Transforms the animation by the specified values": "按指定值变换动画",
  "Euler XYZ": "欧拉 XYZ",
  "Controls the order of sequences in the compiled model": "控制编译后模型中序列的顺序",
  "Animation Order": "动画顺序",
  "Order of animation sequences in compiled model.  Specified entries will be ordered first, unspecified entries will be added after ordered entries in an unspecified order.": "编译模型中动画序列的顺序。指定的条目将排在前面，未指定的条目将以不确定的顺序排在已排序条目之后。",
  "Remove all values from the list": "移除列表中的所有值",
  "Populate": "填充",
  "Clears and populates the list from the current model": "清空列表并根据当前模型重新填充",
  "Node that resolves into an auto-generated collection of posture animations and composed final sequence for use in faceposer etc.": "解析为自动生成的姿势动画集合及合成最终序列的节点，供面部姿态编辑器等使用。",
  "Apex Frame": "顶点帧",
  "With Hands": "含手部",
  "Lock Left Foot": "锁定左脚",
  "Lock Right Foot": "锁定右脚",
  "Base class for nodes which can be children of AnimMarkupTarget derived nodes": "可作为 AnimMarkupTarget 派生节点子节点的节点基类",
  "Pick the markup frame range:": "选择标记帧范围：",
  "ModelDoc \"%s\" node incompatible with AnimGraph due to child markup nodes": "ModelDoc \\\"%s\\\" 节点因包含子标记节点而与 AnimGraph 不兼容",
  "ModelDoc \"%s\" node \"%s\" incompatible with AnimGraph due to child markup nodes": "ModelDoc 节点 \"%s\" 的 \"%s\" 因含有子标记节点而与 AnimGraph 不兼容",
  "ModelDoc \"%s\" node \"%s\" incompatible with AnimGraph": "ModelDoc \\\"%s\\\" 节点 \\\"%s\\\" 与 AnimGraph 不兼容",
  "Full Frame Range": "完整帧范围",
  "Ease In/Out": "缓入/缓出",
  "Lerp Type": "插值类型",
  "Whether the to use the curve or just a set value for the entire frame range": "是使用曲线还是整个帧范围使用固定值",
  "If Lerp Type is Full Frame Range, this is the fixed scale value applied, the curve is used otherwise": "若插值类型为全帧范围，则为应用的固定缩放值，否则使用曲线",
  "An editable curve to control a value over a specified frame range which will be used to apply markup to an animation.  Curve is used when Lerp Type is Lerp.": "可编辑曲线，用于控制指定帧范围内的值，将用于为动画应用标记。当 Lerp 类型为 Lerp 时使用曲线。",
  "Specify the initial frame range:": "指定初始帧范围：",
  "Anim Curve": "动画曲线",
  "Base class for animation markup nodes which generate user animation data": "生成用户动画数据的动画标记节点的基类",
  "Rename a bone in an animation": "重命名动画中的骨骼",
  "New Bone Name": "新骨骼名称",
  "Cannot rename bone from '%s' to '%s', because animation for the new bone name already exists": "无法将骨骼从 '%s' 重命名为 '%s'，因为新骨骼名称的动画已存在",
  "Could not find animation bone named '%s' for rename.": "找不到名为“%s”的动画骨骼，无法重命名。",
  "Discard Bone Channels": "丢弃骨骼通道",
  "Discards bone channels matching the specified names or globs": "丢弃匹配指定名称或通配符的骨骼通道",
  "Discard Morph Channels": "舍弃变形通道",
  "Discards morph channels matching the specified names or globs": "丢弃与指定名称或通配符匹配的变形通道",
  "Discard Float Channels": "丢弃浮点通道",
  "Discards Float channels matching the specified names or globs": "丢弃匹配指定名称或通配符的浮点通道",
  "Discard Any Channels": "丢弃所有通道",
  "Discards any channels matching the specified names or globs": "丢弃与指定名称或通配符匹配的所有通道",
  "Static Only": "仅静态",
  "Only discards channels which are static in addition to matching any of the above.  Static means the animation channel's value does not change during the entire animation.": "除匹配上述条件外，仅丢弃静态通道。静态指动画通道的值在整个动画期间不变。",
  "Static Only Tolerance": "仅静态容差",
  "Tolerance value for determining if an animation channel is static or not.": "用于判定动画通道是否为静态的容差值。",
  "Finds the difference between the last frame and the first frame in the animation and blends that difference across the boundary.The specified range is from some negative value( number of frames back from the last frame ) to 0, and from 0 to some positive number of frames after the first frame.  This is useful when building a looping animation out of a portion of a non - looping animation, or even cleaning up a animation that is supposed to loop but has a slight hitch.": "找出动画最后一帧与第一帧之间的差异，并在边界处混合该差异。指定范围是从某个负值（距最后一帧的帧数）到 0，以及从 0 到第一帧之后某个正数的帧数。这在用非循环动画的一部分构建循环动画时，或清理本应循环但有轻微卡顿的动画时非常有用",
  "Frames From Start": "距起始帧数",
  "Frames From End": "距结尾的帧数",
  "Resets the starting frame of a looping animation.  This is useful when mixing multiple animations and the animations need to all run together in phase, but the source animations don't match.": "重置循环动画的起始帧。在混合多个动画且需要它们同步运行，但源动画不匹配时非常有用。",
  "Start Loop Frame": "起始循环帧",
  "Invalid turn animation file specified, must contain exactly 3 frames, found %d frames": "指定的转身动画文件无效，必须恰好包含 3 帧，实际找到 %d 帧",
  "Could not create PoseParam( %s ) node": "无法创建 PoseParam( %s ) 节点",
  "Could not create ModelDocAnim( %s ) node": "无法创建 ModelDocAnim( %s ) 节点",
  "Could not create ModelDoc1DBlend( %s ) node": "无法创建 ModelDoc1DBlend( %s ) 节点",
  "Gameplay Identifier": "游戏标识符",
  "Override Timing": "覆盖计时",
  "Associates a semantic identifier with an animgraph2 used by this model.": "将语义标识符与此模型使用的 animgraph2 关联。",
  "New AnimGraph2 Identifier:": "新 AnimGraph2 标识符：",
  "Specifies the AnimGraph2 that the model will use by default.": "指定模型默认使用的 AnimGraph2。",
  "Default: %s": "默认：%s",
  "Specifies a NmSkeleton that the model can be targetted by.": "指定模型可以针对其定位的 NmSkeleton。",
  "Pick the source Nm Skeleton file": "选择源 Nm Skeleton 文件",
  "Unrestricted movement within the joint limits (Saloon Doors)": "关节限制内的自由移动（酒吧门）",
  "Friction": "摩擦力",
  "Continuously reduce joint velocity and oppose gravity (Barn Door)": "持续降低关节速度并抵抗重力（仓门效应）",
  "Elastic": "弹性",
  "Continuously try to return to the bind-pose (Spring Loaded Door)": "持续尝试返回绑定姿势（弹簧门）",
  "Plastic": "塑料",
  "Elastic behavior where the target pose gradually deforms towards the current pose": "弹性行为：目标姿态逐渐向当前姿态变形",
  "Constrain Translation Only": "仅约束平移",
  "Do not restrict angular motion": "不限制角度运动",
  "Constrain Rotation Only": "仅约束旋转",
  "Do not restrict linear motion": "不限制线性运动",
  "Parent Body": "父刚体",
  "Child Body": "子刚体",
  "Anchor Origin": "锚点原点",
  "Anchor Angles": "锚定角度",
  "Collision Enabled": "启用碰撞",
  "Constraint Space": "约束空间",
  "Disable linear/angular component of this joint": "禁用此关节的线性/角分量",
  "Use Block Solver": "使用块求解器",
  "Use a higher quality solver for this joint. Improves accuracy / stiffness but increases CPU cost.": "为此关节使用更高质量的求解器。提高精度/刚度，但会增加 CPU 开销。",
  "+Motion Resistance": "+运动阻力",
  "Counteract motion in the joint": "抵消关节中的运动",
  "How fast joint velocity is reduced": "关节速度减慢的速率",
  "Elasticity": "弹性",
  "How much the joint tries to drive back to bind pose": "关节尝试回到绑定姿势的程度",
  "Damping": "阻尼",
  "Reduce how bouncy the joint is": "降低关节的弹性",
  "Plasticity": "塑性",
  "How quickly the elasticity target pose changes to match the current pose": "弹性目标姿态匹配当前姿态的快慢程度",
  "A list of choices (each of which is group of meshes), only one of which will be visible at a time in-game.": "选项列表（每个选项是一组网格），游戏中同一时间只会显示其中一个。",
  "Hide in Tools": "在工具中隐藏",
  "Non-BodyGroup Single Choice": "非 BodyGroup 单选",
  "If this bodygroup has a single choice, and this is set, do not suffix the output bodygroup name with an _@#, output it as is.  Mainly for import compatibility.": "如果此身体组只有一个选项且已设置此项，则输出身体组名称不加 _@# 后缀，而是按原样输出。主要用于导入兼容性。",
  "Suppress Missing Warnings": "屏蔽缺失警告",
  "Suppress warnings when bodygroups specify meshes that do not exist. This is useful if the bodygroup definition is in a shared prefab and missing warnings are expected or benign.": "当身体组指定了不存在的网格时抑制警告。如果身体组定义位于共享的 Prefab 中、缺失警告属预期或无害，这将很有用。",
  "New bodygroup name:": "新身体组名称：",
  "A list of meshes that form a single choice within a bodygroup.": "构成身体组中单个选项的一组网格。",
  "Choice #0 (default)": "选项 #0（默认）",
  "Choice #%d": "选项 #%d",
  "Bounds": "边界",
  "Override model bounds.": "覆盖模型边界。",
  "Bounds Mins": "边界最小值",
  "Bounds Maxs": "边界最大值",
  "Bounds View": "边界视图",
  "If this node is present, set the model view bounds explicitly.  Normally the model view bounds is derived from the render mesh bounds at model load time.": "如果存在此节点，则显式设置模型视界。通常模型视界在模型加载时从渲染网格边界推导。",
  "Bounds Hull": "边界凸包",
  "If this node is present, set the model hull bounds explicitly.  Normally the model hull bounds is derived from the physics hull bounds at model load time.": "若存在此节点，则显式设置模型碰撞包络。通常模型包络在模型加载时由物理包络推导得出。",
