  "Use RenderMesh List": "使用 RenderMesh 列表",
  "RenderMesh List": "RenderMesh 列表",
  "Limit SDF to a subset of RenderMesh nodes (otherwise use all RenderMesh nodes)": "将 SDF 限制为 RenderMesh 节点的子集（否则使用所有 RenderMesh 节点）",
  "Supplemental Bone List": "补充骨骼列表",
