  "Cannot find RenderMesh node named [ empty name ].": "找不到名为 [ 空名称 ] 的 RenderMesh 节点",
  "Simple": "简单",
  "Nearfield": "近场",
  "Heat": "热度",
  "Hybrid": "混合",
  "Pick the parent bone for the bone:": "为骨骼选择父骨骼：",
  "No parent bone specified": "未指定父骨骼",
  "Cannot specify self or any child as parent": "不能指定自身或任何子级作为父级",
  "Parent bone '%s' specified by define bone could not be found.": "Define Bone 指定的父骨骼 '%s' 未找到。",
  "Generates a distance field using the mesh triangles selected in child nodes.": "使用子节点中选中的网格三角形生成距离场",
  "Surface Bias": "表面偏置",
  "Distance Offset": "距离偏移",
  "Two Sided": "双面",
  "Far Field Only": "仅远场",
  "Trace the distance field with low fidelity far field occlusion only. This can be much faster, but the result will lack high frequency occlusion detail.": "仅以低保真度的远场遮挡来追踪距离场。这会快得多，但结果将缺少高频遮挡细节。",
  "Use For Occlusion": "用于遮挡",
  "Whether this distance field contributes to AO.": "此距离场是否参与环境光遮蔽（AO）。",
  "Use For Collision": "用于碰撞",
  "Whether this distance field is a collider for certain effects such as hair simulation.": "此距离场是否作为某些效果（如头发模拟）的碰撞体。",
  "Optional bone to use as the root transform.": "用作根变换的可选骨骼",
  "Add Extra Boundary Voxels": "添加额外边界体素",
  "Advanced": "高级",
  "Bone Influence Filter Threshold": "骨骼影响过滤阈值",
  "Bone Influence Filter": "骨骼影响过滤",
  "Exclude Materials": "排除材质",
  "Body Group Name": "身体组名称",
  "Body Group Choice": "身体组选项",
  "DistanceField: %s": "距离场：%s",
  "Distance field body group choice for '%s' is out of range: %d selected, maximum valid choice is %d.": "'%s' 的距离场身体组选项超出范围：已选 %d，最大有效选项为 %d。",
  "Distance field body group '%s' is invalid.": "距离场身体组 '%s' 无效",
  "A selection of meshes from a file to trace against during distance field generation.": "距离场生成期间用于光线追踪的文件中网格的选择。",
  "Viewing File: %s": "正在查看文件：%s",
  "A selection of render meshes to trace against during distance field generation.": "距离场生成期间用于追踪的渲染网格选择。",
  "Input dynamic mesh deformation params": "输入动态网格变形参数",
  "Compute Dynamic Smooth Normals": "计算动态平滑法线",
  "If true, recompute smooth normals at runtime after animation.": "若为 true，动画后在运行时重新计算平滑法线。",
  "Smooth Normals Across UV Seams": "跨 UV 接缝平滑法线",
  "Avoids normal seams on UV boundaries. Turning it off is faster and saves some GPU memory.": "避免 UV 边界上的法线接缝。关闭此项速度更快并可节省一些显存。",
  "Compute Dynamic Mesh Tension": "计算动态网格张力",
  "If true, recompute dynamic mesh tension (wrinkle map) values after animation.": "若为 true，则在动画之后重新计算动态网格张力（褶皱贴图）值",
  "Tension Compress Scale": "张力压缩缩放",
  "Scale value for the tension strength of compressed parts of the mesh.": "网格受压缩部分的张力强度缩放值。",
  "Tension Stretch Scale": "张力拉伸缩放",
  "Scale value for the tension strength of stretched parts of the mesh.": "网格拉伸部分张力强度的缩放值。",
  "Frame Count": "帧数",
  "ModelDoc \"%s\" node incompatible with AnimGraph, use \"Zero Pose\" node in AnimGraph instead": "ModelDoc \\\"%s\\\" 节点与 AnimGraph 不兼容，请在 AnimGraph 中改用 \\\"Zero Pose\\\" 节点",
  "Uniform": "统一",
  "Single": "单个",
  "Specified": "已指定",
  "Specify that root motion should be extracted from this animation, if no root bone is specified, the first bone without a parent is used": "指定应从此动画提取根运动；若未指定根骨骼，则使用第一个无父级的骨骼",
  "Extract TX": "提取 TX",
  "Extract TY": "提取 TY",
  "Extract TZ": "提取 TZ",
  "Extract RZ": "提取 RZ",
  "Quadratic": "二次方",
  "Extract Initial Offset": "提取初始偏移",
  "If set, the offset of the extracted motion channels from the origin is removed and stored as a queryable value on the animation": "若设置，将移除提取的运动通道相对原点的偏移，并将其作为可查询值存储在动画上",
  "This is the bone that will used for motion extraction. If the specified bone does not exist or is unspecified, it will fall back to looking at the AnimationList parent for a root bone name. If the AnimationList root motion bone is unspecified or doesn't exist, it will fall back to using the first bone without a parent in the skeleton which is the first bone. <br><b>NOTE</b>: The first bone in the skeleton can be controlled via the BoneFlags singleton node": "这是用于运动提取的骨骼。如果指定的骨骼不存在或未指定，将退而查找 AnimationList 父级的根骨骼名称。如果 AnimationList 的根运动骨骼未指定或不存在，将退而使用骨架中第一个没有父级的骨骼，即第一个骨骼。<br><b>注意</b>：骨架中的第一个骨骼可通过 BoneFlags 单例节点控制",
  "Motion Type": "运动类型",
  "Specify the motion type.  Choices are as follows: <br><b>Single</b>: Extract motion from the first frame of the animation.<br><b>Uniform</b>: Extract motion from every frame in the animation.<br><b>Specified</b>: Specify the frame ranges with which to extract motion.<br>": "指定运动类型。选项如下：<br><b>Single</b>：从动画的第一帧提取运动。<br><b>Uniform</b>：从动画的每一帧提取运动。<br><b>Specified</b>：指定用于提取运动的帧范围。<br>",
  "Set Initial Values For Extract Motion Node": "为提取运动节点设置初始值",
  "Posture": "姿态",
  "Gesture": "手势",
  "Type of faceposer keys, Gesture or Posture": "表情键类型：手势（Gesture）或姿态（Posture）",
  "InFrame frame, also called \"apex\" and \"in\", can be aliased via \"entrytag\" in sequence KV": "InFrame 帧，也称为 \\\"apex\\\" 和 \\\"in\\\"，可通过序列 KV 中的 \\\"entrytag\\\" 设置别名",
  "Accent": "重点",
  "Accent frame of the gesture/posture, unused": "手势/姿态的重音帧，未使用",
  "Start Loop": "起始循环",
  "Frame where looping starts, also called \"loop\", can be aliased via \"startloop\" in sequence KV": "循环开始的帧，也称为\\\"loop\\\"，可通过序列 KV 中的\\\"startloop\\\"设置别名",
  "End Loop": "结束循环",
  "Frame where looping ends, also called \"endloop\" and \"end\", can be aliased via \"endloop\" in sequence KV": "循环结束的帧，也称为 \\\"endloop\\\" 和 \\\"end\\\"，可在序列 KV 中通过 \\\"endloop\\\" 别名引用",
  "Exit": "退出",
  "Frame where looping ends, also called \"end\" and \"out\", can be aliased via \"exittags\" in sequence KV": "循环结束的帧，也称 \\\"end\\\" 和 \\\"out\\\"，可通过序列 KV 中的 \\\"exittags\\\" 设置别名",
  "Thumbnail": "缩略图",
  "Frame to be used at the thumbnail pose in Faceposer": "在 Faceposer 中用于缩略图姿态的帧",
  "Base class for nodes which can be children of FaceposerMarkupBase derived nodes": "可作为 FaceposerMarkupBase 派生节点子节点的节点的基类",
