  "Pick the source geo cache file": "选择源几何体缓存文件",
  "Perlin": "Perlin",
  "Two Bone": "双骨骼",
  "Dog Leg (3-Bone)": "狗腿式(3 骨骼)",
  "Match Target Orientation": "匹配目标朝向",
  "Match Target Forward Only": "仅向前匹配目标",
  "Maintain Parent Orientation": "保持父级朝向",
  "Animgraph Parameter": "动画图参数",
  "X (Red   / Forward)": "X（红/前方）",
  "Y (Green / Left)": "Y（绿 / 左）",
  "Z (Blue  / Up)": "Z（蓝  / 上）",
  "An IK chain describes a section of a model that you want to control procedurally.": "IK 链描述模型中你希望以程序化方式控制的部分。",
  "End Effector Offset Attachment": "末端执行器偏移附着点",
  "+Chain Settings": "+链设置",
  "An offset to use for positioning the chain.  Optional.": "用于定位链的偏移量。可选。",
  "Parent of Chain Requires Alignment": "链的父级需要对齐",
  "By default, any change to the chain position will be reflected in parent's rotation.  Uncheck this if you wish the parent to be left unmodified.": "默认情况下，链条位置的任何变化都会反映在父级的旋转中。如果希望父级保持不变，请取消勾选此项。",
  "Use Pole Vector for Axis": "使用极向量作为轴",
  "For solvers that require a pole vector, this sets it relative to the local space of the node being solved.  False uses the old-style runtime calculation that should be avoided (if this works...).": "对于需要极点向量的求解器，此项将其设置为相对于被求解节点的局部空间。false 使用旧式运行时计算，应避免使用（如果它有效的话……）。",
  "Pole Vector for Axis": "轴的极向量",
  "For solvers that require a pole vector, what local space X/Y/Z should it use?": "对于需要极点向量的求解器，应使用哪个本地空间 X/Y/Z？",
  "Solver Type": "求解器类型",
  "+Default Solver Settings": "+默认求解器设置",
  "Which solver to use for positioning the IK chain.  Required.": "用于定位 IK 链的求解器。必需。",
  "Num Iterations": "迭代次数",
  "How many iterations this solvers hould use.": "此求解器应使用的迭代次数。",
  "End Effector Rotation Fix Behaviour": "末端执行器旋转修正行为",
  "How the end effector should be rotated after the solve.": "解算结束后末端效应器的旋转方式。",
  "Target Source": "目标源",
  "+Default Target Settings": "+默认目标设置",
  "The default target source to use.  Animgraph will let you override this on a per node basis.": "默认使用的目标声源。AnimGraph 允许你在每个节点上覆盖此设置",
  "The target bone to use.  Animgraph will let you override this on a per node basis.": "要使用的目标骨骼。动画图允许按节点覆盖此设置。",
  "Not enough joints for an IK chain of this default solver type (found %d, expected at least %d)": "此默认求解器类型的 IK 链关节数不足（找到 %d 个，至少需要 %d 个）",
  "Invalid bone specified for default target settings.": "默认目标设置中指定的骨骼无效。",
  "An individual joint in an IK chain.": "IK 链中的一个关节。",
  "All data pertaining to IK.": "与 IK 相关的所有数据。",
  "A joint constraint depicting a hinge: i.e., two bones locked against a plane, with a min/max angle.": "描述铰链的关节约束：即两个骨骼锁定在一个平面上，并具有最小/最大角度。",
  "Minimum Degrees": "最小角度",
