  "Cloth Node 3": "布料节点 3",
  "Output Filename": "输出文件名",
  "Output filename of the generated texture. The output is relative to the VMDL output location. Optionally use $modelname$ to use the current model name.": "生成的纹理的输出文件名。输出相对于 VMDL 输出位置。可选择使用 $modelname$ 来使用当前模型名称。",
  "Output Resolution": "输出分辨率",
  "Output resolution of the generated texture.": "生成纹理的输出分辨率。",
  "Mesh node name": "网格节点名称",
  "The specified mesh node is used to generate this texture.": "指定的网格节点用于生成此纹理。",
  "Material Filter": "材质过滤器",
  "Ignore faces whose material matches this substring.": "忽略材质匹配此子串的面。",
  "Texture Generator Preview": "纹理生成器预览",
  "TextureGenerator output filename is empty.": "TextureGenerator 输出文件名为空。",
  "TextureGenerator was unable to find the CONTENT path.": "TextureGenerator 无法找到 CONTENT 路径。",
  "Filename %s specifies extension '%s', but this node will generate a '%s'. You can specify output filename without an extension, or use '%s'": "文件名 %s 指定了扩展名“%s”，但此节点将生成“%s”。您可以指定不带扩展名的输出文件名，或使用“%s”",
  "TextureGenerator invalid output filename: %s": "TextureGenerator 输出文件名无效：%s",
  "TextureGenerator was unable to build the target output path: %s": "TextureGenerator 无法构建目标输出路径：%s",
  "TextureGenerator requires a valid mesh node.": "TextureGenerator 需要有效的网格节点。",
  "TextureGenerator failed to locate mesh named '%s'.": "TextureGenerator 未能找到名为 '%s' 的网格。",
  "TextureGenerator does not handle multi-mesh nodes": "TextureGenerator 不支持处理多网格节点",
  "TextureGenerator empty or invalid mesh set.": "TextureGenerator 网格集为空或无效",
  "TextureGenerator material missing mode %s": "TextureGenerator 材质缺少模式 %s",
  "TextureGenerator was unable to initialize the output render target.": "TextureGenerator 无法初始化输出渲染目标。",
  "TextureGenerator was unable to validate the output render target.": "TextureGenerator 无法验证输出渲染目标。",
  "TextureGenerator material mode %s has no renderable passes.": "TextureGenerator 材质模式 %s 没有可渲染的通道。",
  "TextureGenerator ReadTexturePixels failure.": "TextureGenerator ReadTexturePixels 失败。",
  "Generates a texture that represents a model's object-space surface in UV-space, effectively a UV-to-object-space lookup table.": "生成表示模型在 UV 空间中对象空间表面的纹理，实际上是一张 UV 到对象空间的查找表。",
  "Edge Dilation": "边缘膨胀",
  "Dilate pixels at UV island edges.": "在 UV 岛边缘进行像素扩张（dilate）",
  "TextureGenerator was unable to generate a pixel position map.": "TextureGenerator 无法生成像素位置贴图。",
  "TextureGenerator was unable to write to %s": "TextureGenerator 无法写入 %s",
  "Generates an object-space normal map.": "生成物体空间法线贴图。",
  "Specify a tangent-space normal map (source texture) that will contribute to the object-space output.": "指定一个切线空间法线贴图（源纹理），它将贡献到对象空间输出。",
  "Internal Render Resolution": "内部渲染分辨率",
  "Render internally at this size for effective super-sampling.": "以此尺寸在内部渲染以实现有效超采样。",
  "TextureGenerator failed to create %s": "TextureGenerator 未能创建 %s",
  "TextureGenerator cannot load %s": "TextureGenerator 无法加载 %s",
  "TextureGenerator cannot find %s": "TextureGenerator 找不到 %s",
  "Generates a texture with white values representing more convex local surface topology, and black values representing more concave local surface topology.": "生成一张纹理，白色值表示更凸起的局部表面拓扑，黑色值表示更凹陷的局部表面拓扑。",
  "Sample Count": "采样数",
  "Number of samples per pixel.": "每像素采样数。",
  "Surface Offset": "表面偏移",
  "Offset the centroid of the sample position from the surface by this amount.": "将采样位置质心从表面偏移此数量。",
  "Trace Distance": "追踪距离",
  "Radius of surface sample ray traces.": "表面采样光线追踪的半径。",
  "Remap Min": "重映射最小值",
  "Remap the trace result value relative to this range.": "将追踪结果值相对于此范围进行重映射",
  "Remap Max": "重映射最大值",
  "Ambient Occlusion Map": "环境光遮蔽贴图",
  "Specify an ambient occlusion map (source texture) to multiply over the generated cavity map.": "指定要乘到生成的空腔贴图之上的环境光遮蔽贴图（源纹理）。",
  "Ambient Occlusion Map Power": "环境光遮蔽贴图强度",
  "Power scale for applying the supplemental ambient occlusion map.": "应用补充环境光遮蔽贴图的强度缩放。",
  "TextureGenerator failed to load %s": "TextureGenerator 未能加载 %s",
  "Position map produced zero ray trace start positions. There might be no UVs in 0-1 space?": "位置图生成了零个光线追踪起点。0-1 空间中可能没有 UV？",
  "Computed PointOcclusionMap for %i pixels in %.3f (%i pixels per job, %i total traces)": "为 %i 个像素计算 PointOcclusionMap 用时 %.3f（每个作业 %i 像素，共 %i 次追踪）",
  "Generates a texture indicating per-pixel occlusion from a point source.": "生成一个指示来自点源的逐像素遮挡的纹理。",
  "Brightness": "亮度",
  "How much to consider facing angle in occlusion.": "遮挡计算中考虑朝向角度的程度。",
  "Generates a texture using face vertex colors.": "使用面顶点色生成纹理。",
  "FaceVertex Stream Name": "面顶点流名称",
  "TextureGenerator was unable to find face vertex stream '%s' on mesh '%s'.": "TextureGenerator 未能找到面顶点流“%s”（网格“%s”）。",
  "Cloth Collision Group - colliders within the group affect only particles within the same group.": "布料碰撞组 - 组内的碰撞体仅影响同一组内的粒子。",
  "Cloth Chain Alignment - align joints in a ClothNode chain along X axis, as per animators' convention.": "布料链对齐 - 按动画师惯例沿 X 轴对齐 ClothNode 链中的关节。",
  "Cloth Self Collision Layer - sets up collision between cloth layers.": "布料自碰撞层——设置布料层之间的碰撞。",
  "Parent Reaction": "父级反应",
  "Parent Layer": "父层",
  "Child Layer": "子层",
  "Vertex-Vertex Only": "仅顶点-顶点",
  "Face-Vertex CCD": "面-顶点 CCD",
  "Face-Vertex 1-sided": "面到顶点单侧",
  "Local Hierarchy controls the space in which sub-frame interpolation occurs. Normally each bone will use parent space (local space) for sub-frame interpolation between two keyframes. Local Hierarchy allows the interpolation to occur in the space of a different bone or model space (world space). The space of a different bone is useful for switching the hand which is holding an objects, for example. Specifying no bone as the New Parent Bone will result in the interpolation occuring in model space (world space). This is useful if the bone becomes detached from the model, e.g. dropping a weapon. Local Hierarchy only affects how sub-frame interpolation between two key frames occurs. Local Hierarchy does not encode the bone differently at compile time.": "局部层级控制子帧插值发生的空间。通常每个骨骼在两个关键帧之间使用父空间（局部空间）进行子帧插值。局部层级允许插值发生在另一骨骼的空间或模型空间（世界空间）中。另一骨骼的空间例如可用于切换持有物体的手。不将任何骨骼指定为新父骨骼将导致插值发生在模型空间（世界空间）中。这在骨骼从模型上脱离时很有用，例如丢下武器。局部层级仅影响两个关键帧之间子帧插值的发生方式，不会在编译时以不同方式编码骨骼。",
  "Whether the local hierarchy will use ease in/out values or just automatically apply for the entire frame range": "局部层级是使用缓入/缓出值，还是在整个帧范围内自动应用",
  "Specify the local hierarchy frame range:": "指定局部层级帧范围：",
  "Copy & Simplify": "复制并简化",
  "Failed to duplicate mesh '%s'": "无法复制网格 '%s'",
  "List of meshes that contribute to this LOD Group": "构成此 LOD 组的网格列表",
  "A group of meshes that render as a lower-detail LOD replacement beyond a certain threshold.": "超过特定阈值后作为低细节 LOD 替代进行渲染的一组网格。",
  "Switch Threshold": "切换阈值",
  "Move camera to LOD threshold distance": "将相机移至 LOD 阈值距离",
  "Set LOD threshold from current camera distance": "根据当前相机距离设置 LOD 阈值",
  "LOD %d (%.1f)": "LOD %d (%.1f)",
  "%s references unknown mesh: '%s'": "%s 引用了未知网格：'%s'",
  "A group of meshes that are present in all lod levels.": "存在于所有 LOD 级别中的网格组。",
  "All LOD Levels": "所有 LOD 级别",
  "A list of mutually-exclusive materials (skins) that the game can dynamically select between.": "游戏可动态选择的一组互斥材质（皮肤）列表。",
  "New material group name:": "新材质组名称：",
  "Specifies the materials that the model will render with by default. (Allows overriding the materials inferred from the source FBX/DMX file.)": "指定模型默认使用的材质。（允许覆盖从源 FBX/DMX 文件推断的材质。）",
  "Replace materials on an input mesh": "替换输入网格上的材质",
  "Controls the order of the draw calls for this mesh by specifying the order of materials for each draw call the mesh.Only the materials on the original mesh need to be specified, any materials no on the mesh will have no effect.": "通过为网格的每个绘制调用指定材质顺序来控制此网格绘制调用的顺序。只需指定原始网格上的材质，不在网格上的材质不会有任何效果。",
  "Draw Order": "绘制顺序",
  "entries will be ordered first, unspecified entries will be added after ordered entries in an unspecified order.": "已指定的条目将排在前面，未指定的条目将以未定义顺序排在其后",
  "List of meshes": "网格列表",
  "Add to Selection": "添加到选择",
