  "Fail on empty": "为空时失败",
  "By default, empty selection is the failure case. Set this to false to make having not-empty selection be a failure case.": "默认情况下，空选择视为失败。将此项设为 false 可使非空选择成为失败情况。",
  "Error (not warn)": "错误（非警告）",
  "If set, considers failure cases to be errors. Failures are warnings by default.": "如果设置，则将失败情况视为错误。默认情况下失败为警告。",
  "Selection Assertion Failed: Vertex selection should %sbe empty.": "选择断言失败：顶点选择应%s为空。",
  "Selection Assertion Failed: Edge selection should %sbe empty.": "选择断言失败：边选择应%s为空。",
  "Selection Assertion Failed: Face selection should %sbe empty.": "选择断言失败：面选择应%s为空。",
  "Loads an external mesh file and transfers its morph data (blend shapes) onto the parent mesh using a wrap deformer. The MeshOpStack vertex selection controls which vertices are affected when transferring morph deltas.": "加载外部网格文件，并使用包裹变形器（wrap deformer）将其变形数据（混合形状）传递到父网格。MeshOpStack 的顶点选择决定传递变形增量时影响哪些顶点",
  "The mesh file containing morph data to transfer onto the parent mesh": "包含要传输到父网格的变形数据的网格文件",
  "Selection Mode": "选择模式",
  "Controls how the mesh op vertex selection is applied during morph transfer": "控制变形传递期间如何应用网格操作顶点选择",
  "No source file specified for TransferMorphs": "未为 TransferMorphs 指定源文件",
  "Failed to load source file '%s'": "无法加载源文件“%s”",
  "Failed to get document from source file '%s'": "无法从源文件 '%s' 获取文档",
  "No meshes found in source file '%s'": "在源文件 '%s' 中未找到网格",
  "No morph data to transfer from specified mesh": "指定网格没有可转移的形变数据",
  "No Morphs Transferred: No vertices are selected and selection mode is include": "未传递任何变形：未选择任何顶点且选择模式为包含",
  "No Morphs Transferred: All vertices are selected and selection mode is exclude": "未传输任何变形：所有顶点均被选中且选择模式为排除",
  "Failed to transfer deltas from '%s'": "无法从 '%s' 传递增量",
  "A transform which was the parent of a mesh without explicit skinning defined in the source geometry file": "源几何体文件中未定义显式蒙皮的网格的父级变换",
  "Child Mesh Name": "子网格名称",
  "The name of the unskinned child mesh of this transform in the source geometry file.": "源几何文件中此变换的未蒙片子网格的名称。",
  "Find and replace in resource references across the document (NOTE: Some references like materialgroups may be missed with the current implementation.)": "在文档中查找并替换资源引用（注意：当前实现可能会遗漏 materialgroups 等部分引用。）",
  "Find String": "查找字符串",
  "String or substring to find in resource name": "要在资源名称中查找的字符串或子字符串",
  "Replacement String": "替换字符串",
  "What to replace matches with": "用什么替换匹配项",
  "Attribute Name Pattern": "属性名称模式",
  "Optional pattern for attribute names (* for wildcards.) Note that this matches against non-display (ie. raw view) attribute names.": "属性名称的可选模式（* 为通配符）。注意：此模式匹配的是非显示（即原始视图）属性名称。",
  "Rename the specified bone replacing all references to the original bone name with the new bone name.": "重命名指定骨骼，并将所有对原骨骼名称的引用替换为新骨骼名称。",
  "Original Bone Name": "原骨骼名称",
  "Original name of the bone": "骨骼的原始名称",
  "New name to assign to the bone": "要分配给骨骼的新名称",
  "Error if Not Found": "未找到时报错",
  "Should it be considered an error if this bone isn't found to rename?": "如果未找到要重命名的骨骼，是否视为错误？",
  "New bone name cannot be empty": "新骨骼名称不能为空",
  "Original bone name cannot be empty": "原始骨骼名不能为空",
  "Bone names must differ": "骨骼名称必须不同",
  "Could not find bone with name '%s' or '%s'": "找不到名为 '%s' 或 '%s' 的骨骼",
  "Unable to rename bone from '%s' to '%s', due to conflict with new name.": "由于与新名称冲突，无法将骨骼从 \"%s\" 重命名为 \"%s\"。",
  "Translate the overall model by the specified vector.": "按指定向量平移整个模型。",
  "Removes all morph data from the compiled model.": "从编译后的模型中移除所有变形数据。",
  "Copy skinning information from one rendermesh to another, based on a simple heuristic.": "基于简单启发式方法将蒙皮信息从一个渲染网格复制到另一个。",
  "Source Mesh": "源网格",
  "Destination Mesh": "目标网格",
  "Failed to find source node '%s'": "找不到源节点 '%s'",
  "Source and dest cannot be the same": "源和目标不能相同",
  "Source node has no mesh data": "源节点没有网格数据",
  "Dest node has no mesh data": "目标节点没有网格数据",
  "Generate decal UVs on the specified channel": "在指定通道上生成贴花 UV",
  "Channel Name": "通道名称",
  "Material Property": "材质属性",
  "Foliage-specific vertex normal modification.": "植被专用的顶点法线修改。",
  "Project From Primitive": "从图元投影",
  "Smooth By Distance": "按距离平滑",
  "Override Vector": "覆盖向量",
  "Sphere": "球体",
  "Capsule": "胶囊体",
  "Modification Amount": "修改量",
  "Amount to modify vertex normals (0-none, 1-completely)": "修改顶点法线的程度（0-不变，1-完全）",
  "Write Separate Vertex Stream": "写入独立顶点流",
  "If enabled writes the modified normals into a separate vertex stream to be used by the shader. Otherwise modifies meshes original normals.": "启用时将修改后的法线写入单独的顶点流供着色器使用；否则修改网格原始法线。",
  "Operator": "操作符",
  "Operator to be used to set vertex normals": "用于设置顶点法线的运算符",
  "Smooth Distance": "平滑距离",
  "Average vertex normals over given distance to point away from neighbors.": "在给定距离上平均顶点法线，使其偏离相邻顶点。",
  "Projected Primitive": "投影图元",
  "Primitive type to project vertex normals from.": "用于投影顶点法线的图元类型。",
  "Primitive Position": "图元位置",
  "Position of the primitive to project normals from.": "用于投影法线的图元位置。",
  "Primitive Height": "图元高度",
  "Height of the primitive to project normals from.": "用于投影法线的图元高度。",
  "Primitive Radius": "基元半径",
  "Radius of the primitive to project normals from.": "用于投影法线的图元半径。",
  "Override all mesh normals with a specific vector.": "用特定向量覆盖所有网格法线",
  "Exclude meshes which have set materials assigned.": "排除已指定材质集的网格。",
  "CModelDocModelModifier_FoliageVertexNormals: Computing...": "CModelDocModelModifier_FoliageVertexNormals：正在计算...",
  "Per-material sorting options. Normally used for transparency sorting.": "每材质排序选项。通常用于透明排序。",
  "Mesh & Skeleton": "网格和骨骼",
  "Skeleton Only": "仅骨架",
  "Content": "内容",
  "This model will fail to compile outside a development environment.": "在开发环境之外，此模型将无法编译。",
  "This is Work-In-Progress Content": "这是未完成的内容",
  "Safeguard against producing a model outside budgetary limits.": "防止生成超出预算限制的模型。",
  "Max vertex count of LOD0": "LOD0 的最大顶点数",
  "Max triangle count of LOD0": "LOD0 的最大三角形数",
  "Max total vertex count (all LODs)": "最大总顶点数（所有 LOD）",
  "Max total triangle count (all LODs)": "最大三角形总数（所有 LOD）",
  "Max number of LODs": "LOD 最大数量",
  "Max MaterialGroup count": "最大材质组数",
  "Max BodyGroup count": "最大身体组数",
  "Max Bone count": "最大骨骼数",
  "Treat Warnings as Errors": "将警告视为错误",
  "Automatically export a representative FBX of this model next to the VMDL for reference purposes.": "自动将此模型的代表性 FBX 导出到 VMDL 旁边以供参考。",
  "FBX filename suffix": "FBX 文件名后缀",
  "Appended to output filename for example supplying '_reference' to 'mymodel.vmdl' will produce 'mymodel_reference.nocompile.fbx'": "追加到输出文件名，例如为 'mymodel.vmdl' 提供 '_reference' 将生成 'mymodel_reference.nocompile.fbx'",
  "Export destination root": "导出目标根目录",
  "Export into the GAME or CONTENT root.": "导出到 GAME 或 CONTENT 根目录。",
  "Export Type": "导出类型",
  "Type of data to export.  Note that skeleton can only be filtered if type is skeleton only": "要导出的数据类型。注意只有类型为仅骨架时才能过滤骨架",
  "Inverse ModelDoc Scale": "ModelDoc 反向缩放",
  "Applies the inverse scale of a ModelDoc_ScaleAndMirror scale value if true.  Note that only applies if type is skeleton only": "若为真，则应用 ModelDoc_ScaleAndMirror 缩放值的反向缩放。注意仅当类型为仅骨架时生效",
  "Exclude Bones With Flags": "排除带有标志的骨骼",
  "Bones which have the specified flags are excluded from skeleton only exports.  The bones can have other flags as well.": "具有指定标志的骨骼将被排除在仅骨架导出之外。这些骨骼还可以具有其他标志。",
  "Exclude Bones With Exact Flags": "排除具有完全匹配标志的骨骼",
  "Bones which have the specified flags exactly, i.e. no other flags set, are excluded from skeleton only exports.": "恰好具有指定标志（即未设置其他标志）的骨骼将被排除在仅骨架导出之外。",
  "Set specific model flags.  This node is rarely used": "设置特定的模型标志。此节点很少使用",
  "No Forced Fade": "无强制淡出",
  "Disable global fade for the entity using this model, if the entity supports it.": "为使用此模型的实体禁用全局淡出（如果该实体支持）。",
  "Do Not Cast Shadows": "不投射阴影",
  "If the entity using this model derives from BaseAnimating will AddEffects( EF_SHADOW ) to the entity on spawn": "如果使用此模型的实体派生自 BaseAnimating，则生成时为其添加 AddEffects( EF_SHADOW )",
  "Keep Vertices In Memory": "在内存中保留顶点",
  "When this model is loaded preserve vertex data in CPU memory.": "加载此模型时在 CPU 内存中保留顶点数据。",
  "Apply a scale to the entire model": "对整个模型应用缩放",
  "Uniform scale factor to apply to the model": "应用于模型的统一缩放系数",
  "Mirror X": "镜像 X",
  "Mirror the model across the x-axis": "沿 x 轴镜像模型",
  "Mirror Y": "镜像 Y",
  "Mirror the model across the y-axis": "沿 y 轴镜像模型",
  "Mirror Z": "镜像 Z",
  "Mirror the model across the z-axis": "沿 z 轴镜像模型",
  "Flip Bone Forward": "翻转骨骼朝前",
  "Flip the forward (x) axis direction of bones": "翻转骨骼的前向 (x) 轴方向",
  "Swap Left And Right Bones": "交换左右骨骼",
  "Swap left and right bone names": "交换左右骨骼名称",
  "Delayed": "延迟",
  "A shape which is applied as a corrective shape when the referenced shapes are active, referenced shapes are separated by double underscores, i.e. '__'": "当引用的形状处于活动状态时作为校正形状应用的形状，引用的形状以双下划线分隔，即 '__'",
  "Morph Shape": "形变形状",
  "Two morph controls which should be grouped into a single control": "应归为一组单一控件的两个变形控件",
  "Min Morph Shape": "最小变形形状",
  "Max Morph Shape": "最大变形形状",
  "And": "与",
  "A morph control which should be split into right_ and left_ stereo controls if a balance map is present": "如果存在平衡贴图，应拆分为 right_ 和 left_ 立体控制的变形控制",
  "Morph Control": "变形控制器",
  "The Morph Shape For This Incremental Morph": "此增量变形的变形形状",
  "Peak": "峰值",
  "The Peak Value For This Incremental Morph Shape": "此增量形变形状的峰值",
  "A morph control which controls a set of weighted shapes": "控制一组加权形状的变形控件",
  "Shapes": "形状",
  "Shapes controlled by this incremental control": "由该增量控件控制的形状",
  "Invalid Peak %.2g for Incremental Shape \"%s\", valid range [0.0, 1.0]": "增量形状 \\\"%s\\\" 的峰值 %.2g 无效，有效范围 [0.0, 1.0]",
  "Incremental Shapes \"%s\" & \"%s\" cannot have the same Peak value %.2g": "增量形状“%s”和“%s”不能具有相同的峰值 %.2g",
  "Couldn't create MorphControl named \"%s\"": "无法创建名为\\\"%s\\\"的 MorphControl",
  "Invalid Peak value %.2g == next Peak value %.2g on Incremental Shape \"%s\"": "增量形状“%s”上的峰值 %.2g 无效，等于下一个峰值 %.2g",
  "Couldn't create Morph Rule named \"%s\"": "无法创建名为 \\\"%s\\\" 的形变规则",
  "A morph dominator": "变形主导器（Morph Dominator）",
  "Suppressed Shapes": "抑制的形状",
  "Shapes suppressed when this shape is active": "该形状激活时被抑制的形状",
  "Input morph params": "输入变形参数",
  "Disable Morph": "禁用变形",
  "If true, morph data from this mesh is ignored by the compiler and won't be part of the resulting compiled model.": "如果为 true，编译器将忽略此网格的变形数据，且不会包含在最终编译的模型中。",
  "Include Speed": "包含速度",
  "If true, and speed vertex map values exists, include them in the resulting morph data.": "如果为真且存在速度顶点贴图值，则将其包含在生成的变形数据中。",
  "Include Wrinkle": "包含褶皱",
  "If true, and wrinkle vertex map values exists, include them in the resulting morph data.": "若为真且存在皱褶顶点贴图值，则将其包含在生成的形变数据中。",
  "Best Fit Atlas": "最佳适配图集",
  "If true, try to pack the morph data into the smallest texture size during compile.  This is a slow operation.": "若为真，编译时尝试将变形数据打包到最小的纹理尺寸。此操作较慢。",
  "Width Target": "宽度目标",
  "Set the target width for the morph texture.  It will automatically grow if necessary.  This is the starting size for the best fit atlas algorithm, setting it close to the best atlas size will speed up compilation if best fit atlas is true.": "设置变形纹理的目标宽度。必要时会自动增长。这是最佳适配图集算法的起始尺寸；如果启用最佳适配图集，将其设置得接近最佳图集大小可加快编译速度。",
  "Height Target": "高度目标",
  "Set the target height for the morph texture.  It will automatically grow if necessary.  This is the starting size for the best fit atlas algorithm, setting it close to the best atlas size will speed up compilation if best fit atlas is true.": "设置变形纹理的目标高度。必要时会自动增长。这是最佳适配图集算法的起始大小，如果启用了最佳适配图集，将其设置得接近最佳图集大小可以加快编译速度。",
  "Cut Min": "切割最小值",
  "Cut Max": "切割上限",
  "Viewing PhysicsFile: %s": "正在查看 PhysicsFile：%s",
  "Viewing %s: (all inputs)": "正在查看 %s：（所有输入）",
  "Quadric Error Metric": "二次误差度量",
  "Incremental Vertex Reduction": "增量顶点精简",
  "Incremental Face Reduction": "递增面缩减",
  "Exact": "精确",
  "Don't remove verts/faces/edges unless there are > 256": "除非数量大于 256，否则不移除顶点/面/边",
  "Automatically builds a physics hull from render geometry.": "从渲染几何体自动构建物理凸包。",
  "Face Merge Angle": "面合并角度",
  "Max Vertices Per Hull": "每个凸包最大顶点数",
  "Optimization Algorithm": "优化算法",
  "Expand point with eight additional vertices in a box shape.": "用盒状的八个额外顶点扩展点。",
  "Tetrahedron": "四面体",
  "Expand point with six additional vertices in a tetrahedron shape.": "以四面体形状用六个额外顶点扩展该点。",
  "Point is a single vertex.": "点是单个顶点。",
  "Automatically builds a physics hull from user-specified points": "根据用户指定的点自动构建物理凸包",
  "Place these under a PhysicsHullFromPoints node to build a custom-shaped hull from scratch, or place under a PhysicsHullFile node to modify an existing hull.": "将这些放在 PhysicsHullFromPoints 节点下可从零构建自定义形状的凸包，或放在 PhysicsHullFile 节点下修改现有凸包。",
  "ScaleXYZ": "缩放 XYZ",
  "Point Type": "点类型",
  "This PhysicsHullPoint will be ignored because its parent PhysicsHullFile is not in single-hull mode.": "此物理外壳点将被忽略，因为其父级 PhysicsHullFile 未处于单外壳模式。",
  "Reference to a file containing one or more meshes to be converted to a convex hull.": "对包含一个或多个待转换为凸包的网格的文件的引用。",
  "Import Mode": "导入模式",
  "Small Element Threshold": "小元素阈值",
  "Thin Element Threshold": "薄元素阈值",
  "Disable Region SVM": "禁用区域 SVM",
  "Disable building a Region SVM for this model. Disabling this will save memory and disk space, but reduce the performance of sphere traces against the model.": "禁用为此模型构建 Region SVM。禁用可节省内存和磁盘空间，但会降低对该模型进行球体追踪的性能。",
  "Ignoring invalid hull with %i vertices: %s": "忽略具有 %i 个顶点的无效凸包：%s",
  "Hull Too Complex for Runtime (%d verts, %d edges, %d faces)": "包络对运行时而言过于复杂（%d 个顶点，%d 条边，%d 个面）",
  "Max Vertices Per Mesh": "每个网格最大顶点数",
  "Simplify (Qem Error)": "简化(QEM 误差)",
  "Reference to file which contains one or meshes to be used a physics mesh.": "对包含一个或多个用作物理网格的网格的文件的引用。",
  "Simplification Params": "简化参数",
  "Removed %d verts from %d meshes": "已从 %d 个网格中移除 %d 个顶点",
  "Viewing PhysicsMeshFile: %s": "正在查看 PhysicsMeshFile：%s",
  "Automatically builds a physics mesh from render geometry.": "从渲染几何体自动构建物理网格。",
  "Removed %d verts from meshes": "已从网格中移除 %d 个顶点",
  "Specify which specific shapes belong to this detail layer(s)<br><br><em>(NOTE: All other shapes will <strong>NOT</strong> belong to these detail layers unless explicitly included)</em>": "指定哪些特定形状属于此细节层<br><br><em>（注意：除非明确包含，否则所有其他形状将<strong>不属于</strong>这些细节层）</em>",
  "Detail Layer": "细节图层",
  "This detail layer will only include the specified shapes.<br><br><em>(NOTE: Unspecified shapes will be removed from these detail layers automatically. Use 'PhysicsDetailLayerOverride' for more control. )</em>": "此细节层将只包含指定的形状。<br><br><em>（注意：未指定的形状将自动从这些细节层中移除。如需更多控制，请使用 'PhysicsDetailLayerOverride'）</em>",
  "These shapes will be included in the given detail layer": "这些形状将包含在指定的细节层中",
  "Allow Empty Detail Layer": "允许空细节层",
  "If there are 0 shapes in this detail layer at this is enabled, entities targeting this detail layer will not collide with the model at all<br><br><em>(NOTE: This will cause clipping and is probably not what you want )</em>": "如果此细节层中有 0 个形状且已启用此项，则以此细节层为目标的实体将完全不与模型碰撞<br><br><em>（注意：这会导致穿模，可能不是你想要的效果）</em>",
  "Explicitly define what detail layers specific shapes should/shouldn't belong to": "明确定义特定形状应/不应属于哪些细节层",
  "These shapes will be assigned the given detail layers": "这些形状将被赋予给定的细节层",
  "These detail layers will only include the specified shapes.<br><br><em>(NOTE: This will also remove other shapes from these detail layers unless 'Is Exclusive' is unchecked )</em>": "这些细节层将只包含指定的形状。<br><br><em>（注意：除非取消勾选“独占”(Is Exclusive)，否则这也会从这些细节层中移除其他形状）</em>",
  "Included Detail Layers are Exclusive": "包含的细节图层互斥",
  "Shapes not on this node will not be part of the detail layer automatically<br><br><em>(NOTE: PhysicsDetailLayer always enables this )</em>": "不在此节点上的形状不会自动成为细节层的一部分<br><br><em>（注意：PhysicsDetailLayer 始终启用此项）</em>",
  "These detail layers will NOT include the specified shapes.<br><br><em>(NOTE: The shapes will belong to all other non-exclusive detail layers, unless 'Included Detail Layers' is specified)</em>": "这些细节图层将不包含指定形状。<br><br><em>（注意：除非指定了“包含的细节图层”，这些形状将属于所有其他非排他细节图层）</em>",
  "Also Missing Exclusive Detail Layers": "同时缺少独占细节层",
  "Shapes on this node will be missing any detail layers on the model not included on this node.": "此节点上的形状将缺少模型上存在但此节点未包含的细节层。",
  "Missing(%s)": "缺失(%s)",
  "{ EMPTY }": "{ 空 }",
  "| %i shapes": "| %i 个形状",
  "Physics body markup data": "物理刚体标记数据",
  "Target Body": "目标刚体",
  "Tag": "标签",
  "Inertia Scale": "惯性缩放",
  "Linear Damping": "线性阻尼",
  "Angular Damping": "角阻尼",
