  "Monitor Observable": "监视可观察对象",
  "While active, manage child cursors based on the results of a boolean condition. When the observable result changes, the prior cursor will be canceled and the appropriate outflow will fire a new child cursor. Will monitor continuously until externally canceled.": "激活期间，根据布尔条件的结果管理子游标。当可观察结果变化时，先前的游标将被取消，相应的输出流将触发新的子游标。将持续监视直到被外部取消。",
  "Begin testing a condition composed of Observable values. Continues checking until canceled.": "开始测试由 Observable 值组成的条件。持续检查直到取消。",
