  "Compare strings with case sensitivity, in contrast to normal string equality which is case-insensitive.": "比较字符串时区分大小写，与不区分大小写的普通字符串相等比较不同。",
  "String Length": "字符串长度",
  "Count the number of codepoints in the string (unicode-aware). If you want rendered glyphs, you probably want to consider using Panorama.": "统计字符串中的码点数量（支持 Unicode）。若要统计渲染的字形，建议使用 Panorama。",
  "Format Duration String From Seconds": "将秒数格式化为时长字符串",
  "Turn a time in seconds into a display string. NOT localized.": "将以秒计的时间转换为显示字符串。不进行本地化。",
  "Pitch": "俯仰",
  "Yaw": "偏航角",
  "Roll": "翻滚",
  "Choose Best": "选择最佳",
  "Process Selector": "处理选择器",
  "Choose the best outflow with all rules passing, as determined by number of passing rules (specificity).": "选择所有规则都通过的最佳流出，依据是通过的规则数量（特异性）。",
  "Choose First": "选择第一个",
  "Choose the first outflow with all rules passing, from left to right": "从左到右选择所有规则都通过的第一个出口",
  "Select Best Exit": "选择最佳出口",
  "Evaluate the requirements of each connected node": "求值每个已连接节点的条件",
  "Limit Count": "数量限制",
  "Skip this node after the limit. Check Type does not apply, the limit will always be checked.": "达到限制后跳过此节点。检查类型不适用，始终会检查限制。",
  "Check Requirement": "检查需求",
  "Commit Step": "提交步骤",
  "Flow Node ID": "流程节点 ID",
  "Pass Outflow": "通过出口",
  "Fail Outflow": "失败出流",
  "Check Type": "检查类型",
  "Outflow List": "输出流列表",
  "Array Count": "数组计数",
  "Return the number of elements in the array.": "返回数组中元素的数量。",
  "Array Set Count": "数组设置数量",
  "Set the number of elements in the array.": "设置数组中的元素数量。",
  "Array First N Elements": "数组前 N 个元素",
  "Returns up to the maximum requested elements. Never grows the array (unlike SetCount).": "返回最多所请求的元素数。绝不扩展数组（不同于 SetCount）",
  "Array Append": "数组追加",
  "Copy 'element' to the end of 'a', increasing its count by one.": "将 'element' 复制到 'a' 的末尾，使其数量加一。",
  "Array Insert": "数组插入",
  "Insert 'element' in the given index in 'a', increasing its count by one and moving the elements after index.": "在“a”中的给定索引处插入“element”，使其计数加一并后移该索引之后的元素。",
  "Array Remove Index": "数组移除索引",
  "Remove the element at the given index in 'a', decreasing its count by one and moving the elements after index.": "移除“a”中给定索引处的元素，使其计数减一并移动其后的元素。",
  "Array Remove Element Matching": "数组移除匹配元素",
  "Remove all elements from 'a' which compare equal to 'element'.": "移除 'a' 中与 'element' 比较相等的所有元素。",
  "Array Remove Invalid Elements": "数组移除无效元素",
  "Remove all elements from 'a' which are invalid instances.": "从 'a' 中移除所有无效实例的元素",
  "Array Concatenate": "数组连接",
  "Add the array 'b' to the end of 'a'.": "将数组 'b' 添加到 'a' 的末尾。",
  "Array Shuffle": "数组洗牌",
  "Randomizes the order of items in the array (Knuth/Fisher-Yates Shuffle)": "随机打乱数组中元素的顺序（Knuth/Fisher-Yates 洗牌）",
  "Array Find Element Matching": "数组查找匹配元素",
  "Find first element 'a' which compare equal to 'element' and return its index.": "查找第一个与“element”比较相等的“a”元素并返回其索引。",
  "Array support.": "数组支持。",
  "Enum support.": "枚举支持。",
  "Has All Flags": "拥有所有标志",
  "Whether value has ALL of the specified flags set (it may have other flags.)": "值是否设置了全部指定标志（可能还有其他标志）。",
  "Has Any Flags": "具有任一标志",
  "Whether value has ANY of the specified flags set (it may have other flags.)": "值是否设置了指定标志中的任意一个（可能还设置了其他标志。）",
  "Add Flags": "添加标志",
  "Add flags to the given value.": "向给定值添加标志。",
  "Remove Flags": "移除标志",
  "Remove flags from the given value.": "从给定值中移除标志。",
  "Register Test Checkpoint": "注册测试检查点",
  "Indicate that a checkpoint has been reached.": "指示已到达检查点。",
  "Indicate Test Failure": "指示测试失败",
  "Used to flag a test as having failed.": "用于将测试标记为失败。",
  "Assert True": "断言为真",
  "Indicates a test failure if Value is false.": "如果 Value 为 false 则表示测试失败。",
  "Is In Test Mode": "是否处于测试模式",
  "Are we currently running unit tests?": "当前是否正在运行单元测试？",
  "Test Mode Assert True": "测试模式断言为真",
  "Indicates a test failure if value is false; only tested when running unit tests": "若值为假则表示测试失败；仅在运行单元测试时测试",
  "Testing script helpers.": "测试脚本辅助函数",
  "Pause": "暂停",
  "Wait": "等待",
  "Causes each execution cursor to pause at this node for a fixed period of time. Each cursor will wake up and resume execution when the time expires, unless aborted or early-woken.": "使每个执行游标在此节点暂停固定的一段时间。时间到期后每个游标将唤醒并恢复执行，除非被中止或提前唤醒。",
  "Pause the cursor at this point.": "在此点暂停游标。",
  "Random Integer": "随机整数",
  "Generate a random integer between min and max (inclusive)": "生成 min 和 max 之间（含）的随机整数",
  "Eval": "求值",
  "Random Float": "随机浮点数",
  "Generate a random float between min and max (inclusive)": "生成 min 和 max 之间（含）的随机浮点数",
  "Base Flow  Wake Elegantly": "基础流  优雅唤醒",
  "Base Flow  Wake Immediately": "基础流程  立即唤醒",
  "Base Flow  Cancel After": "基础流  在此之后取消",
  "Base Flow  Cancel Elegantly": "基础流程  优雅取消",
  "Base Flow  Cancel Immediately": "基础流程 立即取消",
  "Wake Resume": "唤醒恢复",
  "Evaluate the curve at the specified input position": "在指定的输入位置对曲线求值",
  "Stop Waiting": "停止等待",
  "Evaluate the gradient at a position between 0 and 1": "在 0 到 1 之间的位置求梯度值",
  "Time since the start of the timer": "计时器启动以来经过的时间",
  "Value 0-1 how far along duration (always 0 if duration is -1)": "0-1 的值，表示在持续时间中的进度（持续时间为 -1 时始终为 0）",
  "Signature hook to fill out arguments for OnInterval": "用于填写 OnInterval 参数的签名钩子",
  "This is the overall duration. If -1 timer will continue forever. During this duration, we will fire a new child cursor at each Interval.": "这是总时长。如果为 -1，计时器将永远持续。在此期间，我们将在每个时间间隔触发一个新的子游标。",
  "If specified, each wait interval will vary randomly between WaitInterval this value": "如果指定，每个等待间隔将在 WaitInterval 与此值之间随机变化",
  "Start a timer with the specified duration, fire the OnInterval output": "启动指定时长的计时器，触发 OnInterval 输出",
  "Called when timer reaches the duration OR is stopped. NOTE: This will run a little while AFTER the last interval fires unless they line up perfectly.": "当计时器到达持续时间或被停止时调用。注意：除非完全对齐，否则会在最后一个间隔触发之后再稍晚一点运行。",
  "New child cursor starts here every time the wait interval elapses": "每次等待间隔结束时在此处启动新的子游标",
  "Interval Timer": "间隔计时器",
  "Wait for a duration, firing a child cursor at regular (or randomized) intervals": "等待一段持续时间，并按固定（或随机）间隔触发子游标",
  "Completed": "已完成",
  "On Interval": "按间隔",
  "Tag Cursor": "标签游标",
  "Save a named value of any type on the cursor.": "在游标上保存任意类型的命名值。",
  "Cursor Has Tag": "游标具有标签",
  "Check if the cursor already has the given tag.": "检查游标是否已具有给定标签。",
  "Any Other Cursors Have Tag": "任意其他游标具有标签",
  "Check if any yielded cursors on the graph already have the given tag.": "检查图上任何已挂起的游标是否已具有给定标签",
  "Kill Cursors With Tag": "按标签终止游标",
  "Find all the yielded cursors on this graph with the matching tag and cancel them.": "查找此图表上所有具有匹配标签的让出游标并取消它们。",
  "Wake Cursors With Tag": "按标签唤醒游标",
  "Find all the yielded cursors on this graph with the matching tag and wake them.": "在此图上查找具有匹配标签的所有已挂起源并唤醒它们。",
  "Kill All Other Cursors": "终止所有其他游标",
  "Find all the yielded cursors on this graph and cancel them.": "查找此图表上所有让出的游标并取消它们。",
  "Remove Tag From Cursor": "从游标移除标签",
  "Remove the given tag from this cursor. If other cursors are waiting on us, they will resume.": "从此游标移除给定标签。如果有其他游标在等待我们，它们将恢复。",
  "Any extra waiting cursors will be terminated. -1 for infinite cursors.": "所有额外的等待游标都将被终止。-1 表示无限游标。",
  "Apply the same tag we're waiting on to the resulting cursor upon wait completion. Can be used to wait on our result cursor with the same tag.": "等待完成时，将我们正在等待的相同标签应用到结果游标。可用于以相同标签等待我们的结果游标",
  "When we start waiting, how should we handle existing cursors?": "开始等待时，应如何处理现有游标？",
  "Wait For Cursors With Tag": "等待具有标签的游标",
  "Causes this execution cursor to wait for the completion of other cursors with the given tag. Can optionally kill the tag while waiting.": "使此执行游标等待具有给定标签的其他游标完成。可选择在等待时终止该标签。",
  "Any cursors above this count will wait, up to the limit.": "超过此数量的游标将等待，直至达到上限。",
  "Cursor Queue": "游标队列",
  "Causes each execution cursor to wait for the completion of all prior cursors that have visited this node. Use this to safely support multiple triggers to areas of the graph that take time to complete.": "使每个执行游标等待之前访问过此节点的所有游标完成。用于安全地支持对图表中耗时区域的多次触发。",
  "Library for interacting with pulse cursors.": "用于与 Pulse 游标交互的库。",
  "A string associated with this Cursor, to use later for remote Kill or Wait requests. Cursors can have any number of Tags associated with them.": "与此游标关联的字符串，供之后用于远程 Kill 或 Wait 请求。游标可以关联任意数量的标签。",
  "Optional. Type 'Any'. An associated value, e.g. the Entity Handle which is responsible for this Cursor. The Tag is defined by the unique combination of Name and Value.": "可选。类型为 'Any'。关联值，例如负责此游标的实体句柄。标签由名称与值的唯一组合定义。",
  "If this cursor spawns other work via Fire And Forget, should this Tag be inherited?": "如果此游标通过 Fire And Forget 生成了其他工作，该标签是否应被继承？",
  "Cursors Allowed To Wait": "允许等待的游标",
  "Wait Complete": "等待完成",
  "Tag Self When Complete": "完成时标记自身",
  "Desired Kill Priority": "所需终止优先级",
  "Cursors Allowed To Run Parallel": "允许并行运行的游标数",
