  "Degenerate Hull (less than 4 unique vertices before/after weld)": "退化包络（焊接前后唯一顶点少于 4 个）",
  "Small Hull (vertices all on 1 point)": "小凸包（顶点全在同一点）",
  "Skinny Hull (vertices all on 1 line segment)": "细长凸包（顶点全在一条线段上）",
  "Flat Hull (vertices all on 1 plane)": "平面包络（顶点全在同一平面上）",
  "Inconsistent connectivity (Not a watertight single-piece mesh; not a planar graph)": "连接性不一致（不是水密的单一网格；不是平面图）",
  "Inconsistent face geometry (Error in position of some face-related data element, may be due to a precision issue)": "面几何不一致（某些面相关数据元素位置错误，可能由精度问题引起）",
  "Inconsistent edge geometry (Error in position of some edge-related data element, may be due to a precision issue)": "边几何体不一致（某些边相关数据元素的位置出错，可能由精度问题导致）",
  "Unknown Error": "未知错误",
  "ERROR: Specified full path %s does not lie under the mod search path!)": "错误：指定的完整路径 %s 不在 mod 搜索路径下！)",
  "ERROR: Specified path %s could not be made content-relative": "错误：指定的路径 %s 无法转换为内容相对路径",
  "WARNING: Resource name \"%s\" has the incorrect extension \"%s\" for the specified resource type (expected \"%s\")!": "警告：资源名称 \\\"%s\\\" 的扩展名 \\\"%s\\\" 与指定资源类型不符（预期 \\\"%s\\\"）！",
  "FixupResourceName: Illegal path, missing extension passed in (\"%s\")!": "FixupResourceName：非法路径，传入的文件缺少扩展名 (\"%s\")！",
  "Class does not allow allocation from its schema binding": "该类不允许从其模式绑定进行分配",
  "Not safe to 'new' this class due to alignment requirements": "由于对齐要求，对此类使用 new 不安全",
  "Class does not allow destruction from its schema binding": "类不允许从其 Schema 绑定中销毁",
  "Cannot destruct abstract class": "无法析构抽象类",
  "Bool": "布尔",
  "World space": "世界空间",
  "World space transform, not relative to the specific smart prop object placement.": "世界空间变换，不相对于特定智能模型的摆放位置。",
  "Object space": "物体空间",
  "Object space transform, relative to the object placement, but does not include the current element transform.": "对象空间变换，相对于对象放置，但不包括当前元素变换。",
  "Element space": "元素空间",
  "Element space transform, includes the transform of the current element, which is also relative to the object.": "元素空间变换，包含当前元素的变换，该变换同样相对于对象。",
  "Forward direction (+x)": "前向方向 (+x)",
  "Left direction (+y)": "左方向 (+y)",
  "Up direction (+z)": "向上方向 (+z)",
  "FORWARD": "前方",
  "Distribute the child elements randomly within the specified area or volume": "在指定区域或体积内随机分布子元素",
  "Regular": "常规",
  "Distribute the child element evenly within the specified area of volume": "将子元素在指定体积区域内均匀分布",
  "Place in sphere": "放置在球体内",
  "Child elements will be placed within a sphere of the specified radius.": "子元素将被放置在指定半径的球体内",
  "Place in circle": "环形放置",
  "Child elements will be placed within a circle of the specified radius.": "子元素将被放置在指定半径的圆内。",
  "CIRCLE": "圆形",
  "Randomly pick a choice. If the choices have weights, the weights will be used to determine the probability of picking a given choice": "随机选择一个选项。如果选项有权重，权重将决定选中某个选项的概率",
  "First": "第一个",
  "Pick the first valid choice. Selection criteria may be added to a choice to determine if it is valid.": "选取第一个有效选项。可为选项添加选择条件以判断其是否有效。",
  "Specific": "特定",
  "Pick a choice specified by an additional authored value.": "选择由其他创作值指定的选项。",
  "Specific Color": "指定颜色",
  "Specify a specific color value (may be linked to a variable": "指定特定颜色值（可链接到变量",
  "Gradient Random": "渐变随机",
  "Pick a random color from anywhere on the authored color gradient": "从创作的颜色渐变上的任意位置随机选取颜色",
  "Gradient Random Stop": "渐变随机停靠点",
  "Randomly select one of the color stops specified on the gradient. Never picks a value between stops.": "从渐变上指定的颜色停靠点中随机选择一个。绝不会选取停靠点之间的值。",
  "Gradient Specific Value": "渐变特定值",
  "Use a color value from a specified location on the gradient": "使用渐变上指定位置的颜色值",
  "No fade out. The object will not fade out, but will still be culled when below the minimum size and will pop at that that point.": "无淡出。对象不会淡出，但在低于最小尺寸时仍会被剔除，并在该点突然消失。",
  "Most Aggressive": "最激进",
  "Most aggressive fade out. The object will fade out while still quite large on screen.": "最激进的淡出。对象在屏幕上仍相当大时就会淡出。",
  "More Aggressive": "更激进",
  "More aggressive fade out. The object will fade out while larger on screen than normal.": "更激进的淡出。对象在屏幕上比正常更大时就会淡出。",
  "Normal fade out. The object will fade at when at the standard size on screen.": "法线淡出。对象在屏幕上达到标准尺寸时将淡出。",
  "Less Aggressive": "较不激进",
  "Less aggressive fade out. The object will not fade out until it is smaller on screen than normal.": "淡出较不激进。对象在屏幕上小于正常尺寸之前不会淡出。",
  "Least Aggressive": "最保守",
  "Least aggressive fade out. The object will be quite small before fading out. Fade out will only complete at the size cull limit.": "最平缓的淡出方式。对象会缩得很小才开始淡出，淡出只会在尺寸剔除极限时完成。",
  "Circle": "圆形",
  "Diamond": "菱形",
  "DIAMOND": "菱形",
  "All positions": "所有位置",
  "Place at all positions along the path": "放置在沿路径的所有位置",
  "Every N positions": "每 N 个位置",
  "Place at every Nth position along the path, skipping over the other positions": "沿路径每隔 N 个位置放置一次，跳过其他位置",
  "Only at start and end": "仅在开始和结束时",
  "Only place at the start or end of the path": "仅放置在路径的起点或终点",
  "Path control points": "路径控制点",
  "Place at path control points instead of every point along the path, when this is selected the path spacing no longer applies": "在路径控制点处放置而不是沿路径的每个点放置；选择此项后路径间距设置不再生效",
  "No scaling": "无缩放",
  "Do not allow selected elements to be scaled, the parts may not fit the line exactly": "不允许缩放所选元素，部件可能无法完全贴合线条",
  "Scale last": "最后缩放",
  "Apply scale to the last element in order to fit the line. Only proceed to scale additional elements if the scale range of the last element is not sufficient.": "对最后一个元素应用缩放以适配直线。只有当最后一个元素的缩放范围不足时，才会继续缩放其他元素。",
  "Scale equally": "等比缩放",
  "Attempt to apply the same amount of scale to all of the elements placed on the line while still respecting their size constraints.": "在尊重元素尺寸约束的同时，尝试对线上放置的所有元素应用相同的缩放。",
  "Maximize scale": "最大化缩放",
  "Each element will be scaled to is maximum allowable size that will still fit on the line.": "每个元素将被缩放到仍能放置在线上的最大允许尺寸",
  "Largest fitting": "最大适配",
  "Pick the largest child element that will fit in the remaining length of the line, repeat this process until the line is full or no child will fit in the remaining length.": "选择能放入该行剩余长度中的最大子元素，重复此过程，直到该行被填满或没有子元素能放入剩余长度。",
  "Random fitting": "随机适配",
  "Pick a random choice from the child elements that will fit within the remaining length, repeat this process until the line is full or no child will fit in the remaining length.": "从能放入剩余长度的子元素中随机选择，重复此过程直到线条填满或没有子元素能放入剩余长度。",
  "Place all in order": "按顺序全部放置",
  "Place all of the child elements in the order they are specified even if they do not fit the line or do not fill the line. NOTE: end cap settings are ignored in this mode.": "按指定顺序放置所有子元素，即使它们不适配直线或未填满直线。注意：此模式下端盖设置会被忽略。",
  "Generate the grid by placing N x N children.": "通过放置 N x N 个子项生成网格。",
  "Fill": "填充",
  "Fill the area based on the largest bounds of child elements as specified in their selection criteria.": "根据子元素在其选择条件中指定的最大边界填充区域。",
  "Lay out child elements with their origin at the center of each grid cell.": "排列子元素，使其原点位于每个网格单元的中心。",
  "Corner": "角落",
  "Lay out child elements with their origin at the corner of each grid cell.": "将子元素布局为原点位于每个网格单元的角上。",
  "First Open Edge": "第一条开放边",
  "Orientation of child elements placed on faces will be driven by position of center of first open edge relative to face center.": "放置在面上的子元素的方向由第一条开放边中心相对于面中心的位置决定。",
  "First Closed Edge": "第一条闭合边",
  "Orientation of child elements placed on faces will be driven by position of center of first closed edge relative to face center.": "放置在面上的子元素的朝向由第一条闭合边中心相对于面中心的位置决定",
  "UV Channel 1": "UV 通道 1",
  "Orientation of child elements placed on faces will be driven by orthonormalized UV basis at face center. U axis is prioritized during orthonormalization.": "放置在面上的子元素的朝向将由面中心的正交化 UV 基决定。正交化时优先考虑 U 轴。",
  "UV Channel 2": "UV 通道 2",
  "Coordinate Space": "坐标空间",
  "Specifies a coordinate space in which a point or vector value is defined.": "指定定义点或矢量值所用的坐标空间。",
  "Enumerator Types": "枚举器类型",
  "Direction Vector": "方向向量",
  "Specifies a basis direction vector ( Forward, Left, or UP).": "指定基准方向向量（前向、左向或上向）",
  "Distribution Mode": "分布模式",
  "Specifies a distribution mode used to determine how certain elements distribute instances of their children within a space.": "指定一种分布模式，用于确定某些元素如何在空间中分布其子元素的实例。",
  "Placement Shape": "放置形状",
  "Specifies the shape (circle, or sphere) to use with elements that place children within a radius.": "指定与在半径内放置子元素的元素一起使用的形状（圆形或球体）。",
  "Specifies the method by which a child element is selected from a list.": "指定从列表中选择子元素的方法。",
  "Color Selection mode": "颜色选择模式",
  "Specifies the method by which a color selection is to be made.": "指定进行颜色选择的方法。",
  "Is this element enabled? If not enabled, this element will not be evaluted and will have no effect on the result.": "是否启用此元素？若未启用，该元素不会被求值，也不会对结果产生任何影响。",
  "Label": "标签",
  "Optional text that will appear in the outliner to help organize Smart Prop elements and communicate their purpose to other users.": "可选文本，将显示在大纲视图中，帮助组织智能模型元素并向其他用户说明其用途",
  "Selection Criteria": "选择条件",
  "Modifiers": "修改器",
  "Smart Prop Element": "智能模型元素",
  "Specifies the current version of this smart prop. Any existing references to this smart prop with an older version number will not automatically update.": "指定此智能 Prop 的当前版本。任何引用此智能 Prop 且版本号较旧的现有引用都不会自动更新。",
  "Maximum depth of smart prop evaluation stack during evaluation.": "求值期间智能道具评估堆栈的最大深度。",
  "Variables": "变量",
  "Choices": "选项",
  "List of the root level elements making up the smart prop definition, each element may be an entire tree.": "构成智能 Prop 定义的根级元素列表，每个元素可以是一整棵树。",
  "Smart Prop Root": "智能 Prop 根节点",
  "Root of a smart prop, contains a list of elements to evaluate.": "智能模型的根节点，包含要评估的元素列表",
  "Apply Modifiers": "应用修改器",
  "An element which is used to apply a set of modifiers to the state of its parent.": "用于向其父元素的状态应用一组修改器的元素。",
  "List of child elements which will appear if this element appears": "此元素出现时将显示的子元素列表",
  "A group of elements that will all be evaulated.": "将全部求值的一组元素。",
  "Name of the model resource (.vmdl) to place.": "要放置的模型资源（.vmdl）的名称。",
  "Specifies the name of the material group (skin) to use when displaying the specified model.": "指定显示指定模型时使用的材质组（皮肤）名称。",
  "If enabled the model will be rendered as a detail object, which is faster for placing many small objects and has fade out functionality, but may have different lighting characteristics. Detail object models support only uniform scale and will use the largest component of the scale value.": "启用后模型将作为细节对象渲染，适合放置大量小物体并具有淡出功能，但光照特性可能不同。细节对象模型仅支持等比缩放，将使用缩放值中的最大分量。",
  "Scale factor (may be non-uniform) to be applied directly to the model (in the model's local space).": "直接应用于模型的缩放因子（可为非均匀，在模型局部空间中）。",
  "Model Scale": "模型缩放",
  "Uniform scale to be applied to the model, certain properties like detail object mean only uniform scale may be applied to the model.": "应用于模型的等比缩放，某些属性（如细节对象）意味着只能对模型应用等比缩放。",
  "SmartPropAttributeEditor( LODLevel )": "SmartProp 属性编辑器（LOD 级别）",
  "Select model LOD level. The default Auto LOD means the lod will be picked based on the size of the model on screen. If a specific level is selected, then that lod level will always be used regardless of the size of the model on screen.": "选择模型 LOD 级别。默认的 Auto LOD 表示将根据模型在屏幕上的大小选择 LOD。如果选择了特定级别，则无论模型在屏幕上大小如何，都将始终使用该 LOD 级别。",
  "Override Surface Property": "覆盖表面属性",
  "If non-empty, specifies the name of a surface property to use for all physics shapes of the specified model, overriding any surface properties specified within the model.": "如果非空，指定用于指定模型所有物理形状的表面属性，覆盖模型内指定的任何表面属性。",
  "Fade Level": "淡出级别",
  "Controls the size at which a model marked as a detail object will fade out.": "控制标记为细节对象的模型淡出时的尺寸。",
  "Should the model cast shadows.": "模型是否投射阴影。",
  "Rigid Deformation Only": "仅刚性变形",
  "If enabled, only the transform of the model will be modified by any active deformer, the vertices of the model will not be changed by the deformer.": "若启用，任何活动的变形器只修改模型的变换，而不会改变模型的顶点。",
  "Disable Dynamic Deformable": "禁用动态可变形体",
  "If checked, this model will not deform in game when the smart prop is placed inside a dynamic deformable entity (such as func_deformable_brush).": "勾选后，当智能模型放置在动态可变形实体（如 func_deformable_brush）中时，此模型在游戏中不会变形。",
  "Places a model as the child of an element.": "将模型放置为元素的子级。",
  "Name of the target smart prop resource (.vsmart) to evaluate.": "要求值的目标智能道具资源（.vsmart）的名称。",
  "If enabled, any changes made to the evaluation state by the target smart prop (as well as modifiers) will only apply locally and will not affect the evaluation state of the parent. Disabling this will allow modifications to the evaluation state by the referenced smart prop to apply the current state of the of the parent. For example if the referenced smart prop applies a transform and you want the transform to affect the elements in the parent after this element, then you should disable local evaluation state.": "如果启用，目标智能 Prop（及其修改器）对求值状态所做的任何更改将仅在本地生效，不会影响父级的求值状态。禁用此项将允许所引用智能 Prop 对求值状态的修改应用到父级的当前状态。例如，如果所引用的智能 Prop 应用了变换，而你希望该变换影响此元素之后的父级元素，则应禁用本地求值状态。",
  "Smart Prop Reference": "智能 Prop 引用",
  "Evaluates a specified smart prop as a child of the current element.": "将指定的智能 Prop 作为当前元素的子元素求值。",
  "Path Positions": "路径位置",
  "Specifies the set of positions that are valid for path placement.": "指定路径放置的有效位置集合",
  "Fit on Line Scale Mode": "沿线适配缩放模式",
  "Specifies how a fit on line element will scale generate scale values for the objects it places.": "指定“线上适配”元素如何为其放置的对象生成缩放值。",
  "Fit on Line Pick Mode": "线上适配拾取模式",
  "Specifies how a fit on line element will pick which child elements it will place.": "指定线上适配元素如何选择要放置的子元素。",
  "Grid Placement": "网格放置",
  "Specifies how to place elements within a grid.": "指定如何在网格中放置元素。",
  "Grid Origin": "网格原点",
  "Specifies where the origin of a child element is placed realative to each grid cell.": "指定子元素原点相对于每个网格单元的放置位置。",
  "Criteria with nonliteral enabled state unsupported (%s)": "不支持具有非字面量启用状态的条件 (%s)",
  "Material Asset Variable": "材质资产变量",
  "Default Model": "默认模型",
  "Model Asset Variable": "模型资产变量",
  "Default Surface Property": "默认表面属性",
  "Surface Property Variable": "表面属性变量",
  "Option Value Name": "选项值名称",
  "Option Display Name": "选项显示名称",
  "If enabled, this value will be exposed as a parameter that can be set on the smart prop object in hammer.": "如果启用，此值将作为参数公开，可在 Hammer 的智能模型对象上设置。",
  "Parameter Display Name": "参数显示名称",
  "Name of the parameter which will appear as a property in the Hammer object properties ui when selecting an object using this smart prop.": "使用此智能道具选择对象时，将在 Hammer 对象属性 UI 中显示为属性的参数名称。",
  "Expression to evaluate to determine if this parameter should be hidden. Can be used to hide this parameter based on the state of other parameters.": "用于判断是否隐藏此参数的表达式。可根据其他参数的状态隐藏此参数。",
  "Expression to evaluate to detemrine if this parameter should be read-only. Can be used to make this parameter read-only based on the state of other parameters.": "用于判断此参数是否应为只读的表达式。可根据其他参数的状态使此参数变为只读。",
  "Vector 2D": "2D 向量",
  "Vector 3D": "三维向量",
  "Vector 4D": "4D 向量",
  "Model containing the set of material groups to select.": "包含要选择的材质组集合的模型。",
  "Default material group (skin) to assign to the variable value.": "分配给变量值的默认材质组（皮肤）。",
  "Specifies the coordinate space that vector should be returned in.": "指定矢量应返回的坐标空间。",
  "Normalized (Direction Vector)": "归一化（方向向量）",
  "Should the return value be normalized to unit length (direction vector).": "返回值是否应归一化为单位长度（方向向量）。",
  "Vector Between Points": "两点间矢量",
  "Compute the vector between two 3D points": "计算两个 3D 点之间的向量",
  "Local space rotation (in degrees) to apply to the current transform": "应用于当前变换的局部空间旋转（度）",
  "Transform: Rotate": "变换：旋转",
  "Apply a rotation to the current transform.": "对当前变换应用旋转。",
  "Normalize the value of a 3d vector.": "将 3D 向量的值归一化。",
  "Position of origin point.": "原点位置。",
  "position of target point.": "目标点的位置。",
  "position of up point.": "上点的位置。",
  "Coefficient to modulate the rotation": "调制旋转的系数",
  "Input Coordinate Space": "输入坐标空间",
  "Space in which the origin position is defined.": "原点位置定义所处的空间。",
  "Space in which the target position is defined.": "目标位置定义所在的空间。",
  "Space in which the up target is defined.": "定义上向目标的空间",
  "Transform: Rotate Towards": "变换：转向",
  "Apply a rotation to the current transform according to the alignment of two points.": "根据两点的对齐方式对当前变换应用旋转。",
  "+Vector A": "+向量 A",
  "Specifies the coordinate space of vector A.": "指定矢量 A 的坐标空间。",
  "+Vector B": "+向量 B",
  "Specifies the coordinate space of posivectortion B.": "指定 B 的坐标空间。",
  "Projection to plane": "投影到平面",
  "Interpret Vector B as plane normal.": "将向量 B 解释为平面法线。",
  "Project Vector": "投影向量",
  "Project Vector A onto Vector B": "将向量 A 投影到向量 B",
  "Scale to apply to the current transform": "应用到当前变换的缩放",
  "Transform: Scale": "变换：缩放",
  "Apply a scale to the current transform.": "对当前变换应用缩放。",
  "Original Material": "原始材质",
  "Original material to replace. This is the material specified in the model, including any material group asignment within the model. Does not consider any existing material overrides specified within the smart prop.": "要替换的原始材质。这是模型中指定的材质，包括模型内的任何材质组分配。不考虑智能道具中指定的任何现有材质覆盖。",
  "Minimum random position offset": "最小随机位置偏移",
  "New Material": "新材质",
  "New material to replace the original material with.": "用于替换原材质的新材质。",
  "Maximum random position offset": "最大随机位置偏移",
  "If non-zero, specifies the increment to which the randomly selected offset value will be snapped. Note that the snap value is absolute, not relative to the min or max, but if the if the min or max are not multiples of the snap value they can still be selected.": "非零时，指定随机选中的偏移值将被吸附到的增量。注意，吸附值是绝对的，不相对于最小值或最大值，但如果最小值或最大值不是吸附值的倍数，它们仍可能被选中",
  "Transform: Random Offset": "变换：随机偏移",
  "Apply a random position offset to the current transform.": "对当前变换应用随机位置偏移。",
  "Clear Active Overrides": "清除活动覆盖",
  "If enabled, clear any previous material overrides, so that only the material replacements specified in this table will be active.": "启用后，清除所有先前的材质覆盖，以便只有此表中指定的材质替换生效。",
  "Material Replacements": "材质替换",
  "Table specifying pairs of existing materials and the material to replace them with.": "指定现有材质与替换材质配对关系的表。",
  "Material Override": "材质覆盖",
  "Specifies a table of material replacements to apply to all following models. Mapping goes from the material specified by the model (including material group selection) to the replacement material. Previous material overrides are not considered when determining the base material.": "指定一个材质替换表，应用于后续所有模型。映射从模型指定的材质（包括材质组选择）指向替换材质。之前的材质覆盖在确定基础材质时不作考虑。",
  "Minimum rotation range": "最小旋转范围",
  "Maximum rotation range": "最大旋转范围",
  "If non-zero, specifies the angle increment to which the randomly selected value will be snapped. Note that the snap value is absolute, not relative to the min or max, but if the if the min or max are not multiples of the snap value they can still be selected.": "若非零，指定随机选择的值将吸附到的角度增量。注意吸附值为绝对值，不相对于最小值或最大值；即使最小值或最大值不是吸附值的倍数，它们仍可被选中。",
  "Transform: Random Rotation": "变换：随机旋转",
  "Apply a random rotation to the current transform.": "对当前变换应用随机旋转。",
  "Minimum scale range": "最小缩放范围",
  "Maximum scale range": "最大缩放范围",
  "If non-zero, specifies the increment to which the randomly selected scale value will be snapped. Note that the snap value is absolute, not relative to the min or max, but if the min or max are not multiples of the snap value they can still be selected.": "非零时，指定随机选择的缩放值的吸附增量。注意该吸附值为绝对值，不相对于最小值或最大值，但如果最小值或最大值不是吸附值的倍数，它们仍可被选中。",
  "Transform: Random Scale": "变换：随机缩放",
  "Apply a random scale to the current transform.": "对当前变换应用随机缩放。",
  "Material group variable to set to the selected choice.": "要设置为所选选项的材质组变量",
  "Specifies how the material group is to be selected from the authored set of choices": "指定如何从已创作的选项集中选择材质组",
  "Transform: Rigid Deformation": "变换：刚性变形",
  "Apply the active deformer to the current transform as a rigid deformation and disable the deformer.": "将活动变形器作为刚性变形应用到当前变换并禁用该变形器。",
  "Choice Index": "选项索引",
  "Specifies the index of the material group choice to pick": "指定要选取的材质组选项索引",
  "Set Material Group Choice": "设置材质组选项",
  "Picks a material group from a set of choices and assigns that material group to a specified variable.": "从一组选项中挑选材质组并将其分配给指定变量。",
  "Trace Miss Behavior": "追踪未命中行为",
  "Specified what to do when a trace does not hit a surface.": "指定追踪未命中表面时的处理方式",
  "Material to which color tint is to be applied.": "要应用色调的材质。",
  "Specifies how the color is to be specified.": "指定颜色的指定方式。",
  "Color Gradient": "颜色渐变",
  "Defines a color gradient from which a color can be selected based on the selection mode.": "定义一个颜色渐变，可根据选择模式从中选取颜色。",
  "Material Color Tint": "材质颜色着色",
  "Set a color tint to apply to a specific material.": "设置应用于特定材质的色调。",
  "+Origin": "+原点",
  "Specifies the origin point for the start of the trace. To trace from the current position, set to < 0, 0, 0 > and set the coordinate space to Element Space": "指定追踪起点的原点。要从当前位置追踪，请设为 < 0, 0, 0 > 并将坐标空间设为元素空间(Element Space)",
  "Coordinate space the origin is specified in. Using Element space allows specifying a value relative to the current position. However, world space should generally be used when for variable values.": "指定原点所在的坐标空间。使用元素空间允许指定相对于当前位置的值。不过，对于变量值通常应使用世界空间。",
  "Offset to apply to the specified origin along the trace direction to compute the starting point of the trace.": "沿追踪方向应用于指定原点的偏移，用于计算追踪起点。",
  "+Result": "+结果",
  "How much should the surface normal up direction influence the final orientation. [ 0, 1 ] where 0 = don't modify the orientation, 1 = completely re-orient to match the surface.": "表面法线上方向对最终朝向的影响程度。[ 0, 1 ]，0 = 不修改朝向，1 = 完全重新朝向以匹配表面。",
  "If No Surface Hit": "若未命中表面",
  "Specifies the behavior when the trace does not hit a surface.": "指定追踪未命中表面时的行为。",
  "Trace filtering": "追踪过滤",
  "Do not trace against tool materials (attribute 'tools.toolsmaterial').": "不对工具材质（属性 'tools.toolsmaterial'）进行追踪。",
  "Do not trace against sky materials (attribute 'mapbuilder.sky').": "不对天空材质进行追踪（属性 'mapbuilder.sky'）",
  "Do not trace against no draw materials (material attribute 'mapbuilder.nodraw').": "不与不可见(Nodraw)材质（材质属性 \\\"mapbuilder.nodraw\\\"）进行追踪。",
  "Do not trace against translucent materials (materials with 'alphatest' or 'translucent' attributes).": "不对半透明材质（具有 'alphatest' 或 'translucent' 属性的材质）进行追踪。",
  "Do not trace against any models (only hit world geometry).": "不与任何模型进行追踪（仅命中世界几何体）。",
  "Do not trace against dynamic entities which may move in game.": "不与游戏中可能移动的动态实体进行检测。",
  "Do not trace against cable geometry.": "不与线缆几何体进行投射。",
  "+Trace Direction": "+追踪方向",
  "Specifies the coordinate space the trace direction vector is specified in.": "指定追踪方向矢量所处的坐标空间。",
  "Maximum length of the trace. Surfaces beyond this distance will not be hit.": "追踪的最大长度。超出此距离的表面不会被命中。",
  "Transform: Trace In Direction": "变换：沿方向追踪",
  "Perform a trace in a direction from a specified origin and stop when a surface is hit.": "从指定原点沿某方向进行追踪，碰到表面时停止",
  "+Target Point": "+目标点",
  "The target point to trace to from the origin.": "从原点追踪到的目标点。",
  "Specifies the coordinate space the target point is specified in.": "指定目标点所处的坐标空间。",
  "+Trace Away": "+向外检测",
  "Trace away from point": "从点向外投射",
  "If enabled, instead of tracing from the origin to the target point, trace away from the target point for the specified distance starting at the origin.": "启用后，不再从原点追踪到目标点，而是从原点开始、远离目标点追踪指定距离。",
  "Transform: Trace To Point": "变换：追踪到点",
  "Perform a trace between the specified origin and a specified target point.": "在指定原点与指定目标点之间执行追踪。",
  "+Line End Point A": "+线段端点 A",
  "End point of the line to trace to.": "要追踪到的线段终点。",
  "Coordinate space the end point is specified in.": "终点所在的坐标空间。",
  "+Line End Point B": "+线段终点 B",
  "Trace away from line": "沿远离线条的方向检测",
  "If enabled, instead of tracing from the origin to the line, trace away from the line for the specified distance starting at the origin.": "如果启用，则不是从原点向直线投射，而是从原点开始沿远离直线的方向投射指定距离。",
  "Transform: Trace To Line": "变换：追踪到直线",
  "Perform a trace from a specified origin point to a the closest point on a line.": "从指定原点向直线上最近点执行追踪。",
  "Color to be applied if this choice is selected.": "选中此选项时应用的颜色。",
  "Relative weight of this choice, higher weighted choices are more likely to be selected.": "此选项的相对权重，权重越高越可能被选中。",
  "Tint Mode": "着色模式",
  "Specifies how a color tint value is to be applied with respect to the existing color tint": "指定色调值相对于现有色调的应用方式",
  "Specifies how the color is to be selected from the authored set of choices": "指定如何从已创作的选项集中选择颜色",
  "Color Selection": "颜色选择",
  "Specifies the index of the color to pick": "指定要选取的颜色的索引",
  "Application Mode": "应用模式",
  "Specifies how the selected color should be applied to the current color.": "指定所选颜色应用到当前颜色的方式。",
  "List of possible colors which may be selected": "可能被选中的颜色列表",
  "Tint Color Choice": "色调颜色选项",
  "Set the color tint to one color out of a pre-selected set of colors.": "将颜色着色设为预选颜色集中的某一种颜色",
  "Do nothing": "不执行任何操作",
  "If no surface it hit, don't update the transform at all, act as if the trace was not performed.": "如果未命中任何表面，则完全不更新变换，如同未执行追踪一样。",
  "Stop evaluation": "停止求值",
  "If no surface is hit stop evaluation of the current element, no following modifiers will be evaluated and the current transform will not be modified.": "如果未命中表面，则停止对当前元素的求值，后续修改器不再求值，且不会修改当前变换。",
  "Move to start": "移动到起点",
  "If no surface is hit move the current transform to the start of the trace.": "若未命中表面，则将当前变换移动到追踪起点。",
  "Move to end": "移到末尾",
  "If no surface is hit move the current transform to the end of the trace.": "若未命中表面，则将当前变换移动到追踪终点。",
  "Multiply object tint": "与对象色调相乘",
  "Multiply with the object level color tint and replace the current color value.": "与对象级色调相乘并替换当前颜色值。",
  "Multiply current tint": "乘以当前着色",
  "Multiply with the current color tint value.": "与当前颜色染色值相乘。",
  "Replace tint": "替换着色",
  "Replace the current color tint value completely, overwriting any object level tint.": "完全替换当前颜色着色值，覆盖对象级着色。",
  "Color Position": "颜色位置",
  "[ 0, 1 ] Value specifying the location on the gradient to pick the color from.": "[ 0, 1 ] 值，指定在渐变上取色的位置。",
  "Defines a color gradient from which a random color will be piked.": "定义一个颜色渐变，将从中随机选取颜色",
  "Tint Color Gradient": "色调渐变",
  "Set the color tint to a selection from within the defined gradient.": "将色调设置为定义的渐变中的所选颜色。",
  "Set Variable": "设置变量",
  "Set the value of a variable.": "设置变量的值。",
  "State": "状态",
  "Name of the locator. This can be used to reference the locator in this element or its children. If the locator is configurable, the locator will be identified by this name in Hammer.": "定位器名称。可用于在此元素或其子元素中引用该定位器。如果定位器可配置，Hammer 将通过此名称识别它。",
  "Offset of the locator relative to the current transform. This allows the locator to be created at an offset location without applying that offset to the current transform.": "定位器相对于当前变换的偏移。这样可以在偏移位置创建定位器，而不会将该偏移应用到当前变换。",
  "Scale to apply only to the locator model": "仅应用于定位器模型的缩放",
  "Controls whether or not the locator can be edited in a smart prop configuration. If enabled an editable locator will appear when the smart prop is placed in Hammer. Any changes to that locator will modify the current transform.": "控制定位器是否可以在智能模型配置中编辑。启用后，将智能模型放置到 Hammer 中时会出现一个可编辑的定位器。对该定位器的任何更改都会修改当前变换",
  "Configuration": "配置",
  "Controls whether or not the configuration of the locator can include scale. If enabled scale can be applied to the editable locator in Hammer. If disabled the scale will not be editable and the current scale will be used.": "控制定位器的配置是否可以包含缩放。启用后可在 Hammer 中对可编辑定位器应用缩放。禁用后缩放将不可编辑，并使用当前缩放。",
  "Create Locator": "创建定位器",
  "Create a locator with the current transform. The locator may optionally be configurable, so that its transform can be modified in Hammer.": "使用当前变换创建定位器。定位器可以选择是否可配置，以便其变换可以在 Hammer 中修改。",
  "Manipulators": "操纵器",
  "Name to assign to the saved state, the save state can be restored later using this name.": "要分配给保存状态的名称，之后可使用此名称恢复保存状态。",
  "Save State": "保存状态",
  "Save the current state, allowing it to be restored at a later state.": "保存当前状态，以便稍后恢复",
  "Name of the previously saved state to restore": "要恢复的先前保存状态的名称",
  "If true, the parent element will be discarded there is no state with the specified name. If false, and there is no state with the specified name then no changes are made.": "如果为真，当没有具有指定名称的状态时，父元素将被丢弃。如果为假且没有具有指定名称的状态，则不做任何更改。",
  "Restore State": "恢复状态",
  "Replace the current state with a previously saved state.": "用先前保存的状态替换当前状态。",
  "Name used to identify the sizer. Must be unique within the paraent element.": "用于标识尺寸器的名称。必须在父元素内唯一。",
  "Display Model": "显示模型",
  "If enabled a model will be displayed at the position of the sizer that can be used to select the sizer in Hammer.": "启用后将在尺寸调整器位置显示一个模型，可用于在 Hammer 中选中该尺寸调整器。",
  "X-Axis Size": "X 轴尺寸",
  "Y-Axis Size": "Y 轴尺寸",
  "Z-Axis Size": "Z 轴尺寸",
  "Create Sizer": "创建尺寸器",
  "Create a sizer that will be displayed at the current location, allowing the user to manipulate the specified set of size values.": "创建一个显示在当前位置的大小调节器，允许用户操作指定的一组大小值。",
  "Specifies the coordinate space of the saved position value.": "指定保存的位置值的坐标空间。",
  "Save Current Position": "保存当前位置",
  "Save the current position to a specified variable in the requested coordinate space": "以请求的坐标空间将当前位置保存到指定变量",
  "Specifies which direction vector to save.": "指定要保存的方向向量。",
  "Save Direction Vector": "保存方向向量",
  "Save the specified direction vector to a specified variable, in the requested coordinate space": "将指定方向向量按请求的坐标空间保存到指定变量",
  "Name used to identify the rotator. Must be unique within the parent element.": "用于标识旋转器的名称。必须在父元素内唯一。",
  "Offset of the rotator relative to the current transform. This allows the rotator to be created at an offset location without applying that offset to the current transform.": "旋转器相对于当前变换的偏移。这允许在偏移位置创建旋转器，而不会将该偏移应用到当前变换。",
  "Axis around which the rotation will occur": "旋转发生所围绕的轴",
  "Coordinate space the axis of rotation is specified in.": "指定旋转轴所在坐标空间。",
  "Radius at which the rotator handle should be displayed.": "显示旋转手柄的半径。",
  "Color to display the rotator handle with.": "旋转手柄的显示颜色。",
  "Should the rotation be applied to the current transform.": "是否将旋转应用到当前变换。",
  "Specifies the number of degrees the rotation should snap to. If set to 0, then the rotation snapping will be controlled by the rotation snapping in Hammer.": "指定旋转应吸附到的角度数。若设为 0，则旋转吸附由 Hammer 中的旋转吸附设置控制。",
  "Specifies the angle the rotator should be set to initially.": "指定旋转器初始应设置的角度。",
  "Enforce Limits": "强制限制",
  "If enabled, the minimum and maximum rotation angles will be used to limit the range of the rotation.": "若启用，将使用最小和最大旋转角度来限制旋转范围。",
  "Minimum Angle": "最小角度",
  "Specifies the minimum angle limit in degrees": "指定最小角度限制（度）",
  "Maximum Angle": "最大角度",
  "Specifies a float variable to which the rotation value should be output. The variable only receives the rotation around the axis, the axis of rotation does not affect this output.": "指定一个浮点变量，旋转值将输出到该变量。该变量只接收绕轴的旋转，旋转轴不影响此输出。",
  "Create Rotator": "创建旋转器",
  "Create a rotator that will be displayed at the current location, allowing the user to manipulate a rotation around an axis. The rotation value can be applied to the current transform as well as saved to a variable.": "创建一个显示在当前位置的旋转器，允许用户操纵绕某轴的旋转。旋转值可应用于当前变换，也可保存到变量。",
  "Save Current Scale": "保存当前缩放",
  "Save the current scale factor to a specified variable.": "将当前缩放系数保存到指定变量",
  "Save Current Surface Normal": "保存当前表面法线",
  "Save the current surface normal to a specified variable in the requested coordinate space": "将当前表面法线保存到请求坐标空间中的指定变量",
  "If enabled, the rotation will be reset to a world space instead of object space, meaning any rotation applied to the object in Hammer will be ignored.": "启用后，旋转将重置为世界空间而非对象空间，即在 Hammer 中对对象应用的任何旋转都将被忽略。",
  "Should the pitch (rotation around left vector) value be reset.": "是否重置俯仰（绕左矢量旋转）值。",
  "Should the yaw (roation around the up vector) value be reset.": "是否应重置偏航（绕上向量旋转）值。",
  "Should the roll (rotation around forward vector) value be reset.": "是否重置翻滚（绕前向向量的旋转）值。",
  "Transform: Reset Rotation": "变换：重置旋转",
  "Reset the current rotation such the element only inherits the object level rotation, but does not inherit the rotation applied to its parent.": "重置当前旋转，使元素仅继承对象级旋转，而不继承应用于其父级的旋转。",
  "Save Current Color": "保存当前颜色",
  "Save the current color tint value to a specified variable": "将当前色调值保存到指定变量",
  "+Forward": "+前向",
  "Specifies the coordinate space the forward direction is being specified in": "指定前进方向所处的坐标空间",
  "Specifies the coordinate space the up direction is being specified in": "指定向上方向所用的坐标空间",
  "If the specified vectors are not orthogonal, normally the up vector will be adjusted to make it orthogonal to the forward vector. If prioritize up is true, then the forward vector will be adjusted to be orthogonal to the specified up vector instead.": "如果指定的向量不是正交的，通常会调整上向量使其与前向量正交。如果优先上方向为 true，则会改为调整前向量使其与指定的上向量正交。",
  "Transform: Set Orientation": "变换：设置朝向",
  "Set the current orientation from a specified forward and up vector.": "根据指定前向矢量和上矢量设置当前朝向。",
  "Output Variable": "输出变量",
  "Vector A": "向量 A",
  "Vector B": "向量 B",
  "Dot Product": "点积",
  "Compute a dot or cross product between two 3D vectors": "计算两个 3D 向量之间的点积或叉积",
  "Compute": "计算",
  "If enabled, the object level scale will be ignored, meaning any scale applied in Hammer will have no effect on the element or its children.": "启用后，对象级缩放将被忽略，即在 Hammer 中应用的任何缩放都不会影响该元素或其子元素。",
  "Transform: Reset Scale": "变换：重置缩放",
  "Reset the current scale such the element only inherits the object level scale, but does not inherit the scale applied to its parent.": "重置当前缩放，使元素只继承对象级缩放，而不继承应用于其父级的缩放。",
  "Cross Product": "叉积",
  "Local space position translation to apply to the current transform": "要应用于当前变换的局部空间位置平移",
  "Specifies the coordinate space of the specified position value.": "指定位置值所在的坐标空间。",
  "Transform: Set Position": "变换：设置位置",
  "Set the position of the current transform.": "设置当前变换的位置。",
  "Specifies the coordinate space the distance should be computed in. The scale of the coordinate space may affect the distance value.": "指定计算距离所用的坐标空间。坐标空间的缩放可能会影响距离值。",
  "+Position A": "+位置 A",
  "Position A": "位置 A",
  "Specifies the coordinate space of position A.": "指定位置 A 的坐标空间。",
  "+Position B": "+位置 B",
  "Position B": "位置 B",
  "Specifies the coordinate space of position B.": "指定位置 B 的坐标空间。",
  "Distance": "距离",
  "Compute the distance between two 3D points": "计算两个 3D 点之间的距离",
  "Transform: Translate": "变换：平移",
  "Apply a position offset to the current transform.": "对当前变换应用位置偏移。",
  "Relative to Surface": "相对于表面",
  "Snap to Surface": "吸附到表面",
  "Stiffen Overlapping Joints": "强化重叠关节",
  "SNAP": "吸附",
  "STIFFEN": "刚化",
  "Align Forward with Normal": "将前向与法线对齐",
  "Align Up With Normal": "与法线对齐向上",
  "Align Backward with Normal": "以法线对齐后方",
  "Maintain Closest Triangle Offset": "保持最近三角形偏移",
  "Should the entity created by this element cast shadows.": "此元素创建的实体是否投射阴影。",
  "Force Static": "强制静态",
  "Force this model to be placed as a static model rather then generating an entity.": "强制此模型作为静态模型放置，而不是生成实体。",
  "Attachment Mode": "挂点模式",
  "Deformable Entity Settings": "可变形实体设置",
  "If the smart prop is child of a deformable entity, this setting specifies how the entity generated by this element will be attached to the deformable surface.": "如果智能道具是可变形实体的子级，此设置指定由此元素生成的实体将如何附加到可变形表面。",
  "If the smart prop is child of a deformable entity, this setting specifies how the entity generated by this element will be oriented relative to the deformable surface.": "如果智能 Prop 是可变形实体的子级，此设置指定此元素生成的实体相对于可变形表面的朝向。",
  "Should this physics prop start in a sleeping (non-simulating) state such that it won't update until it is woken up by an external event.": "此物理道具是否应以休眠（非模拟）状态启动，即在受外部事件唤醒前不更新。",
  "Prop Physics": "Prop 物理",
  "Places a prop physics entity.": "放置一个物理 Prop 实体。",
  "Prop Dynamic": "动态模型（Prop Dynamic）",
  "Places a prop dynamic entity.": "放置 prop_dynamic 实体。",
  "Start Asleep": "初始休眠",
  "Deformation Enabled": "启用变形",
  "Should the deformation be applied. If disabled the children will still be placed, but will not be deformed. Esentially making the element behave as a group.": "是否应用变形。禁用时仍会放置子元素，但不会变形，实际上是让该元素表现得像一个组。",
  "A local offset to apply to the base volume of the deformer that will not apply to its children.": "应用于变形器基础体积但不应用于其子级的局部偏移。",
  "A local rotation to apply to apply the base volume of the deformer that will not apply to its children. This can be used to alter the direction of the deformation.": "应用于变形器基础体积、但不应用于其子级的局部旋转。可用于改变变形方向。",
  "Size of the base volume to be deformed.": "待变形基础体积的尺寸。",
  "Bend amount to apply, specified in degrees. Bend occurs along the local x-axis and bends around the local z-axis": "要应用的弯曲量（度）。弯曲沿局部 x 轴发生并绕局部 z 轴弯曲",
  "[ 0, 1 ] Value specifying the location along the local x-axis the bend will occur around": "[ 0, 1 ] 范围内的值，指定弯曲围绕发生的局部 x 轴位置",
  "Radius of the bend. If 0 the radius will be computed automatically to preserve the length of the inner edge of the x-axis. If a non-zero value is specified then the inner edge will maintain this radius, but its length will change.": "弯曲半径。若为 0，将自动计算半径以保持 x 轴内边缘的长度。若指定非零值，内边缘将保持该半径，但其长度会改变",
  "Bend Deformer": "弯曲变形器",
  "Creates a bend deformer that is applied to child elements. The deformation bends the local space x-axis around the local space z-axis. The Angles property can be used to rotate the local axis to change the direction of deformation.": "创建应用于子元素的弯曲变形器。该变形将局部空间 x 轴绕局部空间 z 轴弯曲。可使用角度属性旋转局部轴以更改变形方向。",
  "Is this an element which should be placed at the start of the line.": "是否为应放置在线条起点的元素。",
  "Is this an element which should be placed at the end of the line.": "此元素是否应放置在线条末端。",
  "End Cap Settings": "端帽设置",
  "Specifies that this is a special part that should be used at the start or end of the line.": "指定这是一个应在线路起点或终点使用的特殊部件。",
  "+End Points": "+端点",
  "Specifies the start point of the line in the specified coordinate space.": "指定线段起点（在指定的坐标空间中）。",
  "Specifies the end point of the line in the specified coordinate space.": "指定线段在指定坐标空间中的终点。",
  "End point space": "端点空间",
  "Specifies the coordinate space in which the end point values are specified.": "指定终点值所使用的坐标空间。",
  "+Orientation": "+朝向",
  "Should the child elements be oriented based on the line. If enabled the child elements placed on the line will be oriented such that their +x axis points along the line towards the end point.": "子元素是否应基于线条定向。启用后，放置在线上的子元素将定向为其 +x 轴沿线条指向终点。",
  "Up vector which is used to determine the rotation of each element around the line.": "用于确定每个元素绕线条旋转的向上矢量。",
  "Space in which the up direction is defined.": "定义上方向所在的空间。",
  "When the up direction is not orthogonal to the line direction normally the up vector will be adjusted to make it orthogonal to the line direction. If prioritize up is true, then the up direction will be maintained and the forward direction will be adjusted.": "当向上方向与直线方向不正交时，通常会调整向上向量使其与直线方向正交。如果优先向上为 true，则保持向上方向，而调整前向方向。",
  "Scale Mode": "缩放模式",
  "Specifies how scale is applied to each of the selected element in order to fit them to the line.": "指定如何对每个选中元素应用缩放以使其适配到线上。",
  "Child Selection Mode": "子级选择模式",
  "Fit on Line": "线上适配",
  "An element which fits one or more instances of a set of choices on to a line.": "将一组选项中的一个或多个实例适配放置到线段上的元素。",
  "Specifies the length of the line that will be taken up if this element is selected.": "指定选中此元素时将占用的行长度。",
  "Can this object be scaled. If enabled the minimum and maximum lengths must be set to specify the size range of allowable scale.": "此对象是否可缩放。启用后必须设置最小和最大长度，以指定允许的缩放范围。",
  "Minimum length": "最小长度",
  "Minimum allowable length for the object. Must be <= length. If length is 100 and minimum length is 20, then the object may be assigned a scale in the rage [ 0.2, 1.0 ].": "对象允许的最小长度。必须 <= 长度。如果长度为 100 而最小长度为 20，则对象可能被赋予 [ 0.2, 1.0 ] 范围内的缩放。",
  "Maximum length": "最大长度",
  "Maximum allowable length for the object. Must be >= length. If length is 100 and maximum length is 160, then the object may be assigned a scale in the rage [ 1.0, 1.6 ].": "对象允许的最大长度。必须 >= 长度。若长度为 100 而最大长度为 160，则对象可被赋予 [ 1.0, 1.6 ] 范围内的缩放。",
  "Linear Length": "线性长度",
  "Specifies the length of this element, used when fitting an element on to a line.": "指定此元素的长度，在将元素适配到线上时使用",
  "Overall grid dimension along X axis.": "沿 X 轴的整体网格尺寸。",
  "Overall grid dimension along Y axis.": "沿 Y 轴的整体网格尺寸。",
  "Layout length vertically (Along Z axis instead of Y).": "垂直排列长度（沿 Z 轴而非 Y 轴）。",
  "ARRAY: Grid is a specific number of grid divisions. FILL: The boundary is filled with as many as will fit at the specified cell spacing.": "ARRAY：网格是特定的网格划分数。FILL：以指定的单元格间距尽可能多地填满边界。",
  "Specifies the overall grid origin location. Corner origin grids default to quadrant I, but may be expressed in others using negative values for Width and/or Length.": "指定整个网格的原点位置。角原点网格默认为第一象限，但可通过为宽度和/或长度使用负值来表示其他象限。",
  "Grid segments along width axis.": "沿宽度轴的网格分段数。",
  "Grid segments along Length axis.": "沿长度轴的网格分段数",
  "Minimum Width of filled grid cells.": "被填充网格单元的最小宽度。",
  "Minimum Length of filled grid cells.": "已填充网格单元的最小长度。",
  "Shifts every other cell row and/or column.": "交替偏移单元格行和/或列。",
  "Vary cell shift in X.": "在 X 方向变化单元格偏移。",
  "Vary cell shift in Y.": "改变 Y 方向的单元偏移。",
  "Layout Grid": "布局网格",
  "Generates set of child instances arranged in a regular grid layout.": "生成以规则网格布局排列的一组子实例",
  "Start Point": "起点",
  "Endpoint of deformation region.": "变形区域的端点。",
  "End Point": "终点",
  "Effect Size": "特效大小",
  "The distance from the line formed by the endpoints that encapsulated the deformation region.": "到由包围变形区域的端点形成的直线的距离。",
  "Continuous Interpolation": "连续插值",
  "Enables an alternate interpolation method that doesnt deform endpoint tangents.": "启用一种不会使端点切线变形的替代插值方法。",
  "Midpoint Offset": "中点偏移",
  "Offsets the center of the deformation region.": "偏移形变区域的中心。",
  "Midpoint Rotation": "中点旋转",
  "Rotate the center of the deformation region.": "旋转变形区域的中心。",
  "Midpoint Scale": "中点缩放",
  "Scale the center of the deformation region.": "缩放变形区域的中心。",
  "Adjust deformation falloff from the center of the region to the endpoints.": "调整从区域中心到端点的变形衰减。",
  "Outputs the absolute position of the midpoint post deformation.": "输出变形后中点的绝对位置。",
  "Midpoint Deformer": "中点变形器",
  "Soft deform the center of a volume defined by two endpoints.": "对由两个端点定义的体积中心进行柔和变形。",
  "Choice Weight": "选项权重",
  "Specifies a weighting value which affects that likelyhood of selecting this element which picking a choice.": "指定一个权重值，影响选择时选中此元素的可能性",
  "Valid When": "何时有效",
  "Expression to evaluate to determine if this choice is currently valid.": "为确定此选项当前是否有效而要求值的表达式。",
  "Is Valid": "是否有效",
  "Specifies if this element is currently valid choice.": "指定此元素当前是否为有效选项。",
  "Specifies how the initial selection of a choice should be handled.": "指定如何处理选项的初始选择。",
  "Specific Child": "特定子项",
  "Specifies the index of the child to pick.": "指定要选择的子项索引。",
  "Choice Output Variable": "选项输出变量",
  "If a variable name is specified, sets the value of that variable to the index of the selected choice": "如果指定了变量名，则将该变量的值设为所选选项的索引",
  "Should a control to select the specific choice be shown when this prop is placed in Hammer.": "在 Hammer 中放置此模型时，是否显示用于选择具体选项的控件。",
  "Handle Settings": "句柄设置",
  "Specifies an offset in the local space of the element to apply to the configuration handle.": "指定在元素局部空间中应用到配置手柄的偏移。",
  "Color to use to display the configuration handle.": "用于显示配置手柄的颜色。",
  "Size of the configuration handle.": "配置手柄的大小。",
  "Shape of the configuration handle to display.": "要显示的配置手柄形状。",
  "Select Single Child": "选择单个子项",
  "An element which selects a single choice from its set of child choices.": "从其子选项集中选择单个选项的元素。",
  "Unsupported feature: m_OutputChoiceVariableName (%s)": "不支持的功能：m_OutputChoiceVariableName (%s)",
  "Specifies how the positions are computed based on the radius.": "指定如何基于半径计算位置",
  "Specifies the method to be used to distribute.": "指定要使用的分布方式。",
  "0 to 1 value indicating the amout of random offset that should be applied to the reguluarly spaced positions": "0 到 1 的值，表示应应用到规则间隔位置的随机偏移量",
  "Vector up direction of the plane of the circle. This in the local space of the current element.": "圆形平面的向量上方向。这是当前元素的局部空间。",
  "Minimum number of instances of this object and its children to be placed.": "此对象及其子对象要放置的最小实例数。",
  "Maximum number of instances of this object and its children to be placed.": "此对象及其子项可放置的最大实例数。",
  "Inner radius from the placement position where the model can appear.": "放置位置的内半径，模型可出现在其中。",
  "Outer radius from the placement position where the model can appear.": "放置位置外部的最大半径，模型可出现在此范围内。",
  "Align the initial orientation of each placed object based on it position on the sphere or circle.": "根据每个放置对象在球体或圆上的位置对齐其初始朝向",
  "Vector in the local space of the child element to be aligned with sphere or circle": "子元素局部空间中与球体或圆对齐的向量",
  "Place In Radius": "在半径内放置",
  "An element which places multiple instances of its child elements within a radius.": "在半径内放置多个子元素实例的元素。",
  "Number of instances of this object and its children to be placed.": "要放置的此对象及其子对象的实例数量。",
  "Stop When": "停止条件",
  "Stop placing copies of the children when this expression evaluates to true.": "当此表达式为真时停止放置子项副本。",
  "Place Multiple": "放置多个",
  "An element which places multiple instances of its child elements.": "放置其子元素多个实例的元素。",
  "Specifies the method to use to determine which positions this element should be placed at along the path.": "指定用于确定此元素应沿路径放置在哪些位置的方法",
  "Specifies the spacing between positions. For example, a value of 1 will place the element at very position, 2 every other position, 3 every third position": "指定位置之间的间隔。例如，值为 1 将在每个位置放置元素，2 为每隔一个位置，3 为每第三个位置",
  "Specifies an offset to use when determining the Nth position to place an element at. For example if placing at every third position with an offset of 0, an element will appear at positions 1, 4, 7, and so on. But if an offset of 2 is set instead of 0, then an element will appear at positions 3, 6, and 9 and so on.": "指定确定第 N 个放置位置时使用的偏移。例如，每隔三个位置放置且偏移为 0 时，元素将出现在位置 1、4、7 等；若偏移为 2 而非 0，元素将出现在位置 3、6、9 等。",
  "Should this element be placed at the first positions on the path": "此元素是否应放置在路径的起始位置",
  "Should this element be placed at the last positions on the path": "是否应将此元素放置在路径的最后位置",
  "Valid Path Positions": "有效路径位置",
  "Specifies the path positions at which this element may appear.": "指定此元素可出现的路径位置。",
  "Name of the path to use. This path name will show up in the property editor when selecting a placement of this smart prop in Hammer, allowing selection of a path object in the map to use.": "要使用的路径名称。在 Hammer 中选择此智能 Prop 的放置时，该路径名会显示在属性编辑器中，允许选择地图中要使用的路径对象。",
  "Spacing between points on the path": "路径上点之间的间距",
  "Offset from the start of the path to place the first point.": "距路径起点的偏移，用于放置第一个点",
  "Offset from path": "相对路径的偏移",
  "Offset to apply to the path, specifies a horizontal and vertical offset to apply relative to the up direction.": "应用于路径的偏移，指定相对于向上方向应用的水平与垂直偏移。",
  "Path Evaluation Space": "路径求值空间",
  "Specifies the space in which the provided input path is to be evalauted.<br><br><b>World Space</b>: The input path will be evaluated in world space, such that child elements will be placed directly on the target path regardless of the transform of the smart prop object. <br><b>Object Space</b>: The world space transform of the input path will be ignored and instead the path will be evaluated relative to the transform of the smart prop object. <br><b>Element Space</b>: The world space transform of the input path will be ignored and instead the path will be evaluated relative to the transform of the current element within the smart prop.": "指定提供的输入路径的求值空间。<br><br><b>World Space</b>（世界空间）：输入路径将在世界空间中求值，因此子元素将直接放置在目标路径上，而与智能 Prop 对象的变换无关。<br><b>Object Space</b>（对象空间）：输入路径的世界空间变换将被忽略，路径将相对于智能 Prop 对象的变换求值。<br><b>Element Space</b>（元素空间）：输入路径的世界空间变换将被忽略，路径将相对于智能 Prop 中当前元素的变换求值。",
  "If true, treat the specified up direction as fixed up direction to apply to all elements placed on the path. If false the up direction is just an initial direction.": "如果为 true，将指定的上方向视为固定上方向并应用于放置在路径上的所有元素。如果为 false，上方向仅为初始方向。",
  "Compute the spacing distance in the 2d plane defined by the up direction. Most useful when using a fixed up direction, if maintaining a distance in the 2d plane is more important than maintaing distance along the path.": "在由向上方向定义的 2D 平面内计算间距距离。在使用固定向上方向时最有用，此时保持 2D 平面内的距离比沿路径保持距离更重要。",
  "If not using a fixed up direction, provides an initial up direction which will be used to determine the orientation of first element on the path, after that the elements will incrementally update to follow the path and may not match this direction. If Use Fixed Up direction is specified, then all elements will use this direction to deterime their up direction.": "若未使用固定上方向，则提供一个初始上方向，用于确定路径上第一个元素的朝向；此后元素将增量更新以跟随路径，可能不再匹配此方向。如果指定了使用固定上方向，则所有元素都使用此方向确定其上方向。",
  "Default Path In World Space": "世界空间默认路径",
  "If enabled, the default path values will be treated as world space values, if disabled they are treated as object space values. Typically it makes sense for literal values to be treated as being in object space, but if the values are being supplied by locators they will typically be in world space.": "如果启用，默认路径值将被视为世界空间值；如果禁用，则被视为对象空间值。通常字面量值应按对象空间处理，但如果值由定位器提供，则通常位于世界空间。",
  "A set of points defining a path to use when an external path isn't specified. This will be used in the preview and thumbnail for the smart prop. It will also be used when the smart prop is placed in Hammer before a path is selected.": "未指定外部路径时使用的一组定义路径的点。将用于智能模型的预览和缩略图，以及在选择路径之前将智能模型放置到 Hammer 时使用",
  "Place on Path": "沿路径放置",
  "An element which places an instance of its child elements at a specified interval along a path.": "沿路径以指定间隔放置子元素实例的元素。",
  "Target material name.": "目标材质名称。",
  "When true, discard faces with matching material.": "为真时，丢弃材质匹配的面。",
  "Filter Faces By Material": "按材质过滤面",
  "Angle at closed edge of face.": "面闭合边处的角度。",
  "When true, discard edges within the angle threshold.": "为真时，丢弃角度阈值内的边。",
  "Filter Edges by Angle": "按角度过滤边",
  "Orientation Mode": "定向模式",
  "Determine how child elements are oriented when mapped to face.": "确定子元素映射到面时的朝向方式",
  "Place on Mesh": "在网格上放置",
  "Place Children on Mesh Components.": "在网格组件上放置子元素。",
  "Target Vertex Count": "目标顶点数",
  "Iterate through faces with target vertex count.": "以目标顶点数遍历面。",
  "Filter Faces By Vertex Count": "按顶点数过滤面",
  "Edge Count": "边数",
  "Iterate through faces with 'n' open edges (edges with only one neighboring face).": "遍历具有 n 条开放边（只有一个相邻面的边）的面。",
  "Use Closed Edges": "使用闭合边",
  "When true, we only consider closed edges (edges with exactly two neighboring faces).": "为真时，仅考虑闭合边（恰好有两个相邻面的边）。",
  "Enforce Shared Vert": "强制共享顶点",
  "When true, only consider open/closed edges that share a vert with another open/closed edge.": "为真时，仅考虑与其他开放/封闭边共享顶点的开放/封闭边。",
  "Filter Faces By Open Edges": "按开放边筛选面",
  "Add Model": "添加模型",
  "Whether to continue executing": "是否继续执行",
  "0.0 to 1.0 value indicating the probability of this element being evaluated. Where a value of 0 means the element will never be evaluated and 1.0 means it will always be evaluated": "0.0 到 1.0 的值，表示此元素被求值的概率。0 表示永不求值，1.0 表示总是求值",
  "Minimum slope on which the target will be placed. Slope is a [ 0, 180 ] value of the surface normal rotation from up such that 0 is a horizontal surface (floor), 90 is a vertical surface (wall), 180 is horizontal upside down surface (ceiling).": "目标放置的最小坡度。坡度为 [ 0, 180 ] 的表面法线相对向上方向的旋转角度：0 为水平表面（地板），90 为垂直表面（墙壁），180 为倒置水平表面（天花板）。",
  "Maximum slope on which the target will be placed.": "目标可放置的最大坡度。",
  "Filter downstream elements based on a true/false condition": "根据真/假条件过滤下游元素",
  "Filter Probability": "过滤概率",
  "Filter downstream elements based on a specified random probability": "根据指定的随机概率过滤下游元素",
  "Filter Surface Angle": "过滤表面角度",
  "Filter downstream elements based on the current surface angle. The surface angle is set based on the initial placement of the smart prop object, but can also be updated by the Trace to Surface modifier.": "基于当前表面角度筛选下游元素。表面角度基于智能模型对象的初始放置设置，但也可通过“追踪到表面”修改器更新。",
  "Do not trace against any cable objects.": "不与任何缆线对象进行检测。",
  "Reset Scale": "重置缩放",
  "Set Position": "设置位置",
  "Random Offset": "随机偏移",
  "Random Rotation": "随机旋转",
  "Random Scale": "随机缩放",
  "Trace In Direction": "沿方向追踪",
  "Set Tint Color": "设置色调",
  "Change the color tint based on the specified apply mode.": "根据指定的应用模式更改色调。",
  "Clear Material Overrides": "清除材质覆盖",
  "Clear any previous material overrides.": "清除所有先前的材质覆盖。",
  "Add Material Override": "添加材质覆盖",
  "Specifies a material replacement to apply to all following models. Mapping goes from the material specified by the model( including material group selection ) to the replacement material. Previous material overrides are not considered when determining the base material.": "指定要应用于后续所有模型的材质替换。映射从模型指定的材质（包括材质组选择）到替换材质。确定基础材质时不考虑之前的材质覆盖。",
  "HAC K  Provide Result Min X": "HAC K  提供结果最小 X",
  "HAC K  Provide Result Max X": "提供结果最大 X",
  "Handle Shape": "手柄形状",
  "Place On Path": "沿路径放置",
  "Path Name": "路径名称",
  "Instance Count": "实例数量",
  "Instance Index": "实例索引",
  "Evaluation Depth": "求值深度",
  "Max Evaluation Depth": "最大求值深度",
  "Linear Scale": "线性缩放",
  "Line Length": "线条长度",
  "Random Int": "随机整数",
  "Experimental - please ignore": "实验性功能 - 请忽略",
  "Called to invoke the graph": "调用此图时触发",
  "Evaluate": "求值",
  "Filter: Probability": "过滤器：概率",
  "Causes the parent element to only be evaluated with a specified random probability.": "使父元素仅以指定的随机概率被评估",
  "Filter: Surface Angles": "过滤器：表面角度",
  "Allows the parent element to be conditionally evaluated base on the current surface angle. The surface angle is set based on the initial placement of the smart prop object, but can also be updated by the Trace to Surface modifier.": "允许基于当前表面角度有条件地求值父元素。表面角度基于智能模型对象的初始放置设置，但也可通过“追踪到表面”修改器更新。",
  "Filter: Variable Value": "筛选器：变量值",
  "Compares the current value of a variable to the specified value. If the comparison is false the element evaluation is stopped.": "将变量的当前值与指定值进行比较。如果比较为假，则停止对元素的求值。",
  "Filter: Expression": "过滤器：表达式",
  "Evaluates the specified expression, if the result of the expression is false evaluation of the element is stopped.": "对指定表达式求值，如果表达式结果为假，则停止对该元素的求值。",
  "List of surface properties on which this element is valid. If empty element is not restricted to any specific surfaces.": "此元素有效的表面属性列表。为空则不限制于任何特定表面。",
  "List of surface properties on which this element is not valid. If empty element is not restricted to any specific surfaces.": "此元素无效的表面属性列表。若为空，元素不受任何特定表面限制。",
  "Filter: Surface Properties": "过滤器：表面属性",
  "Allows the parent element to be conditionally evaluated based on surface properties.": "允许根据表面属性有条件地评估父元素",
  "List of material attributes on which this element is valid. If empty, the element is not restricted to any specific surfaces.": "此元素有效的材质属性列表。若为空，元素不限于任何特定表面。",
  "List of material attributes on which this element is not valid. If empty, the element is not restricted to any specific surfaces.": "此元素无效的材质属性列表。如果为空，则元素不受任何特定表面限制。",
  "Filter: Material Attributes": "筛选器：材质属性",
  "Allows the parent element to be conditionally evaluated based on attributes assigned to the surface material.": "允许根据表面材质上指定的属性对父元素进行条件求值。",
