  "Note: This is the list of currently-resident sound events, and may differ set of events available during a running game.": "注意：这是当前驻留的声音事件列表，可能与游戏运行期间可用的事件集合不同。",
  "WARNING: You have tools audio muted. Sounds will not be audible in tools outside this dialog.": "警告：你已静音工具音频。此对话框之外的工具中声音将不可闻。",
  "Pick Sound Event": "选择声音事件",
  "Pick VSound": "选择 VSound",
  "Note: The soundevent you've selected is not in this games mod. You'll need to copy it into this mod at some point.": "注意：你选择的音效事件不在本游戏的 mod 中。稍后你需要将其复制到此 mod 中",
  "Duplicate or Reference selected soundevent": "复制或引用所选声音事件",
  "Reference": "引用",
  "Copy Sound Event": "复制声音事件",
  "Unable to fine manifest \"soundevents/soundevents_manifest.vrman\" which is required, please investigate!": "无法找到所需的清单 \\\"soundevents/soundevents_manifest.vrman\\\"，请检查！",
  "Create New Sound Event": "创建新声音事件",
  "Unknown Token": "未知标记",
  "Click to goto URL": "点击跳转 URL",
  "Collapse from multi-value / range to single": "从多值/范围折叠为单值",
  "Expand to multi-value / range": "扩展为多值/范围",
  "This value is locked from editing by default. Click to unlock and manually edit.": "此值默认锁定不可编辑。点击可解锁并手动编辑。",
  "Game Tool Images (*.png;*.ico;*.jpg)": "游戏工具图像 (*.png;*.ico;*.jpg)",
  "Hitbox Set": "命中盒集",
  "Breakpiece": "破碎件",
  "AnimGraph Tag": "AnimGraph 标签",
  "Specifies the number of props placed per square foot.": "指定每平方英尺放置的模型数量。",
  "Detail Prop Type": "细节模型类型",
  "Model to be displayed.": "要显示的模型。",
  "Material group (skin) to assign to use with the model.": "要分配给模型使用的材质组（皮肤）。",
  "A weight determining the frequency at which this model is placed relative to other models within the detail type. The weights of all models are summed and the probability of selecting this model is its weight divided by the sum weight.": "决定此模型相对于细节类型中其他模型放置频率的权重。所有模型的权重相加，选中此模型的概率为其权重除以总权重。",
  "Start fade out size": "开始淡出尺寸",
  "Screen space size [ 0, 1 ] (where 1 is the whole screen) at which the model will begin to to fade out. Anything larger will be fully visible, anything smaller will start to fade out.": "模型开始淡出的屏幕空间尺寸 [ 0, 1 ]（1 为整个屏幕）。大于此值将完全可见，小于此值将开始淡出。",
  "Complete fade out size": "完全淡出尺寸",
  "Screen space size [ 0, 1 ] (where 1 is the whole screen) at which the model will be completely faded out. Anything smaller than this size will not be visible, anything larger will start fading in.": "屏幕空间大小 [ 0, 1 ]（1 为整个屏幕），模型在此大小时将完全淡出。小于此尺寸将不可见，大于此尺寸将开始淡入。",
  "Use World Space Up": "使用世界空间上向",
  "If enabled, the up direction will be evaluated in world space, such that the object orientation does not affect the surface slope filtering. Additionally if Orient To Surface is 0, then and world space up is enabled, then the object orientation will not affect the rotation of detail model.": "若启用，向上方向将在世界空间中求值，使对象朝向不影响表面坡度过滤。此外，若“朝向表面”为 0 且世界空间向上已启用，对象朝向将不影响细节模型的旋转。",
  "Value indicating if the model's up direction should be matched to the surface. Value should be in the [ 0, 1 ] range, where 0 means that the model up will be model (or object space) up and will ignore the surface direction, and 1 indicates that the model up will exactly match the surface normal.": "指示模型向上方向是否应与表面匹配的值。取值范围 [ 0, 1 ]，0 表示模型向上将采用模型（或对象空间）向上方向并忽略表面方向，1 表示模型向上将完全匹配表面法线。",
  "Minimum slope on which the target will be placed. Slope is a [ 0, 180 ] value based on the surface normal where horizontal surface (floor) is 0, vertical surface (wall) is 90, and a horizontal upside down surface (ceiling) is 180.": "放置目标的最低坡度。坡度为基于表面法线的 [0, 180] 值：水平表面（地板）为 0，垂直表面（墙）为 90，水平倒置表面（天花板）为 180。",
  "Minimum range of random offset to apply along the model's local up direction": "沿模型局部向上方向应用的随机偏移最小范围",
  "Maximum range of random offset to apply along the model's local up direction": "沿模型局部上方向应用的最大随机偏移范围",
  "Minimum range of the random rotation to apply the model. Random rotation is applied in the local space of the model. Rotation values are ordered pitch, yaw, roll.": "应用到模型的随机旋转的最小范围。随机旋转应用于模型的局部空间。旋转值顺序为俯仰、偏航、翻滚。",
  "Maximum range of the random rotation to apply the model.": "应用于模型的随机旋转最大范围。",
  "Minimum random scale value to apply to the model.": "应用于模型的随机缩放最小值。",
  "Maximum random scale value to apply to the model.": "应用于模型的最大随机缩放值。",
  "Density Scale": "密度缩放",
  "Minimum scale to apply to the model based the painted detail prop density. The minimum of the detail and blend weight scale values is multiplied with the random scale value to determine the final scale.": "基于绘制的细节模型密度应用于模型的最小缩放。细节缩放值与混合权重缩放值中的较小者将乘以随机缩放值以确定最终缩放。",
  "Blend Weight Scale": "混合权重缩放",
  "Minimum scale to apply to the model based on the final material layer blend weight. The model will be given this scale value when the layer blend weight equals the minimum blend weight and will be 1.0 when the maximum blend weight has been reached. The minimum of the detail and blend weight scale values is multiplied with the random scale value to determine the final scale. Set this if you want the model to scale up as the material blend fades in. The smaller the value, the smaller the model will start as the material begins to fade in.": "基于最终材质层混合权重应用于模型的最小缩放。当层混合权重等于最小混合权重时，模型将采用此缩放值；达到最大混合权重时为 1.0。细节缩放值与混合权重缩放值中的较小者会与随机缩放值相乘以确定最终缩放。若希望模型随材质混合淡入而放大，请设置此项。值越小，材质开始淡入时模型初始尺寸越小。",
  "Min Blend Weight": "最小混合权重",
  "Minimum blend weight value for which the model will be placed. If the blend weight value is less than this value, the model will not be placed.": "放置模型所需的最小混合权重值。如果混合权重值小于此值，则不会放置模型。",
  "Max Blend Weight": "最大混合权重",
  "Maximum blend weight value for which the model will be placed. If the blend weight value is more than this value, the model will not be placed.": "放置模型的最大混合权重值。若混合权重值大于此值，模型将不会被放置。",
  "Full Density Blend Weight": "全密度混合权重",
  "Blend weight at which the model will be at full density. Must be between the minimum and maximum blend weight values. The density of this model placement will increase with the blend weight value up to this value at which point it will be at full density.": "模型达到完全密度时的混合权重。必须介于最小和最大混合权重之间。此模型放置的密度将随混合权重增大而增加，达到此值时为完全密度。",
  "Should instances of this model generate shadows in the lightmap. Note that shadows in the light map will persist even after the model fades out.": "此模型的实例是否在光照贴图中生成阴影。注意，即使模型淡出后，光照贴图中的阴影仍会保留",
  "Filter Part": "过滤部分",
  "Search:": "搜索：",
  "Select a part to add to the filter": "选择要添加到筛选器的部件",
  "Matches part of a name": "匹配名称的一部分",
  "Name Contains": "名称包含",
  "A compound list that requires all its parts to match": "需要所有部分都匹配的复合列表",
  "AND List": "AND 列表",
  "A compound list that matches if any parts matches": "任一部分匹配即匹配的复合列表",
  "OR List": "或列表",
  "<Match any value>": "<匹配任意值>",
  "= (During)": "= (期间)",
  "!= (Not During)": "!=（非…期间）",
  "< (Before)": "<（之前）",
  "> (After)": ">（之后）",
  "<= (Before)": "<=（之前）",
  ">= (After)": ">=（之后）",
  "through": "至",
  "Enable date range": "启用日期范围",
  "Add another filter criteria": "添加另一个过滤条件",
  "Completer Settings": "自动补全设置",
  "Never": "从不",
  "Values Only": "仅值",
  "Always": "始终",
  "Show All Keys": "显示所有关键帧",
  "Automatic Popup": "自动弹出",
  "Reveal in Surface Property Editor": "在表面属性编辑器中显示",
  "Click to browse choices": "点击浏览选项",
  "The VData file to read": "要读取的 VData 文件",
  "The key whose value must match the asset name (ie. something like 'm_Model' if you want to apply this tag to .vmdl assets that are referenced by the vdata file)": "其值必须与资产名称匹配的键（例如，如果要将此标签应用于 vdata 文件引用的 .vmdl 资产，则为类似“m_Model”的键）",
  "Optional second key to check": "要检查的可选第二个键",
  "User-facing tag name": "用户可见的标签名称",
  "User-facing description of the tag": "标签的用户可读描述",
  "Icon associated with the tag": "与标签关联的图标",
  "Color for the tag badge": "标签徽章的颜色",
  "Alternate strings this tag will match when searching for assets by name.": "按名称搜索资产时此标签将匹配的备用字符串。",
  "If set, draw this as an overlay image on the asset preview": "如果设置，将在资产预览上将其绘制为覆盖图像",
  "If set, the presence of this tag will cause the tools to suppress or dissuade use in several ways (and draw a red X over the asset preview)": "设置后，此标签的存在会导致工具以多种方式抑制或不鼓励使用（并在资产预览上画红叉）",
  "If set, the presence of this tag will cause the tools to hide the asset from users by default. NOTE: This means if an asset gets tagged with this it might 'dissapear' from the UI!": "如果设置，此标签的存在将导致工具默认对用户隐藏该资源。注意：这意味着资源被标记后可能会从界面中“消失”！",
  "+Auto Tags": "+自动标签",
  "Required for any auto-tag. Restricts the auto-application of this tag to a specific asset type (string from assettypes_common.txt like 'material_asset' or 'model_asset')": "任何自动标签都必须设置。将此标签的自动应用限制为特定资源类型（来自 assettypes_common.txt 的字符串，如 'material_asset' 或 'model_asset'）",
  "Set this to automatically apply this tag based on an asset filter string. (NOTE: Auto tag names MUST start with an '@' character!)": "设置此项可根据资产过滤字符串自动应用此标签。（注意：自动标签名称必须以“@”字符开头！）",
  "Set this to automatically apply this tag to assets based on references from a VData file. (NOTE: Auto tag names MUST start with an '@' character!)": "设置此项可根据 VData 文件的引用自动将此标签应用到资源。（注意：自动标签名称必须以“@”字符开头！）",
  "Skipping disallowed VMF: %s": "跳过不允许的 VMF：%s",
  "Found 3D Skybox reference VMF: %s, adding skybox_reference to main map and fixing up.": "找到 3D 天空盒引用 VMF：%s，正在向主地图添加 skybox_reference 并进行修正。",
  "Failed to construct map document from provided vmf data.": "无法从提供的 vmf 数据构建地图文档。",
  "CVMFtoVMAP: Missing a required top-level key.": "CVMFtoVMAP：缺少必需的顶层键。",
  "Value %s under key %s contains the wrong number of numbers": "键 %s 下的值 %s 包含的数字数量错误",
  "Warning: Didn't rename entity key '%s' to '%s' because the new key was already present (class '%s')": "警告：未能将实体键“%s”重命名为“%s”，因为新键已存在（类“%s”）",
  "Negated": "取反",
  "Allow entities that match criteria": "允许符合条件的实体",
  "Error loading studio model \"%s\" referred to by %s!": "加载 %s 引用的 studio 模型\\\"%s\\\"失败！",
  "Source1 env_tonemap_controller input \"SetBloomExponent\" does not map to a Source2 input": "Source1 的 env_tonemap_controller 输入 \"SetBloomExponent\" 未映射到 Source 2 输入",
  "Unable to find instance map file %s": "找不到实例地图文件 %s",
  "Already processed master color_correction entity, ignoring additional master color_correction entity.": "已处理主 color_correction 实体，忽略额外的主 color_correction 实体。",
  "More than one env_tonemap_controller found, ignoring this one and assuming first one found is the master.": "发现多个 env_tonemap_controller，忽略此实体并假定第一个找到的是主控制器。",
  "Multiple VisGroups with the same id: %i": "多个具有相同 ID 的可视组：%i",
  "Encounter group with no id, skipping": "遇到没有 id 的遭遇组（encounter group），跳过",
  "Barbed": "带刺",
  "Breakable": "可破坏",
  "Slack": "松弛度",
  "vmf displacements": "vmf 置换",
  "Found a displacement missing a needed subkey.": "发现一个置换缺少所需的子键。",
  "Water": "水",
  "bsp func_detail faces": "BSP func_detail 面",
  "S1 Detail Grass Data": "S1 细节草地数据",
  "Levels %d": "层级 %d",
  "Color Balance %d": "色彩平衡 %d",
  "Color Tint %d": "颜色着色 %d",
  "Curves %d": "曲线 %d",
  "Tone Mapping %d": "色调映射 %d",
  "Bloom %d": "泛光 %d",
  "Vignette %d": "暗角 %d",
  "Local Contrast %d": "局部对比度 %d",
  "Local Exposure %d": "局部曝光 %d",
  "Error opening %s": "打开 %s 出错",
  "File read failure": "文件读取失败",
  "script file exceeded MAX_INCLUDES": "脚本文件超出 MAX_INCLUDES",
  "Macro buffer overflow": "宏缓冲区溢出",
  "Macro expand overflow": "宏展开溢出",
  "Line %i is incomplete": "第 %i 行不完整",
  "ValidateLump: old version for lump %d in map!": "ValidateLump：地图中 lump %d 为旧版本！",
  "Reading unknown lump #%d (%d bytes)": "读取未知 lump #%d（%d 字节）",
  "%s is not a IBSP file": "%s 不是 IBSP 文件",
  "ParseEntity: EOF without closing brace": "ParseEntity: 遇到 EOF 但没有闭合大括号",
  "WARNING: light_spot at (%i %i %i) has outer angle larger than 90 degrees! Clamping to 90...": "警告：(%i %i %i) 处的 light_spot 外角大于 90 度！已限制为 90...",
  "Warning: Don't know what to do with light_directional": "警告：不知道如何处理 light_directional",
  "Failed to read": "读取失败",
  "Chunk hash not found.": "未找到块哈希。",
  "Content file %s is corrupt; Chunk hash not found (expected: %d, found: %d)": "内容文件 %s 已损坏；未找到区块哈希（期望：%d，实际：%d）",
  "Signature verification failed.": "签名验证失败。",
  "Content file %s is corrupt; signature couldn't be verified. Verify integrity of game files": "内容文件 %s 已损坏；签名无法验证。请验证游戏文件完整性",
  "Content file %s is corrupt. Hashing could not be verified. Verify integrity of game files.": "内容文件 %s 已损坏。哈希校验失败。请验证游戏文件完整性。",
  "Hashing embedded chunk (%d bytes)": "正在为嵌入数据块计算哈希（%d 字节）",
  "Failed to sign VPK; RSA failure.": "VPK 签名失败；RSA 错误。",
  "Failed to sign vpk; signature is unexpected size.": "对 vpk 签名失败；签名大小不符合预期。",
  "Signed.": "有符号。",
  "Not signing; keys not set.": "未签名；未设置密钥。",
  "Error reading from loaded packed store \"%s\"": "从已加载的打包存储 \\\"%s\\\" 读取时出错",
  "Content file %s is corrupt (Chunk: %s). Verify integrity of game files.": "内容文件 %s 已损坏（块：%s）。请验证游戏文件完整性。",
  "Content file %s is corrupt. Verify integrity of game files.": "内容文件 %s 已损坏。请验证游戏文件完整性。",
  "Failed to open file handle to process chunk file": "打开用于处理块文件的文件句柄失败",
  "Failed to get file size to process chunk file": "获取文件大小以处理区块文件失败",
  "Hashes not present": "哈希不存在",
  "Hashing %s (%lld bytes).  %s": "正在为 %s 计算哈希（%lld 字节）。  %s",
  "Couldn't load %s key %s, will not sign %s.": "无法加载 %s 密钥 %s，将不对 %s 进行签名。",
  "Set encryption keys, will sign %s.": "设置加密密钥，将为 %s 签名。",
  "Depth must be 1 for cubemaps!": "立方体贴图的深度必须为 1！",
  "Image dimensions must be multiple of 4!": "图像尺寸必须是 4 的倍数！",
  "Warning! Encountered old format VTF file; please rebuild it!": "警告！遇到旧格式 VTF 文件；请重新构建！",
  "** Encountered stale cubemap! Please rebuild the following vtf:": "** 遇到过期的立方体贴图！请重建以下 vtf：",
  "*** Encountered VTF non-square cubemap!": "*** 遇到 VTF 非正方形立方体贴图！",
  "*** Encountered VTF invalid texture size!": "*** 遇到 VTF 无效纹理尺寸！",
  "*** Unable to serialize... have no image data!": "*** 无法序列化... 没有图像数据！",
  "Expression:": "表达式：",
  "(Press Retry to debug the application - JIT must be enabled)": "（按“重试”调试应用程序 - 必须启用 JIT）",
  "Thursday": "星期四",
  "Saturday": "星期六",
  "September": "九月",
  "November": "十一月",
  "No error": "无错误",
  "Mesh %s has poylgonal faces defined which have bad vertex counts, these will be ignored": "网格 %s 定义了顶点数错误的多边形面，这些面将被忽略",
  "Conversion from DmeMesh to PolygonMesh removed %i of %i faces.": "从 DmeMesh 转换为 PolygonMesh 移除了 %i 个面中的 %i 个。",
  "Could not load sky material %s": "无法加载天空材质 %s",
  "Could not determine full file path for sky texture %s": "无法确定天空纹理 %s 的完整文件路径",
  "Could not load sky texture %s": "无法加载天空纹理 %s",
  "Sky texture %s must be a 2:1 lat-long, 4:3 H-cross, 3:4 V-cross, or 1:6 V-strip format!": "天空纹理 %s 必须是 2:1 经纬、4:3 横向十字、3:4 纵向十字或 1:6 纵向条带格式！",
  "Catmull-Rom (Norm X)": "Catmull-Rom（规格化 X）",
  "Ease In": "缓入",
  "Ease Out": "缓出",
  "Linear Interp.": "线性插值",
  "Kochanek-Bartels Late": "Kochanek-Bartels 后期",
  "Simple Cubic": "简单三次曲线",
  "Catmull-Rom (Tangent)": "Catmull-Rom（切线）",
  "Exponential Decay": "指数衰减",
  "Hold": "保持",
  "Bezier": "贝塞尔",
  "No data": "无数据",
  "Disallowed variable name: %s": "不允许的变量名：%s",
  "No input data for '%s'. (Empty buffer.)": "没有 '%s' 的输入数据。（空缓冲区。）",
  "Failed to allocate a lexer for '%s'. (Out of memory?)": "无法为 '%s' 分配词法分析器。（内存不足？）",
  "Failed to allocate a token stream for '%s'. (Out of memory?)": "无法为 '%s' 分配标记流。（内存不足？）",
  "Parser encountered %d error(s)": "解析器遇到 %d 个错误",
  "Missing token %s": "缺少标记 %s",
  "Unexpected token '%s' %s": "意外的标记 '%s' %s",
  "Unexpected end of file": "意外的文件结尾",
  "Unexpected character '%c' (0x%02X)": "意外字符 '%c' (0x%02X)",
  "Unknown property %s": "未知属性 %s",
  "Functions not supported in this evaluator (%s)": "此求值器不支持函数（%s）",
  "Cannot register variable %s because it is an unsupported type": "无法注册变量 %s，因为其类型不受支持",
  "Cannot register variable %s: it has no components": "无法注册变量 %s：它没有组件",
  "Cannot register variable %s: only float variables can have multiple components": "无法注册变量 %s：只有浮点变量可以有多个分量",
  "Cannot register more than %i variables": "无法注册超过 %i 个变量",
  "Cannot register variable %s more than once": "不能多次注册变量 %s",
  "Unknown unary operator": "未知一元运算符",
  "Unknown binary operator": "未知的二元运算符",
  "Invalid string value %s -- pick another one!": "无效的字符串值 %s -- 请选择另一个！",
  "Variable \"%s\" has %i components, a specific component must be specified, for example use: \"%s.x\"": "变量“%s”有 %i 个组件，必须指定具体组件，例如使用：“%s.x”",
  "Unknown variable \"%s\"": "未知变量 \\\"%s\\\"",
  "Invalid property specification": "无效的属性规范",
  "Invalid component specifier \".%s\" used on variable \"%s\"": "变量 \\\"%s\\\" 使用了无效的组件指定符 \\\".%s\\\"",
  "Unknown function \"%s\"": "未知函数 \\\"%s\\\"",
  "Program uses more temp variables than are supported. Needs %i, max is %i": "程序使用的临时变量超出支持数量。需要 %i 个，最大为 %i 个",
  "Early exit": "提前退出",
  "Mismatched set": "不匹配的集合",
