  "The time value at which the camera frustum will be drawn when the camera path is selected. Adjusting this will update the path parameter.": "选中摄像机路径时绘制摄像机视锥体的时间值。调整此值将更新路径参数",
  "Field of view. Edit on the path nodes. This previews the current FOV as computed from the path nodes and the current preview parameter.": "视场角。在路径节点上编辑。此预览显示由路径节点和当前预览参数计算得到的当前 FOV。",
  "A 0 to 1 parameter value of the path at which the camera frustum will be drawn when the camera path is selected. Adjusting this will update the time.": "0 到 1 的路径参数值，选择相机路径时将在此处绘制相机视锥体。调整此值将更新时间。",
  "Time": "时间",
  "Automatically advance Preview Time until the end of the path is reached. Disabling will pause. If the end of the path has been reached, enabling will reset time to 0.": "自动推进预览时间直到到达路径末端。禁用将暂停。如果已到达路径末端，启用将把时间重置为 0。",
  "Path Parameter": "路径参数",
  "Shows the current actual duration of the path.  For a constant speed path it is equal to Duration.  For a non-constant speed path, it is computed from all of the speed and ease in/out values on the individual nodes.": "显示路径当前的实际时长。对于恒速路径，它等于时长。对于非恒速路径，它由各节点上的速度和缓入/缓出值计算得出。",
