  "VfxLoadShaderSource(16): Cannot use absolute paths for shader includes. Found %s": "VfxLoadShaderSource(16)：着色器包含不能使用绝对路径。发现 %s",
  "VfxLoadShaderSource(77): Cannot read file \"%s\"": "VfxLoadShaderSource(77)：无法读取文件 \"%s\"",
  "VfxLoadShaderSource(85): Cannot find include file %s": "VfxLoadShaderSource(85)：找不到包含文件 %s",
  "*** Problem remapping texture reference!": "*** 重新映射纹理引用时出现问题！",
  "Tool": "工具",
  "Microsoft (R) HLSL Shader Compiler 9.29.952.3111": "Microsoft (R) HLSL 着色器编译器 9.29.952.3111",
  "Microsoft Visual C++ Runtime Library": "Microsoft Visual C++ 运行库",
  "Assertion failed!": "断言失败！",
  "Program:": "程序：",
  "For information on how your program can cause an assertion\nfailure, see the Visual C++ documentation on asserts": "有关程序如何导致断言失败的信息，\n请参阅 Visual C++ 中有关断言的文档",
  "<program name unknown>": "<未知程序名>",
  "lexer->mTokens(): Error: No lexer rules were added to the lexer yet!": "lexer->mTokens()：错误：尚未向词法分析器添加任何词法规则！",
  ": lexer error %d :\n\t%s at offset %d,": "：词法分析器错误 %d：\n\t%s 位于偏移量 %d 处，",
  "near char(%#02X) :": "靠近字符（%#02X）：",
  "(end of input).\n\t This indicates a poorly specified lexer RULE\n\t or unterminated input element such as: \"STRING[\"": "（输入结束）。\n\t 这表明词法规则（RULE）定义不完善\n\t 或存在未终止的输入元素，例如：\"STRING[\"",
  "The lexer was matching from line %d, offset %d, which": "词法分析器从第 %d 行、偏移量 %d 处开始匹配，",
  "looks like this:\n\t\t%.*s": "内容如下：\n\t\t%.*s",
  "is also the end of the line, so you must check your lexer rules": "该位置同时也是行尾，因此请检查你的词法规则",
  "Mismatched Token Exception": "标记不匹配异常",
  "Base recognizer function antlr3RecognitionExceptionNew called by unknown parser type - provide override for this function": "基础识别器函数 antlr3RecognitionExceptionNew 被未知解析器类型调用 - 请为该函数提供重写",
  "Unexpected node": "意外节点",
  "Base recognizer function 'match' called by unknown parser type - provide override for this function": "基础识别器函数 'match' 被未知解析器类型调用 - 请为该函数提供重写",
  "Base recognizer function 'matchAny' called by unknown parser type - provide override for this function": "基础识别器函数 'matchAny' 被未知解析器类型调用 - 请为该函数提供重写",
  "Base recognizer function 'mismatch' called by unknown parser type - provide override for this function": "基础识别器函数 'mismatch' 被未知解析器类型调用 - 请为该函数提供重写",
