  "Base recognizer function recoverFromMismatchedToken called by unknown parser type - provide override for this function": "基础识别器函数 recoverFromMismatchedToken 被未知解析器类型调用 - 请为该函数提供重写",
  "Base recognizer function recoverFromMismatchedSet called by unknown parser type - provide override for this function": "基础识别器函数 recoverFromMismatchedSet 被未知解析器类型调用 - 请为该函数提供重写",
  "Base recognizer function 'consumeUntil' called by unknown parser type - provide override for this function": "基础识别器函数 'consumeUntil' 被未知解析器类型调用 - 请为该函数提供重写",
  "Base recognizer function 'consumeUntilSet' called by unknown parser type - provide override for this function": "基础识别器函数 'consumeUntilSet' 被未知解析器类型调用 - 请为该函数提供重写",
  "Base recognizer function 'alreadyParsedRule' called by unknown parser type - provide override for this function": "基础识别器函数 'alreadyParsedRule' 被未知解析器类型调用 - 请为该函数提供重写",
  "Base recognizer function consumeUntilSet called by unknown parser type - provide override for this function": "基础识别器函数 consumeUntilSet 被未知解析器类型调用 - 请为该函数提供重写",
