  "<h2>Material Editor Tool - MET</h2><p>Copyright &copy; Valve Corporation.<p>Version: %1.%2<p>Build: %3 %4<p>Qt Version: %5": "<h2>材质编辑器工具 - MET</h2><p>版权所有 &copy; Valve Corporation。<p>版本：%1.%2<p>构建：%3 %4<p>Qt 版本：%5",
