  "Unserialize: Unexpected encoding name '%s' reading file '%s' - expected encoding '%s'": "反序列化：读取文件 '%s' 时遇到意外的编码名称 '%s' - 预期编码为 '%s'",
  "Factory for element type '%s' already exists (Check your IMPLEMENT_ELEMENT_FACTORY macros for duplicate lookupNames)": "元素类型 '%s' 的工厂已存在（请检查 IMPLEMENT_ELEMENT_FACTORY 宏是否存在重复的 lookupNames）",
  "Unable to create unknown element %s!": "无法创建未知元素 %s！",
  "Operator cycle found during dependency graph traversal!": "在依赖图遍历期间发现算子循环！",
  "Error in the undo system! Grab a programmer!": "撤销系统出错！快叫程序员！",
  "KeyValues: Can't serialize attribute of type %s into KeyValues files!": "KeyValues：无法将类型为 %s 的属性序列化到 KeyValues 文件！",
  "KeyValues: Element uses unknown element type %s": "KeyValues：元素使用了未知元素类型 %s",
  "Dm Unserialize: Attempted to read an attribute (\"%s\") of an inappropriate type!": "Dm 反序列化：试图读取类型不当的属性（\"%s\"）！",
  "Prefix element cannot contain element or element_array attributes. ('%s')": "前缀元素不能包含 element 或 element_array 属性。（'%s'）",
  "Element uses unknown element type %s": "元素使用了未知元素类型 %s",
  "Attempted to read an attribute (\"%s\") of unknown type %s!": "试图读取未知类型 %s 的属性（\"%s\"）！",
  "Attempted to read an attribute (\"%s\") of an inappropriate type!": "试图读取类型不当的属性（\"%s\"）！",
  "Expecting ']', didn't find it!": "应为 ']'，但未找到！",
  "Expecting ',', didn't find it!": "应为 ','，但未找到！",
  "Expecting element type, didn't find it!": "应为元素类型，但未找到！",
  "Expecting element reference, didn't find it!": "应为元素引用，但未找到！",
  "Encountered invalid element ID data!": "遇到无效的元素 ID 数据！",
  "Expecting array attribute value, didn't find it!": "应为数组属性值，但未找到！",
  "Error reading in array attribute \"%s\" element %d": "读取数组属性 \"%s\" 的元素 %d 时出错",
  "Expecting quoted attribute value for attribute \"%s\", didn't find one!": "应为属性 \"%s\" 的带引号值，但未找到！",
  "Invalid format for element ID encountered for attribute \"%s\"": "属性 \"%s\" 遇到无效的元素 ID 格式",
  "Error reading attribute \"%s\"": "读取属性 \"%s\" 时出错",
  "Expecting '{', didn't find it!": "应为 '{'，但未找到！",
  "Expecting '}', didn't find it!": "应为 '}'，但未找到！",
  "Expecting attribute name, didn't find it!": "应为属性名称，但未找到！",
  "Encountered an element array attribute '%s' while reading the prefix element": "读取前缀元素时遇到元素数组属性 '%s'",
  "Expecting element type name, didn't find it!": "应为元素类型名称，但未找到！",
  "CDmSerializerBinary: Unable to read attribute '%s' of element '%s' - unknown attribute type!": "CDmSerializerBinary：无法读取属性 '%s'（元素 '%s'） - 未知的属性类型！",
  "CDmSerializerBinary: Removing deprecated objectid attribute '%s' of element '%s'": "CDmSerializerBinary：正在移除已弃用的 objectid 属性 '%s'（元素 '%s'）",
  "CDmSerializerBinary: Attribute '%s' of element '%s' read as '%s' but expected '%s'": "CDmSerializerBinary：属性 '%s'（元素 '%s'）读取为 '%s' 但预期为 '%s'",
  "CDmSerializerBinary: Unknown error reading '%s' attribute '%s' of element '%s'": "CDmSerializerBinary：读取属性 '%s'（元素 '%s'）时发生未知错误",
  "CDmSerializerBinary: Encountered element attribute while reading prefix element: '%s' attribute '%s' of element '%s'": "CDmSerializerBinary：读取前缀元素时遇到元素属性：'%s' 属性 '%s'（元素 '%s'）",
  "CDmSerializerBinary: Encountered element_array attribute while reading prefix element: '%s' attribute '%s' of element '%s'": "CDmSerializerBinary：读取前缀元素时遇到元素数组属性：'%s' 属性 '%s'（元素 '%s'）",
  "Binary: Element uses unknown element type %s": "二进制：元素使用了未知元素类型 %s",
  "Cleanup": "清理",
  "g_pApplication is not yet initialized!": "g_pApplication 尚未初始化！",
  "Failed to find mod fgd file from the gameinfo.gi file!": "未能从 gameinfo.gi 文件中找到 mod FGD 文件！",
  "Failed to load FGD file '%s'.": "加载 FGD 文件 '%s' 失败。",
  "CMesh Cannot create packed input layout, too many blend weights per vertex %d, max %d": "CMesh 无法创建打包输入布局，每个顶点的混合权重 %d 过多，最大 %d",
  "Unexpected Blend Weight Count %d with %d joints": "意外的混合权重数量 %d（有 %d 个关节）",
  "Requested split stream input layout from non-split material!": "从非拆分材质请求了拆分流输入布局！",
  "ExtrudeReplaceHull failed to build new convex hull with extrusion %f": "ExtrudeReplaceHull 未能以挤出量 %f 构建新的凸包",
  "Embree error %d: %s": "Embree 错误 %d：%s",
  "Precomputed transmission: Embree failed to initialize!": "预计算透射：Embree 初始化失败！",
  "Precomputed transmission: Failed to setup Embree scene!": "预计算透射：设置 Embree 场景失败！",
  "Input mesh is missing position stream.": "输入网格缺少位置流。",
  "Input mesh is missing texture coordinate stream.": "输入网格缺少纹理坐标流。",
  "Input mesh is missing normal stream.": "输入网格缺少法线流。",
  "Input mesh is missing tangent stream.": "输入网格缺少切线流。",
  "Degenerate output mesh.": "输出网格退化。",
  "Failed to save EXR: %s": "保存 EXR 失败：%s",
  "Precomputed transmission: Failed to setup mesh data.": "预计算透射：设置网格数据失败。",
  "Precomputed transmission: Failed to write output texture %s": "预计算透射：写入输出纹理 %s 失败",
  "Unable to read resource file %s!": "无法读取资源文件 %s！",
  "Source Hull F=%d V=%d hE=%d": "源凸包 F=%d V=%d hE=%d",
  "%s F=%d V=%d hE=%d": "%s F=%d V=%d hE=%d",
  "halfEdges %d,%d faces %d,%d angle %.1f deg.": "半边 %d,%d 面 %d,%d 角度 %.1f 度。",
  "Next edge before queue update": "队列更新前的下一条边",
  "WARNING: Unable to load the FGD file '%s'.": "警告：无法加载 FGD 文件 '%s'。",
  "Failed to find a hit group ID for name %s": "未能找到名称 %s 的受击组 ID",
  "%s: Missing hitgroup %s": "%s：缺少受击组 %s",
  "Must call InitModelDocLib before using the library.": "必须在使用该库前调用 InitModelDocLib。",
  "Failed to unserialize document data from kv3 data:\n%s": "从 kv3 数据反序列化文档数据失败：\n%s",
  "Failed to write file: %s": "写入文件失败：%s",
  "Failed to save document kv3 data: %s": "保存文档 kv3 数据失败：%s",
  "Invalid node type: %s": "无效的节点类型：%s",
  "Failed to find parent for node '%s'": "未能找到节点 '%s' 的父节点",
  "Calling InitModelDocLib() twice in the same DLL.": "在同一个 DLL 中调用了两次 InitModelDocLib()。",
  "%s%s: Expected 'skeleton_list' array": "%s%s：应为 'skeleton_list' 数组",
  "%s%s: No skeleton type '%s' found": "%s%s：未找到骨架类型 '%s'",
  "%s%s: Expected 'chains' array for skeleton '%s'": "%s%s：骨架 '%s' 应有 'chains' 数组",
  "%s%s: Expected 'elements' array for chain '%s'": "%s%s：链 '%s' 应有 'elements' 数组",
  "%s%s: Could not find 'root' chain": "%s%s：找不到 'root' 链",
  "Specify the type of culling of the skeleton for animated models.\t\t\t<br><b>NOTE</b>: Models without animations are always Aggressive.<br>\n\t\t\t<table>\t\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<th align=\"left\"><b>Aggressive</b></th>\t\t\t<th align=\"left\">Removes any bones which are not skinned or referenced</th>\t\t\t</tr>\t\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<th align=\"left\"><b>Leaf Only</b></th>\t\t\t<th align=\"left\">Removes any bones which are not skinned or referenced that have no children</th>\t\t\t</tr>\t\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<th align=\"left\"><b>None</b></th>\t\t\t<th align=\"left\">Doesn't remove any bones</th>\t\t\t</tr>\t\t\t</table>": "指定动画模型骨架的剔除类型。\t\t\t<br><b>注意</b>：没有动画的模型始终为激进模式。<br>\n\t\t\t<table>\t\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<th align=\"left\"><b>激进</b></th>\t\t\t<th align=\"left\">移除所有未蒙皮或未被引用的骨骼</th>\t\t\t</tr>\t\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<th align=\"left\"><b>仅叶节点</b></th>\t\t\t<th align=\"left\">移除所有未蒙皮或未被引用且没有子节点的骨骼</th>\t\t\t</tr>\t\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<th align=\"left\"><b>无</b></th>\t\t\t<th align=\"left\">不移除任何骨骼</th>\t\t\t</tr>\t\t\t</table>",
  "FABRIK": "FABRIK",
  "Defines a named pose parameter which is a float value that is an interface to controlling sequences.\nShould not be used with AnimGraph, use AnimGraph parameters instead.": "定义一个命名的姿势参数，它是一个浮点值，是控制序列的接口。\n不应与 AnimGraph 一起使用，请改用 AnimGraph 参数。",
  "Viewing RenderMeshFile: %s": "正在查看 RenderMeshFile：%s",
  "Warning: %s": "警告：%s",
  "No animation in additional file: %s": "附加文件中没有动画：%s",
  "Invalid Hold Frame %d -- Frame %d Out Of Range, Valid Range: [ %d, %d ]": "无效的定格帧 %d -- 帧 %d 超出范围，有效范围：[ %d, %d ]",
  "IModelDocUtils unavailable": "IModelDocUtils 不可用",
  "Invalid Start Frame %d > End Frame %d, Empty Animation": "无效的起始帧 %d > 结束帧 %d，动画为空",
  "IModelDocLoaderUtils unavailable": "IModelDocLoaderUtils 不可用",
  "Cannot Merge: Frame Rate %d of additional animation \"%s\" doesn't match Frame Rate %d of base animation \"%s\"": "无法合并：附加动画 \"%s\" 的帧率 %d 与基础动画 \"%s\" 的帧率 %d 不匹配",
  "%s must be either a cloth collision shape, a proxy mesh or a cloth chain": "%s 必须是布料碰撞形状、代理网格或布料链",
  "Too many antitunnel groups, only 32 are supported": "防穿透组过多，最多支持 32 个",
  "Antitunnel has no collision layers to collide against": "防穿透没有可碰撞的碰撞层",
  "Hinge does not refer a bone": "铰链未引用骨骼",
  "Bone %s has multiple hinges, other hinge: %s": "骨骼 %s 有多个铰链，另一个铰链：%s",
  "ClothNode [static rotating]": "ClothNode [静态旋转]",
  "ClothNode [static]": "ClothNode [静态]",
  "Cannot find bone '%s' in document": "在文档中找不到骨骼 '%s'",
  "Cannot find RenderMesh node named '%s'.": "找不到名为 '%s' 的 RenderMesh 节点。",
  "No triangles found, cannot build SDF": "未找到三角形，无法构建 SDF",
  "Cannot locate bone named %s.": "找不到名为 %s 的骨骼。",
  "Computing distance field Z slice [%d/%d]": "正在计算距离场 Z 切片 [%d/%d]",
  "BuildHybridSDF: Computing distances": "BuildHybridSDF：正在计算距离",
  "Computing distance field floodfill (pass %d)...": "正在计算距离场泛洪填充（第 %d 趟）……",
  "BuildHybridSDF: Flood filling": "BuildHybridSDF：正在泛洪填充",
  "Cannot create convex hull from %d verts": "无法从 %d 个顶点创建凸包",
  "Unable to rename bone from '%s' to '%s', %s[%s] failed to apply bone rename": "无法将骨骼从“%s”重命名为“%s”，%s[%s] 应用骨骼重命名失败",
  "Failed to find dest node '%s'": "找不到目标节点“%s”",
  "%s (CS: %3d, TU: %3d, HU: %3d, HD: %3d, TD: %3d)": "%s (CS: %3d, TU: %3d, HU: %3d, HD: %3d, TD: %3d)",
  "KeychainMarkup [%s]": "钥匙链标记 [%s]",
  "Autograph": "签名",
  "-deprecated-": "-已弃用-",
  "Viewing %s: (%i inputs)": "正在查看 %s：（%i 个输入）",
  "No 'position' data stream for VSNAP!": "缺少 VSNAP 所需的“position”数据流！",
  "Failed to load bind pose reference file (%s)": "加载绑定姿势参考文件失败（%s）",
  "VSNAP Node needs either a node name or explicit output resource": "VSNAP 节点需要节点名称或显式输出资源",
  "Output override '%s' is not a valid vsnap name": "输出覆盖“%s”不是有效的 vsnap 名称",
  "Empty MeshID.": "MeshID 为空。",
  "Select '": "选择 '",
  "Can't find bone named '%s'.": "找不到名为“%s”的骨骼。",
  "Cannot add bone named '%s', one already exists.": "无法添加名为“%s”的骨骼，已存在同名骨骼。",
  "Failed to apply UVMap Cylinder": "应用圆柱 UV 贴图失败",
  "Cannot rename bone to empty string.": "无法将骨骼重命名为空字符串。",
  "Selection Assertion": "选择断言",
  "This MeshOpSelectionAssertion isn't checking anything.": "此 MeshOpSelectionAssertion 未检查任何内容。",
  "Unable to get loader utils": "无法获取加载器工具",
  "TextureGenerator cannot build a relative output file without a starting path.": "缺少起始路径，TextureGenerator 无法构建相对输出文件。",
  "TextureGenerator was unable to load the generator material.": "TextureGenerator 无法加载生成器材质。",
  "TextureGenerator model vertex extents are invalid.": "TextureGenerator 模型顶点范围无效。",
  "Computed Cavity Map for %i pixels in %.3f (%i pixels per job, %i total traces)": "为 %i 个像素计算空腔图耗时 %.3f（每个任务 %i 像素，共 %i 次追踪）",
  "Modelconfig error - details above.": "模型配置错误 - 详情见上。",
  "(no-compile)": "（不编译）",
  "ModelDoc \"%s\" node incompatible with AnimGraph": "ModelDoc 节点\"%s\"与动画图不兼容",
  "A list of animations which blend in a single dimension.\nShould not be used with AnimGraph, use the \"Blend 1D\" node in AnimGraph instead.": "在单一维度上混合的动画列表。\n不应与动画图一起使用，请改用动画图中的\"Blend 1D\"节点。",
  "A list of animations which blend in two dimensions.\nShould not be used with AnimGraph, use the \"Blend 1D\" node in AnimGraph instead.": "在两个维度上混合的动画列表。\n不应与动画图一起使用，请改用动画图中的\"Blend 1D\"节点。",
  "Material \"%s\" failed to load.": "材质\"%s\"加载失败。",
  "{ uninitialized }": "{ 未初始化 }",
  "{ IGNORED }": "{ 忽略 }",
  "AnimCombine [%s]": "动画合并 [%s]",
  "Instead of referencing the mesh directly in this LOD group, instead copy it and apply a simplification operation.\n(The resulting mesh will be automatically added to any bodygroups that reference the original mesh.)": "在此 LOD 组中不直接引用网格，而是复制它并应用简化操作。\n（生成的网格将自动添加到引用原网格的任何身体组中。）",
  "Unknown mesh '%s'": "未知网格“%s”",
  "Unsupported mesh type for '%s': %s": "“%s”的网格类型不受支持：%s",
  "min( max( %s, %.2g ), %.2g ) / %.2g": "min( max( %s, %.2g ), %.2g ) / %.2g",
  "( min( max( %s, %.2g ), %.2g ) - %.2g ) / %.2g": "( min( max( %s, %.2g ), %.2g ) - %.2g ) / %.2g",
  "Lock Goal Strength >= 1.0": "目标强度锁定 >= 1.0",
  "Cannot read mask stream: unsupported type %d": "无法读取遮罩流：不支持的类型 %d",
  "Unexpected map type %d of %s. Please rebuild.": "意外的贴图类型 %d（属于 %s）。请重新构建。",
  "Only applied to hitboxes which have a \"Forced Transform\" at runtime.  Currently that is only Dota selection hitboxes.\nIf set, this hitbox will remain world-oriented as it follows the parent bone, rather than rotating with it.": "仅适用于运行时具有\"强制变换\"的受击框。目前仅为 Dota 选择受击框。\n设置后，此受击框在跟随父骨骼时保持世界朝向，而不随其旋转。",
  "Reassign the parent index of a given bone.<p>\nNOTE: As this is a modifier node, it only affects data coming from the parent node's input file.": "重新指定给定骨骼的父索引。<p>\n注意：作为修改器节点，它仅影响来自父节点输入文件的数据。",
  "Spew Wrinkle Stats": "输出褶皱统计信息",
  "VertexLocks provided but not using a simplification method that honors them": "提供了 VertexLocks，但未使用支持它的简化方法",
  "No vertex attribute name specified": "未指定顶点属性名称",
  "Expected Float Data For Vertex Map \"%s\", Got %s": "顶点图\"%s\"应为浮点数据，实际为 %s",
  "Discards animation channels by type and name.\n<br>The channel will end up with the bind pose value as defined by the model.\n<br>Name can be a wildcard glob, i.e. use * to discard all channels of the specified type.\n<br>If Static Only is checked the animation channel must also be static, i.e. Channel's value doesn't change during the animation.\n<br><b>NOTE</b>: Can only discard an entire bone channel, not just the translation, rotation or scale components.\n<br><b>NOTE</b>: As this is an animation modifier, it can be applied at the folder level to all animation nodes contained in it.": "按类型和名称丢弃动画通道。\n<br>通道最终将取模型定义的绑定姿势值。\n<br>名称可使用通配符 glob，即用 * 丢弃指定类型的所有通道。\n<br>若勾选“仅静态”，动画通道还必须是静态的，即通道值在动画期间不变。\n<br><b>注意</b>：只能丢弃整个骨骼通道，不能只丢弃平移、旋转或缩放分量。\n<br><b>注意</b>：作为动画修改器，它可应用于文件夹级别，作用于其中包含的所有动画节点。",
  "Warning! Particle Snapshot - Cannot find skinned bone %s in model": "警告！粒子快照 - 模型中找不到蒙皮骨骼 %s",
  "Warning! Particle Snapshot - VertexColors or VertexSortByColor specified but no colors found in model": "警告！粒子快照 - 指定了 VertexColors 或 VertexSortByColor 但模型中没有颜色",
  "Warning! Particle Snapshot - VertexSortByTexCoordU specified but no texture coords found in model": "警告！粒子快照 - 指定了 VertexSortByTexCoordU 但模型中没有纹理坐标",
  "An empty animation, typically used as a container for a number of add/blend layers.\nShould not be used with AnimGraph, use the \"Zero Pose\" node in AnimGraph instead.": "空动画，通常用作多个叠加/混合层的容器。\n不应与动画图一起使用，请改用动画图中的\"Zero Pose\"节点。",
  "Keep track of the position/orientation of the specific chain before the sequence is applied, then after it's applied, do a local IK rule to move it back into position/orientation. The weights are floating point values form 0.0 to 1.0, if both are 0 this node does nothing.\nShould not be used with AnimGraph.": "在应用序列之前记录特定链的位置/朝向，应用后再通过局部 IK 规则将其移回原位置/朝向。权重为 0.0 到 1.0 的浮点值，若两者均为 0，此节点不执行任何操作。\n不应与动画图一起使用。",
  "An animation to composite overtop of this animation.  The cycle of the composited animation will be the same as this animation.\nShould not be used with AnimGraph": "合成到此动画之上的动画。合成动画的循环与此动画相同。\n不应与动画图一起使用",
  "Base class for BlendLayers which are animations which composite overtop of another animation.\nShould not be used with AnimGraph.": "BlendLayer 的基类，BlendLayer 是合成到另一动画之上的动画。\n不应与动画图一起使用。",
  "An animation to composite overtop of this animation.  Various parameters control the composite.\nShould not be used with AnimGraph.": "合成到此动画之上的动画。各种参数控制合成方式。\n不应与动画图一起使用。",
  "An animation to composite overtop of its parent animation.  The cycle of this animation is driven by a pose parameter.\nShould not be used with AnimGraph.": "合成到其父动画之上的动画。此动画的循环由姿势参数驱动。\n不应与动画图一起使用。",
  "An animation which always plays as a layer on top of everything.\nShould not be used with AnimGraph.": "始终作为层播放于所有内容之上的动画。\n不应与动画图一起使用。",
  "Changes how the cycle time is computed.  Mainly used with autolayer.\nShould not be used with AnimGraph.": "更改循环时间的计算方式。主要用于自动层。\n不应与动画图一起使用。",
  "AnimForceBonePosition [%s]": "AnimForceBonePosition [%s]",
  "AnimForceBonePositionRange [%s]": "AnimForceBonePositionRange [%s]",
  "AnimForceBoneSpin [%s]": "AnimForceBoneSpin [%s]",
  "AnimForceMorphValueRange [%s]": "AnimForceMorphValueRange [%s]",
  "AnimAnchorBonePosition [%s]": "AnimAnchorBonePosition [%s]",
  "AnimProxy never found sequence matching '%s'": "AnimProxy 未找到匹配“%s”的序列",
  "PoseParam( %s ) node already defined but expected [ min, max ] == [ -1, 1 ], got [ %g, %g ]": "PoseParam（%s）节点已定义，但期望 [ min, max ] == [ -1, 1 ]，实际为 [ %g, %g ]",
  "VSNAP that doesn't load a file and starts off with a set of reasonable default streams": "不加载文件并以一组合理的默认流启动的 VSNAP",
  "help text for Integer!": "整数帮助文本！",
