  "The file must be saved in the game content directory before it can used in game.\nOpen anyway?": "文件必须先保存在游戏内容目录中才能在游戏中使用。\n仍要打开吗？",
  "Cannot open '%1':\nThe file does not exist!": "无法打开 '%1':\n文件不存在！",
