  "Failed to load '%1':\nError while loading the file:\n%2": "加载 '%1' 失败:\n加载文件时出错:\n%2",
  "New Sound Event Name, ideally some form of \"Owner_Subowner.Descriptor_Action\"\n\nExamples:\n\nWorld.Acid_Geyser_Loop\nNPC_Monster.Item_Attach\nBurbankSuit.PlugDetach\nGrenadeLauncher.Fire_Sticky": "新声音事件名称，最好采用 \"Owner_Subowner.Descriptor_Action\" 的形式\n\n示例:\n\nWorld.Acid_Geyser_Loop\nNPC_Monster.Item_Attach\nBurbankSuit.PlugDetach\nGrenadeLauncher.Fire_Sticky",
  "There is already a Sound Event named '%1' in this mod.\nPlease choose another name.": "此 mod 中已存在名为 '%1' 的声音事件。\n请选择其他名称。",
  "New Sound Event Name, created from the selected VSound.\nFeel free to leave the name as is, otherwise please rename\nwith the following convention, ideally some form of:\n\n\"Owner_Subowner.Descriptor_Action\"\n\nExamples:\n\nWorld.Acid_Geyser_Loop\nNPC_Monster.Item_Attach\nBurbankSuit.PlugDetach\nGrenadeLauncher.Fire_Sticky\n\n(gameinfo.gi convars will set the default sound stack per mod)": "由所选 VSound 创建的新声音事件名称。\n可以保留原名称，否则请按照以下约定重命名，\n最好采用如下形式:\n\n\"Owner_Subowner.Descriptor_Action\"\n\n示例:\n\nWorld.Acid_Geyser_Loop\nNPC_Monster.Item_Attach\nBurbankSuit.PlugDetach\nGrenadeLauncher.Fire_Sticky\n\n（gameinfo.gi 的控制台变量将设置每个 mod 的默认声音栈）",
  "%s did not shut down correctly the last time it was used.\nMore recent autosaves exist of the files you were working on.\nWould you like to recover the last saved versions of the files that were open?": "%s 上次使用时未正常关闭。\n你正在处理的文件存在更新的自动保存版本。\n要恢复曾打开文件的最后保存版本吗？",
  "The current autosave directory does not have an absolute path.\nThe autosave feature will be disabled.": "当前自动保存目录没有绝对路径。\n自动保存功能将被禁用。",
  "The autosave directory does not exist and could not be created.\nThe autosave feature will be disabled.": "自动保存目录不存在且无法创建。\n自动保存功能将被禁用。",
