  "On FBX export, specify the units to export in or specify a custom scale factor.": "FBX 导出时，指定导出单位或指定自定义缩放系数。",
  "Exclude bones and their children from export if they have exactly the specified bone flags with no other flags set. Skeleton Only export.": "若骨骼及其子级恰好具有指定骨骼标志且未设置其他标志，则将其从导出中排除。仅导出骨架时有效。",
  "Exports in a binary format if true, otherwise exports in a text format if possible.": "为真时以二进制格式导出，否则尽可能以文本格式导出。",
  "Exclude bones and their children from export if they have the specified bone flags.  Other flags may be set.  Skeleton Only export.": "若骨骼及其子级具有指定骨骼标志（可能还设置了其他标志），则将其从导出中排除。仅导出骨架时有效。",
