  "The default entity tools should associate with this model.\n(eg. Hammer drag-and-drop and ModelDoc game preview.)\n\nIf not specified, a guess is made is based on the model:\n  no prop_data, no animations = prop_static\n  no prop_data, YES animations = prop_dynamic\n  YES prop_data, no animations = prop_physics\n  YES prop_data, YES animations = prop_ragdoll": "默认实体工具应与此模型关联的实体。\n（例如 Hammer 拖放和 ModelDoc 游戏预览。）\n\n如果未指定，将根据模型进行推测：\n  无 prop_data、无动画 = prop_static\n  无 prop_data、有动画 = prop_dynamic\n  有 prop_data、无动画 = prop_physics\n  有 prop_data、有动画 = prop_ragdoll",
