  "Will automatically resize the property editor label column.  If on and column is manually resized, new size will stick until property editor focus is changed.": "自动调整属性编辑器标签列的宽度。如果开启且手动调整了列宽，新尺寸将保持生效，直到属性编辑器焦点改变。",
