  "Controls whether delta animations will preview over the model's bind pose or on their own.\nNote that selecting an animation view the compiled preview outliner will never do a delta over bind pose preview.": "控制增量动画是在模型的绑定姿态上预览还是单独预览。\n注意，在编译预览大纲视图中选择动画时，绝不会在绑定姿态上做增量预览。",
