  "Delete all pre-existing physics shapes and joints? (Recommended)": "删除所有已存在的物理形状和关节？（推荐）",
  "Biped Rig": "双足骨架",
  "Attempts to create a reasonable set of default physics shapes for a biped ragdoll,by looking for bone names that follow standard naming conventions.(Configured by <tt>core/tools/model_skeleton_types.txt</tt>)<br>The tree below defines the mapping between this model and the 'generic biped' skeleton.<br><font color=red>NOTE: The resulting ragdoll may still require hand-tweaking before it is stable or usable!</font><br>Ragdoll tips:<br> - Shapes for adjacent (parent-child) bones should be overlapping and the joint should be in the overlapping area.<br> - Shapes for non-adjacent bones should NOT be overlapping.": "尝试通过查找符合标准命名规范的骨骼名称，为双足布娃娃创建一套合理的默认物理形状。（由 <tt>core/tools/model_skeleton_types.txt</tt> 配置）<br>下面的树定义了此模型与\"通用双足\"骨架之间的映射。<br><font color=red>注意：生成的布娃娃在稳定或可用之前可能仍需要手动调整！</font><br>布娃娃技巧：<br> - 相邻（父子）骨骼的形状应相互重叠，且关节应位于重叠区域内。<br> - 非相邻骨骼的形状不应重叠。",
  "Skinning Threshold:": "蒙皮阈值：",
  "Create Ragdoll": "创建布娃娃",
  "Factor to shrink/grow the shapes created by this process": "缩小或放大此过程创建的形状的系数",
  "Skin weight threshold to determine whether a vertex should contribute to a bone's volume.": "用于确定顶点是否对骨骼体积有贡献的蒙皮权重阈值。",
  "Scale Factor:": "缩放系数：",
  "Build Ragdoll": "构建布娃娃",
  "Compiling assets: %i / %i": "正在编译资源：%i / %i",
  "Compiling Asset: %s": "正在编译资源：%s",
  "Cannot match frame counts animations with non-matching frame rates.": "无法匹配帧数：动画的帧率不一致。",
  "All blend animations referenced by %s[%s] do not have matching frame rates.": "%s[%s] 引用的所有混合动画的帧率均不匹配。",
  "Non-Matching Frame Rates On %s[%s] Animations": "%s[%s] 动画的帧率不匹配",
  "Cannot Determine Frame Information For %s[%s]": "无法确定 %s[%s] 的帧信息",
  "No Animations Need Adjusting": "没有需要调整的动画",
  "Ensure frame rates on all animations are identical and try again.": "确保所有动画的帧率一致后重试。",
  "<td align=\"right\">%d</td>": "<td align=\"right\">%d</td>",
  "<html><body><h2>Review End Hold Adjustments</h2><p>Below are the proposed adjustments to the <b>End Holds</b> on the referenced animations.</p><p>Implementing these adjustments will ensure all referenced animations of %s[%s] have a consistent frame count.</p><p></p><table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"3\">\t\t<tr>\t\t<th>Animation</th>\t\t<th>Frames</th>\t\t<th>End&nbsp;Hold</th>\t\t<th>Total&nbsp;Frames</th>\t\t<th>End&nbsp;Hold&nbsp;Adjustment</th>\t\t<th>New&nbsp;End&nbsp;Hold</th>\t\t<th>New&nbsp;Total&nbsp;Frames</th>\t</tr>": "<html><body><h2>查看结束定格调整</h2><p>以下是对引用动画<b>结束定格</b>的建议调整。</p><p>实施这些调整将确保 %s[%s] 的所有引用动画具有一致的帧数。</p><p></p><table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"3\">\t\t<tr>\t\t<th>动画</th>\t\t<th>帧数</th>\t\t<th>结束&nbsp;定格</th>\t\t<th>总帧数</th>\t\t<th>结束&nbsp;定格&nbsp;调整</th>\t\t<th>新结束&nbsp;定格</th>\t\t<th>新总帧数</th>\t</tr>",
  "<td><p style=\"color:green\">No&nbsp;Change</p></td>": "<td><p style=\"color:green\">无&nbsp;更改</p></td>",
  "<td><nobr><font color=\"yellow\">Add +%d Frames</font></nobr></td>": "<td><nobr><font color=\"yellow\">添加 +%d 帧</font></nobr></td>",
  "<td><font color=\"red\">Remove&nbsp;%d&nbsp;Frames</font></td>": "<td><font color=\"red\">移除&nbsp;%d&nbsp;帧</font></td>",
  "Apply End Hold Adjustments?": "应用结束定格调整？",
  "<nobr>    </nobr>": "<nobr>    </nobr>",
  "Match Frame Counts On %s(%s) Animations": "匹配 %s(%s) 动画的帧数",
  "<p>Apply End Hold Adjustments?</p>": "<p>应用结束定格调整？</p>",
