  "Triangle Count": "三角形数量",
  "The mod relative path to the material.": "材质相对于 mod 的路径。",
  "Skinning Supported": "支持蒙皮",
  "Number of triangle or lines depending on the type of render primitive.  Essentially Vertex Count / 3 or Vertex Count / 2": "三角形或线条数量（取决于渲染图元类型）。本质上为顶点数 / 3 或顶点数 / 2",
  "Number of vertices in this render primitive": "此渲染图元中的顶点数量",
  "Mesh Has Skinning": "网格具有蒙皮",
  "If true, this mesh has blend weights & indices, i.e. skinning in its draw calls": "为 true 时，此网格具有混合权重和索引，即其绘制调用中包含蒙皮",
  "Number of blend weights per vertex.  If this attribute is visible, the mesh has blend weights, i.e. skinning.": "每个顶点的混合权重数量。如果此属性可见，则网格具有混合权重，即蒙皮。",
  "Mass (kg)": "质量 (kg)",
  "Mass Center": "质量中心",
  "Face Count": "面数",
  "Vertex Count": "顶点数",
  "Foot Length": "脚部长度",
  "Bind Pose Direction": "绑定姿态方向",
  "Shows whether the material and the shader it uses supports skinning. Skinning support in the shader is required for a mesh to animate via bone animation. Materials intended for environments can use shaders which do not support skinning. Such materials/shaders shouldn't be used on models which need to animate. Skinning support is determined by querying the shader's vertex buffer signature and looking for the semantic name BlendIndices. A shader which supports skinning typically needs DynamicComboRule( Allow0( D_BLEND_WEIGHT_COUNT ) )": "显示材质及其使用的着色器是否支持蒙皮。网格要通过骨骼动画产生动画需要着色器支持蒙皮。用于环境的材质可以使用不支持蒙皮的着色器。此类材质/着色器不应用于需要动画的模型。蒙皮支持通过查询着色器顶点缓冲区签名并查找语义名称 BlendIndices 来确定。支持蒙皮的着色器通常需要 DynamicComboRule( Allow0( D_BLEND_WEIGHT_COUNT ) )",
  "Morph Supported": "支持形变",
  "Shows whether the material and the shader it uses supports morph vertex animation. Morph support in the material and shader is required for morph data defined on the model and mesh to animate. Morph support is determined by querying the shader's vertex buffer signature and looking for the semantic name MorphIndex. Materials which do not support morph either completely in the shader or have the F_MORPH_SUPPORTED feature in the material turned off.": "显示材质及其使用的着色器是否支持形变顶点动画。模型和网格上定义的形变数据要产生动画需要材质和着色器支持形变。形变支持通过查询着色器顶点缓冲区签名并查找语义名称 MorphIndex 来确定。不支持形变的材质要么着色器完全不支持，要么材质中的 F_MORPH_SUPPORTED 特性被关闭。",
  "Initial material assigned for this draw call, can vary during rendering via material groups": "此绘制调用的初始材质，可在渲染期间通过材质组更改",
  "Vertex Count in this draw call": "此绘制调用中的顶点数量",
  "Render Primitive Type": "渲染图元类型",
  "The type of primitive which will be rendered for this draw call": "此绘制调用将渲染的图元类型",
  "If true, this draw call has blend weights & indices, i.e. skinning data": "为 true 时，此绘制调用具有混合权重和索引，即蒙皮数据",
  "Input Layout Fields": "输入布局字段",
  "Input Fields On The Draw Call, i.e. Vertex Data": "绘制调用上的输入字段，即顶点数据",
  "Semantic Name": "语义名称",
  "Name of the field, i.e. position, normal, etc..": "字段的名称，即位置、法线等。",
  "Semantic Index": "语义索引",
  "The index of the field, e.g. multiple texture coordinate fields": "字段的索引，例如多个纹理坐标字段",
  "Color Format": "颜色格式",
  "The color format of the field": "字段的颜色格式",
  "Force Mesh Visible": "强制网格可见",
  "Force Mesh Hidden": "强制网格隐藏",
  "Default Mesh Visibility (Honor Bodygroups)": "默认网格可见性（遵循身体组）",
