  "This node takes time to run (yielding). Should we wait for this node to complete before proceeding? Or should this node execute simultaneously, equivalent to scheduling using an additional 'Fire Child Cursors' node?": "此节点需要时间运行（让出）。是等待此节点完成后再继续，还是让此节点同时执行（等效于使用额外的“发射子游标”节点进行调度）？",
