  "On After Killed": "终止之后",
  "After the node completes its work and the original cursor is killed, a new cursor will be created here.": "当节点完成其工作且原始游标被终止后，将在此处创建一个新游标。",
  "While Active": "活动期间",
  "When this node yields, a new cursor will be created here. After the node is complete or canceled, this other cursor will be canceled as well.": "当此节点让出时，将在此处创建一个新游标。当节点完成或取消后，该游标也会被取消。",
