  "Variable Definition": "变量定义",
  "Defines a variable that can be read and written anywhere within the graph.": "定义一个可在图中任意位置读写的变量。",
  "Keys Source": "键来源",
  "Where the initial value of this variable can be specified by users of the graph. (Eg. if VMAP, it will be visible in the Hammer property editor)": "图的使用者可在何处指定此变量的初始值。（例如，若为 VMAP，它将显示在 Hammer 属性编辑器中）",
  "Suppress Expression": "抑制表达式",
  "Editor Properties": "编辑器属性",
  "[Advanced] An expression which can reference other variables to determine if this property should be shown or hidden.": "[高级] 一个表达式，可引用其他变量来确定此属性应显示还是隐藏。",
  "Will be placed in a group with other properties that share the same group name.": "将与其他共享相同组名的属性放在同一组中。",
  "Assigns a friendly name to be displayed in the editor": "指定要在编辑器中显示的易读名称",
  "If set, this variable is visible to other non-blackboard graphs.": "如果设置，此变量对其他非黑板图可见。",
  "Public Output": "公共输出",
  "Defines a signal that this graph can emit (for entities, creates an output that can be linked to other entities via the I/O system)": "定义此图可以发出的信号（对于实体，创建可通过 I/O 系统链接到其他实体的输出）",
  "Out Default": "出流默认",
  "In Default": "入流默认",
  "Constant Definition": "常量定义",
  "Defines a constant unchanging value that can be referenced anywhere in the graph.": "定义一个可在图中任意位置引用的恒定不变的值。",
  "Entity Output": "实体输出",
  "An entry point that will automatically listen for an Output from the referenced Entity in the Parent Map.": "一个自动监听父地图中所引用实体输出的入口点。",
  "Source Entity": "源实体",
  "Entity I/O Output Parameter": "实体 I/O 输出参数",
  "Activator": "激活者",
  "Caller": "调用者",
  "Legacy node name '%s' on node %d, discarding": "节点 %d 上的旧版节点名称 '%s'，正在丢弃",
  "'%s' is not a known output": "'%s' 不是已知的输出",
  "Sleep": "休眠",
  "Pauses a cursor by putting it to sleep until an unrelated event wakes it. Keywords: wait, yield.": "通过使游标休眠来暂停它，直到无关事件将其唤醒。关键词：wait、yield。",
  "Causes the cursor to sleep at this node until a later time.": "使游标在此节点休眠，直到稍后的时间。",
  "On Variable Change": "变量更改时",
  "Entry point for when a variable's value has changed.": "变量值更改时的入口点。",
  "Previous Value": "先前的值",
  "The previous value of the variable": "变量的先前值",
  "Current Value": "当前值",
  "The current value of the variable": "变量的当前值",
  "self:%u": "self:%u",
  "No variable specified!": "未指定变量！",
  "On Variable Changed %s": "变量 %s 更改时",
  "Exit taken if the switch value doesn't match any cases": "当开关值与任何分支都不匹配时采用该出口",
  "case [%d] is an invalid case!": "分支 [%d] 无效！",
  "Switch:": "开关：",
  "Ordered": "按顺序",
  "Outputs selected in order": "按顺序选择输出",
  "Outputs at random without repicking (until all have been visited)": "随机选择输出且不重复选取（直到全部被访问过）",
  "Outputs at random, repeats allowed": "随机选择输出，允许重复",
  "Cyclic Branch": "循环分支",
  "Directs each subsequent cursor to a different path. The order can be sequential, shuffled, or totally random. Keywords: cycle, exit.": "将每个后续游标引导到不同的路径。顺序可以是依次、打乱或完全随机。关键词：cycle、exit。",
  "Cycle Mode": "循环模式",
  "Cycle Exit (%s)": "循环出口（%s）",
  "Num Branches": "分支数量",
  "Branch %d": "分支 %d",
  "Conditional Branch": "条件分支",
  "Directs the cursor to different paths depending on a boolean condition. Equivalent to an if-else statement in code. Keywords: exit, continue.": "根据布尔条件将游标引导到不同的路径。等效于代码中的 if-else 语句。关键词：exit、continue。",
  "Invert Condition": "反转条件",
  "Change the input condition to its opposite before evaluating. Equivalent to an expression Not or '!' node": "在求值前将输入条件变为其相反值。等效于表达式的 Not 或 '!' 节点",
  "Condition to check": "要检查的条件",
  "Exit taken if the condition is true": "当条件为真时采用该出口",
