  "Switch Branch ( int )": "开关分支（整数）",
  "Directs the cursor to the path matching the passed in value.<br>(or the default path if the value doesn't match any user-defined paths). Keywords: exit": "将游标引导到与传入值匹配的路径。<br>（如果值与任何用户定义的路径都不匹配，则采用默认路径）。关键词：exit",
  "Cases": "分支",
