  "Followed when a paused VCD is resumed": "当暂停的 VCD 恢复时采用该出流",
  "Missing VCD file '%s'": "缺少 VCD 文件 '%s'",
  "VCD: %s": "VCD：%s",
  "Stop playback at the next interrupt point, then proceed to the next node.": "在下一个中断点停止播放，然后继续到下一个节点。",
  "Stop playback at the next interrupt point, then kill the primary cursor.": "在下一个中断点停止播放，然后终止主游标。",
  "Actor: %s": "角色：%s",
  "Trigger: %s": "触发器：%s",
  "Anchor: %s": "锚点：%s",
  "Graph: %s": "图：%s",
  "Clip: %s": "剪辑：%s",
  "Clip Looping: %s": "剪辑循环：%s",
  "Sequence: %s": "序列：%s",
  "[Requirement] %s for: %s": "[需求] %s 用于：%s",
  "Target Override: %s": "目标覆盖：%s",
  "Play Sequence on NPC/Prop Dynamic": "在 NPC/Prop Dynamic 上播放序列",
  "Plays a Sequence on an actor/prop_dynamic and calls each of the trigger outflows when a corresponding anim event is fired.": "在角色/prop_dynamic 上播放序列，并在相应的动画事件触发时调用各个触发出流。",
  "Example model": "示例模型",
  "Used only to find the animation sequences": "仅用于查找动画序列",
  "Sequence '%s'": "序列 '%s'",
  "Could not find sequence!": "找不到序列！",
  "Looping Sequence!": "循环序列！",
  "Cursor will wait here until canceled or a new cursor enters for the same actor.": "游标将在此等待，直到被取消或同一角色有新游标进入。",
  "Sequences with no duration not supported!": "不支持没有时长的序列！",
  "Be careful with looping animations!": "请谨慎使用循环动画！",
  "Sequence has 0 duration!": "序列时长为 0！",
  "Play Scripted Sequence on NPC": "在 NPC 上播放脚本化序列",
  "Grabs an NPC and makes them play a specified set of animations, optionally with any number of additional NPCs.": "控制一个 NPC 并使其播放指定的一组动画，可选附带任意数量的其他 NPC。",
  "Pre Action Idle Animation": "动作前待机动画",
  "The name of the sequence (such as 'idle01') to play before the action animation if the NPC must wait for the script to be triggered.": "如果 NPC 必须等待脚本触发，则在动作动画之前播放的序列名称（例如 'idle01'）。",
  "Entry Animation": "入场动画",
  "The name of the sequence (such as 'reload02') to play when the sequence starts, before transitioning to play the main action sequence.": "序列开始时、在过渡到主动作序列之前播放的序列名称（例如 'reload02'）。",
  "Action Animation": "动作动画",
  "The name of the main sequence (such as 'reload02') to play.": "要播放的主序列名称（例如 'reload02'）。",
  "Post Action Idle Animation": "动作后待机动画",
  "The name of the sequence (such as 'idle01') to play after the action animation.": "在动作动画之后播放的序列名称（例如 'idle01'）。",
  "Loop Pre Idle Animation?": "循环动作前待机动画？",
  "Loop Action Animation?": "循环动作动画？",
  "Loop Post Idle Animation?": "循环动作后待机动画？",
  "Ignore Look At?": "忽略注视？",
  "Move To Behavior": "移动行为",
  "Movement Gait": "移动步态",
  "Held Weapon Behavior": "持武器行为",
  "Sync Group": "同步组",
  "Optional sync group if there is more than one scripted sequence in the Pulse graph that you want to sync with. Leave blank to have this automatically generated.": "如果 Pulse 图中有多个要同步的脚本化序列，可指定可选的同步组。留空则自动生成。",
  "Ensure on Nav Mesh On Finish": "结束时确保位于导航网格上",
  "When finishing the sequence, if the NPC uses the navmesh, ensure the NPC is on a valid location on the navmesh.": "序列结束时，如果 NPC 使用导航网格，确保 NPC 位于导航网格的有效位置上。",
  "Don't Teleport NPC On End": "结束时不传送 NPC",
  "Don't fixup end position with a teleport when the SS is finished.": "脚本化序列结束后，不要用传送修正结束位置。",
  "No Interruptions": "不可中断",
  "Disallow interrupts.": "禁止中断。",
  "Main Actor Animations": "主角色动画",
  "Additional Actors": "附加角色",
  "Begin Sequence": "开始序列",
  "If any actor has a pre-idle, the scripted sequence will wait until this inflow is invoked. Note that this will start the sequence for any scripted sequence waiting on this node.": "如果任何角色有待机前动画，脚本化序列将等待此入流被调用。注意，这将使所有等待此节点的脚本化序列开始。",
  "Main Actor": "主角色",
  "No action animation specified for main actor!": "未为主角色指定动作动画！",
  "No action animation specified for additional actor %u!": "未为附加角色 %u 指定动作动画！",
  "Scripted Sequence '%s'": "脚本化序列 '%s'",
  "No action animation specified!": "未指定动作动画！",
  "Additional Actor %u": "附加角色 %u",
  "Terminates an Input or Hook and returns the provided value to the caller. (Only needed for Inputs that specify a return value, or Hooks that expect one.)": "终止输入或钩子，并将提供的值返回给调用者。（仅对指定返回值的输入或期望返回值的钩子需要。）",
  "Return:": "返回：",
  "Failed to compile return": "编译返回失败",
  "End <unbound>": "结束 <未绑定>",
  "No originating Input found!": "未找到发起的输入！",
  "End (multiple)": "结束（多个）",
  "End %s": "结束 %s",
  "End (?unknown inflow type?)": "结束（？未知入流类型？）",
  "Switch Branch ( schema enum )": "开关分支（架构枚举）",
  "Sequential Branch": "顺序分支",
  "Executes all outflows each time the node is visited. The incoming cursor visits each branch in turn. Keywords: simultaneous, exit.": "每次访问节点时执行所有出流。传入的游标依次访问每个分支。关键词：simultaneous、exit。",
  "Switch Branch ( string )": "开关分支（字符串）",
  "Exit taken once the condition is false (if the condition is false when the cursor arrives, this exit is immediately taken.)": "一旦条件为假即采用该出口（如果游标到达时条件为假，则立即采用该出口。）",
  "Exit taken repeatedly as long as the condition is true (if the condition is false when the cursor arrives, this exit is never taken.)": "只要条件为真就反复采用该出口（如果游标到达时条件为假，则永不采用该出口。）",
  "Loop While": "条件循环",
  "Equivalent to an while-statement in code.": "等效于代码中的 while 语句。",
  "While": "当…时",
  "Condition to check before each execution of the loop body": "每次执行循环体前要检查的条件",
  "Loop For Each": "逐项循环",
  "Loops over the elements in an array, optionally also provides the index.": "遍历数组中的元素，可选提供索引。",
  "Loop Over Array": "要遍历的数组",
  "The array to loop over": "要遍历的数组",
  "Element": "元素",
  "Takes the value of each element in the array": "取数组中每个元素的值",
  "The index of the current element": "当前元素的索引",
  "Could not determine type of result": "无法确定结果的类型",
  "Cannot handle array element value type.": "无法处理数组元素值类型。",
  "Inparam is no longer an array!": "输入参数不再是数组！",
  "This will be the first value emitted.": "这将是发射的第一个值。",
  "This will be the last value emitted.": "这将是发射的最后一个值。",
  "Step Count": "步数",
  "How many emitted values there should be, including start and stop.": "应发射多少个值，包括起点和终点。",
  "The value of this iteration of the loop": "循环本次迭代的值",
  "Step Size": "步长",
  "The spacing of each value in the output range.": "输出范围内每个值的间距。",
  "Loop Range (Float)": "循环范围（浮点）",
  "Loop from a start to an end value, including ('through') that end value, divided into a fixed number of steps.": "从起始值循环到结束值（包含结束值），并分为固定数量的步数。",
  "end - start": "end - start",
  "count - 1": "count - 1",
  "(end - start) / (count - 1)": "(end - start) / (count - 1)",
  "index < stop": "index < stop",
  "index * delta": "index * delta",
  "start + (index * delta)": "start + (index * delta)",
  "in %d steps": "分 %d 步",
  "Loop From %s Through %s%s": "从 %s 循环到 %s%s",
  "Loop Through Float Range": "遍历浮点范围",
  "From": "从",
  "This will be the first value emitted (start)": "这将是发射的第一个值（起点）",
  "Increment Value by this amount each time through the loop": "每轮循环将值增加此数量",
  "Loop Range (Integer)": "循环范围（整数）",
  "Loop from a start to an end value, optionally including ('through') or excluding ('until') that end value. Equivalent to a for() loop in code.": "从起始值循环到结束值，可选择包含（through）或不包含（until）该结束值。等效于代码中的 for() 循环。",
  "Include End Value": "包含结束值",
  "Do we include the last value as an emitted value ('through') or do we stop without emitting that value ('until')?<br><br>Examples:<br>'1 until 5': [ 1, 2, 3, 4 ]<br>'1 through 5': [ 1, 2, 3, 4, 5 ]": "最后一个值是作为发射值包含在内（through），还是不发射该值就停止（until）？<br><br>示例：<br>'1 until 5'：[ 1, 2, 3, 4 ]<br>'1 through 5'：[ 1, 2, 3, 4, 5 ]",
  "step > 0": "step > 0",
  "step < 0": "step < 0",
  "stop > index": "stop > index",
  "step > 0 && index < stop": "step > 0 && index < stop",
  "step < 0 && index > stop": "step < 0 && index > stop",
  "by %d": "步长 %d",
  "Loop Through Integer Range": "遍历整数范围",
  "Loop From %s Until %s%s": "从 %s 循环至（不含）%s%s",
  "Loop Until Integer Range": "循环至整数范围",
  "Through (included)": "到（包含）",
  "Until (not included)": "至（不包含）",
  "This will be the last value emitted (stop)": "这将是发射的最后一个值（终点）",
  "This will be ONE BEFORE the last value emitted (stop)": "这将是发射的最后一个值的前一个值（终点）",
  "Fires a series of child cursors at the specified times.": "在指定时间发射一系列子游标。",
  "Wait for Children": "等待子游标",
  "This node will always wait for the last event time. Should we also wait for the completion child cursors before running the 'Completed' outflow, or should it ignore them?": "此节点将始终等待最后一个事件时间。在运行“已完成”出流之前，是否还应等待子游标完成，还是忽略它们？",
  "The time in seconds measured from the end of the prior section.": "以上一节末尾为基准的秒数。",
  "Optional for display only.": "仅用于显示，可选。",
  "Followed when the Timeline is finished without interruption.": "当时间线未被中断地完成时采用该出流。",
  "Event @ %0.1fs": "事件 @ %0.1fs",
  "Time From Start": "自起点的时间",
  "Time From Previous": "自上一项的时间",
  "Call External Graph Input": "调用外部图输入",
  "Calls an Input in an instance of another graph.": "调用另一个图实例中的输入。",
  "NOTE: Only applies when the target Input yields.": "注意：仅在目标输入让出时适用。",
  "External Input": "外部输入",
  "Game Blackboard": "游戏黑板",
  "Instead of calling an Input on an Entity, call it on the associated Game Blackboard.": "不在实体上调用输入，而是在关联的游戏黑板上调用。",
  "Target Graph": "目标图",
  "Target entity (pulse graph) to have this Input invoked": "要调用此输入的目标实体（Pulse 图）",
  "External Call \"%s\"": "外部调用 \"%s\"",
  "No Blackboard (Use Entity)": "无黑板（使用实体）",
  "Failed to load compiled asset for '%s'. Possible compile failure.": "为 '%s' 加载已编译资产失败。可能是编译失败。",
  "This domain (%s) and external domain (%s) mismatch": "此域（%s）与外部域（%s）不匹配",
  "Unknown Input '%s'": "未知的输入 '%s'",
  "Call Input": "调用输入",
  "Invoke an Input within this graph.": "在此图中调用一个输入。",
  "NOTE: Only applies when the target Input doesn't complete immediately.": "注意：仅在目标输入不会立即完成时适用。",
  "Call <unbound>": "调用 <未绑定>",
  "Call %s": "调用 %s",
  "Fire %s": "触发 %s",
  "%s<br><br><b>%s:</b> %s": "%s<br><br><b>%s：</b>%s",
  "Create Temporary Variable": "创建临时变量",
  "Creates a new temporary variable that is scoped to this flow of execution. Any node after this one should be able to access this variable. To use in an expression, prefix with '@'.": "创建一个作用域限于此执行流的新临时变量。此节点之后的任何节点都应能访问此变量。在表达式中使用时，需加前缀 '@'。",
  "Temporary variable name is empty": "临时变量名称为空",
  "Duplicate name '%s'. Please choose a different name. See node properties for links to the prior name source.": "名称 '%s' 重复。请选择其他名称。有关先前名称来源的链接，请查看节点属性。",
  "Duplicate Name!": "名称重复！",
  "Debug log message": "调试日志消息",
  "Debug Log": "调试日志",
  "For printing debug info": "用于打印调试信息",
  "Broadcast by Entity Name": "按实体名称广播",
  "Fire at all entities with the desired name (standard Hammer behavior).": "向所有具有所需名称的实体触发（标准 Hammer 行为）。",
  "Single Entity Handle": "单个实体句柄",
  "Fire at a specific entity referenced by the given handle.": "向给定句柄引用的特定实体触发。",
  "Entity I/O Input Parameter": "实体 I/O 输入参数",
  "Fire Entity Input": "触发实体输入",
  "Trigger an Entity I/O input on a particular entity or all entities of a given name.": "在特定实体或所有同名实体上触发实体 I/O 输入。",
  "Fire Mode": "触发模式",
  "Controls the method of dispatch. Options are:<br><br><b>Broadcast by Entity Name</b>: Fire at all entities with the desired name (standard Hammer behavior).<br><br><b>Single Entity Handle</b>: Fire at a specific entity referenced by the given handle.": "控制分发方式。选项有：<br><br><b>按实体名称广播</b>：向所有具有所需名称的实体触发（标准 Hammer 行为）。<br><br><b>单个实体句柄</b>：向给定句柄引用的特定实体触发。",
  "Fire '%s'": "触发 '%s'",
  "'%s' is not a known input": "'%s' 不是已知的输入",
  "unknown input '%s' - falling back to string ent_fire param by default": "未知输入 '%s' - 默认回退到字符串 ent_fire 参数",
  "Using a 'Parent Map Entity' Target with 'Single Entity Handle' Fire Mode will only find ONE Entity!": "将“父地图实体”目标与“单个实体句柄”触发模式一起使用只会找到一个实体！",
  "%s<br><br><b>%s:</b> %s (<i>%s</i>)": "%s<br><br><b>%s：</b>%s（<i>%s</i>）",
  "Fire Public Output": "触发公共输出",
  "Signal an output event that this graph publishes to the outside world.": "发出此图向外界发布的输出事件信号。",
  "Output Name": "输出名称",
  "Fire Output: %s": "触发输出：%s",
  "Fire Output: <unbound>": "触发输出：<未绑定>",
  "Entity Parent": "实体父级",
  "Follow Entity (Merge)": "跟随实体（合并）",
  "Bone merges this entity to a parent entity. Call again passing nothing to end the bone merge.": "将此实体骨骼合并到父实体。再次调用并传空即可结束骨骼合并。",
  "Bone or Attachment Point Name (Parent)": "骨骼或附加点名称（父级）",
  "Bone or Attachment Point Name (Child)": "骨骼或附加点名称（子级）",
  "If set and the attachment point is found in the child, use the attachment point's offset & angles": "如果设置且在子级中找到该附加点，则使用该附加点的偏移与角度",
