  "Internal error: No retval for '%s' (%s)": "内部错误：'%s'（%s）没有返回值",
  "Unknown type for first argument": "第一个参数的类型未知",
  "Unknown type for second argument": "第二个参数的类型未知",
  "This operator not supported for argument types (%s,%s)": "此运算符不支持参数类型（%s,%s）",
  "Invalid register for arg: %s": "参数的寄存器无效：%s",
  "Unknown type for argument": "参数的类型未知",
  "Logical Not !": "逻辑非 !",
  "Boolean inverse - true converts to false and false converts to true.<br>Represented in expressions as <tt>!VALUE</tt>": "布尔反转 - 真变为假，假变为真。<br>在表达式中表示为 <tt>!值</tt>",
  "Negative -": "取负 -",
  "Arithmetic negative of a number.<br>Represented in expressions as <tt>-VALUE</tt>": "数值的算术负值。<br>在表达式中表示为 <tt>-值</tt>",
  "Add +": "相加 +",
  "Add two numbers together, or concatenate (join) two strings. If one input is a string, will convert the other to a string.<br>Represented in expressions as <tt>VALUE1 + VALUE2</tt>": "将两个数字相加，或连接（拼接）两个字符串。如果一个输入是字符串，则会将另一个转换为字符串。<br>在表达式中表示为 <tt>值1 + 值2</tt>",
  "Subtract -": "相减 -",
  "Subtract two numbers.<br>Represented in expressions as <tt>VALUE1 - VALUE2</tt>": "两个数字相减。<br>在表达式中表示为 <tt>值1 - 值2</tt>",
  "Multiply *": "相乘 *",
  "Multiply two numbers.<br>Represented in expressions as <tt>VALUE1 * VALUE2</tt>": "两个数字相乘。<br>在表达式中表示为 <tt>值1 * 值2</tt>",
  "Divide /": "相除 /",
  "Divide one number by another.<br>Represented in expressions as <tt>VALUE1 / VALUE2</tt>": "一个数除以另一个数。<br>在表达式中表示为 <tt>值1 / 值2</tt>",
  "Modulo %": "取模 %",
  "The remainder when the first number is divided by the second, also called mod or modulus.<br>Represented in expressions as <tt>VALUE1 % VALUE2</tt>": "第一个数除以第二个数的余数，也称取模或模运算。<br>在表达式中表示为 <tt>值1 % 值2</tt>",
  "Less Than <": "小于 <",
  "True if the first number is less than the second.<br>Represented in expressions as <tt>VALUE1 < VALUE2</tt>": "如果第一个数小于第二个数则为真。<br>在表达式中表示为 <tt>值1 < 值2</tt>",
  "Less Or Equal <=": "小于等于 <=",
  "True if the first number is less than or equal to the second.<br>Represented in expressions as <tt>VALUE1 <= VALUE2</tt>": "如果第一个数小于或等于第二个数则为真。<br>在表达式中表示为 <tt>值1 <= 值2</tt>",
  "Greater Than >": "大于 >",
  "True if the first number is greater than the second.<br>Represented in expressions as <tt>VALUE1 > VALUE2</tt>": "如果第一个数大于第二个数则为真。<br>在表达式中表示为 <tt>值1 > 值2</tt>",
  "Greater Or Equal >=": "大于等于 >=",
  "True if the first number is greater than or equal to the second.<br>Represented in expressions as VALUE1 >= VALUE2</tt>": "如果第一个数大于或等于第二个数则为真。<br>在表达式中表示为 值1 >= 值2</tt>",
  "Equal ==": "等于 ==",
  "True if the two values are equal.<br>Represented in expressions as <tt>VALUE1 == VALUE2</tt>": "如果两个值相等则为真。<br>在表达式中表示为 <tt>值1 == 值2</tt>",
  "Not Equal !=": "不等于 !=",
  "True if the two values are not equal.<br>Represented in expressions as <tt>VALUE1 != VALUE2</tt>": "如果两个值不相等则为真。<br>在表达式中表示为 <tt>值1 != 值2</tt>",
  "Logical And &&": "逻辑与 &&",
  "True only if both values are true.<br>Represented in expressions as <tt>VALUE1 && VALUE2</tt>": "仅当两个值都为真时才为真。<br>在表达式中表示为 <tt>值1 && 值2</tt>",
  "Logical Or ||": "逻辑或 ||",
  "True if either value is true.<br>Represented in expressions as <tt>VALUE1 || VALUE2</tt>": "只要任一值为真即为真。<br>在表达式中表示为 <tt>值1 || 值2</tt>",
  "Ternary Conditional": "三元条件",
  "Returns one of two values depending on a boolean condition.\nRepresented in expressions as <tt>CONDITION ? TRUE_VALUE : FALSE_VALUE</tt>": "根据布尔条件返回两个值之一。\n在表达式中表示为 <tt>条件 ? 真值 : 假值</tt>",
  "No expr alias for '%s'": "'%s' 没有表达式别名",
  "Copy a value without modification": "不加修改地复制一个值",
  "Cannot handle argument type '%s' in '%s'": "无法在 '%s' 中处理参数类型 '%s'",
  "Cannot handle argument types '%s' and '%s' in '%s'": "无法在 '%s' 中处理参数类型 '%s' 和 '%s'",
  "Note": "便签",
  "An independent note with no influence on other nodes.": "对其他节点没有影响的独立便签。",
  "Outline": "轮廓",
  "A note with a border to be placed around other nodes. Fully surrounded nodes will stick to the note.": "带有边框、可放置在其他节点周围的便签。被完全包围的节点将吸附到该便签。",
  "Write comments on the canvas and optionally annotate regions of related nodes. Keywords: sticky, block, note.": "在画布上书写注释，并可选择为相关节点区域添加标注。关键词：sticky、block、note。",
  "Object to cast": "要转换的对象",
  "Cast Result": "转换结果",
  "Object of the appropriate type, if valid.": "如果有效，则为相应类型的对象。",
  "Cast": "类型转换",
  "Test if an object is of the required type. If so, use that result as an object of the required type. Keywords: coerce, reinterpret.": "测试对象是否为所需类型。如果是，则将该结果用作所需类型的对象。关键词：coerce、reinterpret。",
  "Destination Type": "目标类型",
  "Could not determine type of outparam Result": "无法确定输出参数“结果”的类型",
  "Could not compile inparam Source": "无法编译输入参数“源”",
  "Cast to %s": "转换为 %s",
  "Fire Child Cursors": "发射子游标",
  "Fires multiple child cursors simultaneously, and optionally waits for completion. Similar to Timeline or Parallel Branch. This will split execution into many simultaneous branches.": "同时发射多个子游标，并可选择等待完成。类似于时间线或并行分支。这会将执行拆分为多个同时进行的分支。",
  "Wait for Child Cursors": "等待子游标",
  "This call mode applies to all child cursors.": "此调用模式适用于所有子游标。",
  "Num Child Cursors": "子游标数量",
  "Count of child cursors to spawn.": "要生成的子游标数量。",
  "Wakes this node and ignores any child cursors which are still executing.": "唤醒此节点，并忽略仍在执行的任何子游标。",
  "Followed when the child cursors are finished without interruption.": "当子游标未被中断地完成时采用该出流。",
  "Child %d": "子游标 %d",
  "Child%d": "子游标%d",
  "When evaluating these requirements, how do we aggregate the results?": "评估这些需求时，应如何聚合结果？",
  "Fail Behavior": "失败行为",
  "If these requirements fail, what does the cursor do? If connected to a selector, we MUST skip downstream nodes.": "如果这些需求失败，游标该做什么？如果连接到选择器，则必须跳过下游节点。",
  "Requirement": "需求",
  "Requirement '%s' is not compatible with the connected selector": "需求 '%s' 与所连接的选择器不兼容",
  "Node is connected to a selector, but it has no requirements! If this is intentional, this must be the last exit.": "节点连接到选择器，但它没有任何需求！如果这是有意为之，则这必须是最后一个出口。",
  "The node is executed only if this expression evaluates to True.": "只有当此表达式求值为真时，节点才会执行。",
  "Cannot find any inflows for requirement check": "找不到任何可供需求检查的入流",
  "Only cells are supported right now, sorry": "目前仅支持单元，抱歉",
