  "\" must be unique within": "\" 必须在…内唯一",
  "Note that enum values use C++ scoping rules, meaning that enum values are siblings of their type, not children of it.  Therefore, \"": "注意，枚举值遵循 C++ 作用域规则，即枚举值是其类型的同级而非子级。因此，\"",
  "Fields in the same oneof must be defined consecutively. \"$0\" cannot be defined before the completion of the \"$1\" oneof definition.": "同一 oneof 中的字段必须连续定义。\"$0\" 不能在 \"$1\" oneof 定义完成之前定义。",
