  "MessageSets cannot have fields, only extensions.": "MessageSet 不能有字段，只能有扩展。",
  "map_entry should not be set explicitly. Use map<KeyType, ValueType> instead.": "不应显式设置 map_entry。请改用 map<KeyType, ValueType>。",
