  "Tried to replace animations from model %s with no anim groups!": "试图替换模型 %s 的动画，但没有任何动画组！",
  "Model conversion: %d conversions in %.3fsec (%.3fms each)": "模型转换：%d 次转换，用时 %.3f 秒（每次 %.3f 毫秒）",
  "Half": "半值",
  "Playhead": "播放头",
  "Drop": "落点",
  "Jitter": "抖动",
  "Stagger": "错开",
  "Steady": "匀速",
  "Ramp": "斜坡",
  "Default: Blend each control towards that control's default/neutral value": "默认：将每个控制器混合至该控制器的默认/中性值",
  "Zero: Blend each control towards 0.0": "归零：将每个控制器混合至 0.0",
  "Half: Blend each control towards 0.5": "半值：将每个控制器混合至 0.5",
  "One: Blend each control towards 1.0": "满值：将每个控制器混合至 1.0",
  "Playhead: Blend each control towards that control's current value": "播放头：将每个控制器混合至该控制器的当前值",
  "In: Blend each control towards that control's value at the start of the time selection": "入点：将每个控制器混合至该控制器在时间选择起点处的值",
  "Out: Blend each control towards that control's value at the end of the time selection": "出点：将每个控制器混合至该控制器在时间选择终点处的值",
  "Paste: Blend each control towards the values previously copied into the clipboard": "粘贴：将每个控制器混合至先前复制到剪贴板的值",
  "Drop: Blend each control towards that control's values prior to starting the floating modification layer": "落点：将每个控制器混合至浮动修改层开始前该控制器的值",
  "Jitter: Blend each control towards a copy of the control's values that have had noise added to them": "抖动：将每个控制器混合至加入噪声后的控制器值副本",
  "Smooth: Blend each control towards a smoothed copy of the control's values": "平滑：将每个控制器混合至控制器值的平滑副本",
  "Stagger: Retime each control by a random amount, to offset them from each other": "错开：以随机量重新定时每个控制器，使它们彼此错开",
  "Hold: Retime each control by shifting any animation in the falloff towards the hold region": "保持：通过将衰减区内的动画向保持区移动来重新定时每个控制器",
  "Release: Retime each control by shifting any animation in the falloff away from the hold region": "释放：通过将衰减区内的动画向远离保持区的方向移动来重新定时每个控制器",
  "Steady: Retime each control's animation towards having a constant velocity": "匀速：重新定时每个控制器的动画，使其趋于恒定速度",
  "Ramp: Blend each control towards a linear falloff between the start and end of the time selection's hold region": "斜坡：将每个控制器混合至时间选择保持区起止之间的线性衰减",
  "Spline: Blend each control towards a spline fitted through the control's values at the bookmarked times": "样条：将每个控制器混合至穿过书签时刻控制器值的拟合样条",
  "Round: Blend each control towards a spline fitted through the four time selection times": "圆角：将每个控制器混合至穿过四个时间选择时刻的拟合样条",
