  "Clear Controls Drawn As Bones Override": "清除控制器“绘制为骨骼”覆盖",
  "Some of the selected controls are locked to controls outside the selection.\nDo you want those controls to be unlocked before copying animation sets\nand relocked again afterwards, or do you want to cancel the copy?\nContinuing will resample the original animation data for any locked controls,\nbut should be otherwise safe to do.": "部分所选控制器锁定到了选择范围之外的控制器。\n是否要在复制动画集前解锁这些控制器并在之后重新锁定，\n还是取消复制？\n继续执行将对所有锁定的控制器重新采样原始动画数据，\n但除此之外应当是安全的。",
  "Set Control Drawn As Handles": "将控制器设为绘制为手柄",
  "Clear Controls In Group Drawn As Bones Override": "清除组内控制器“绘制为骨骼”覆盖",
