  "Auto-attach rigs": "自动附着绑定装置",
  "Auto-attach rig was only able to attach some rigs, and not others. More information may be available on the console, once you've closed this dialog.": "自动附着绑定装置只附着了部分装置。关闭此对话框后，更多信息可能会显示在控制台上。",
  "Auto-Attach Rigs Warning": "自动附着绑定装置警告",
