  "particle system": "粒子系统",
  "Game Camera Animation Exported": "游戏相机动画已导出",
  "To sync camera with demo, paste the following into vconsole, line by line:\n(or it may be easier to add buttons for them in vconsole's convar helper)": "要将相机与录像同步，请将以下内容逐行粘贴到 vconsole 中：\n（也可以在 vconsole 的 ConVar 助手中为它们添加按钮，会更方便）",
  "Export Animations": "导出动画",
  "playdemo %1\ndemo_goto %2 pause\ndemo_resume; %3 %4": "playdemo %1\ndemo_goto %2 pause\ndemo_resume; %3 %4",
  "The selected camera has locked controls or constraints.\nDo you want to continue and unlock controls and/or bake constraints during export?\n(controls will be re-locked, and constraints re-added automatically after export)": "所选相机存在锁定的控制器或约束。\n是否继续，并在导出期间解锁控制器和/或烘焙约束？\n（导出后控制器将重新锁定，约束将自动重新添加）",
  "Game Camera Animation Files (*.txt)": "游戏相机动画文件 (*.txt)",
  "Export Game Camera Animation": "导出游戏相机动画",
  "Skipping animationsets with locked controls or constraints on them.": "跳过带有锁定控制器或约束的动画集。",
  "Import Animations": "导入动画",
  "Failed to save file %1": "保存文件 %1 失败",
  "Some of the selected animationsets have locked controls or constraints.\nDo you want to continue and unlock controls and/or bake constraints during export?\n(controls will be re-locked, and constraints re-added automatically after export)": "部分所选动画集存在锁定的控制器或约束。\n是否继续，并在导出期间解锁控制器和/或烘焙约束？\n（导出后控制器将重新锁定，约束将自动重新添加）",
  "No selected animationset found without locked transform controls.": "未找到没有锁定变换控制器的所选动画集。",
  "No animation set available": "没有可用的动画集",
  "Unable to create IK rig for locked controls - unlock the controls and try again.": "无法为锁定的控制器创建 IK 装置 - 请解锁控制器后重试。",
  "Animation Files (*.dmx *.fbx);;All Files (*.*)": "动画文件 (*.dmx *.fbx);;所有文件 (*.*)",
  "Unable to create IK rig for bones that are too close to being in a straight line:\n\t'%s' -> '%s' -> '%s'\nTry bending the mid bone, or scrub to another time at which the bones aren't in line, and apply the rig again.": "无法为太接近共线状态的骨骼创建 IK 装置：\n\t'%s' -> '%s' -> '%s'\n请尝试弯曲中间骨骼，或拖动到骨骼不共线的其他时刻，然后重新应用装置。",
  "Create IK Rig": "创建 IK 装置",
  "Unable To Create IK Rig": "无法创建 IK 装置",
  "Failed to calculate IK pole vector from bind pose for '%s' of %s - trying current pose...": "无法为 %2$s 的 '%1$s' 从绑定姿势计算 IK 极向矢量 - 正在尝试当前姿势……",
  "IK constraint - %s": "IK 约束 - %s",
  "Unable to create IK constraint. Do you already have IK constraints on these bones?": "无法创建 IK 约束。这些骨骼上是否已有 IK 约束？",
  "IK pole - %s": "IK 极向 - %s",
  "IK handle - %s": "IK 手柄 - %s",
  "Create Spline Rig": "创建样条装置",
