  "Unable to create spline rig for locked controls - unlock the controls and try again.": "无法为锁定的控制器创建样条装置 - 请解锁控制器后重试。",
  "Unable To Create Spline Rig": "无法创建样条装置",
  "Unable to create spline constraint.": "无法创建样条约束。",
