  "%s Constraint - %s": "%s 约束 - %s",
  "Unable to create all requested constraints.\nMore information may be available on the console, once you've closed this dialog.": "无法创建所有请求的约束。\n关闭此对话框后，更多信息可能会显示在控制台上。",
  "Can't constrain '%s' to '%s', since there is already a child, lock or constraint dependency in the other direction.": "无法将 '%s' 约束到 '%s'，因为反方向已存在子级、锁定或约束依赖。",
  "Can't constrain '%s', since it is already locked or constrained.": "无法约束 '%s'，因为它已被锁定或约束。",
